<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Matiyu Suran</para>
  <para style="toc1">Matiyu ka Isa la Ko Kibaro Ɲuma Mɛn Sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matiyu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Matiyu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Matiyu ka Isa la Ko Kibaro Ɲuma Mɛn Sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">Matiyu ka Kitabu ɲin sɛbɛ san bisawa ni san loolu ɲɔɔn Isa yɛlɛ kɔrɔ sankolo rɔ. Mudu niisɔnkɔmirala le tɛrɛ Matiyu ri Romu jama rɔ Isa ka a kili waati mɛn na. Matiyu kɛra Isa la talibidenba do le ri. Isa ka tariku fɔ Matiyu ɲakɔrɔ, a ka wo ko sɛbɛ waati gbɛrɛ rɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Matiyu ni Marika ni Luka ka Isa la tariku ɲafɔ tumado ɲa kelen de ma. Kɔni Matiyu ka a ta sɛbɛ Judiyailu le yɛ. Wo le ka a kɛ, a ka yɔrɔ doilu sɛbɛ Judiyailu ma mɛnilu famunnin ka tamin siya gbɛrɛilu la. A fanan ka nabiya kumailu fɔ mɔɔbakɔrɔilu yɛ ka tamin doilu la kosa a wa a yiraka Judiyailu la ko Isa ra kelalaselailu bɛɛ la kumailu lakanbali.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu yɔrɔ ɲin ye Isa sɔrɔn ɲa le fɔlɔ ɲafɔla, Mariyamu dencɛ. Isa ka karan siyaman kɛ a la dunuɲaratɛɛ rɔ jama yɛ. A fanan ka kabannako siyaman kɛ. Matiyu ka wo le ɲafɔ Isa la Ingila kɔndɔ. Tɔla, a ka Isa la saya le ɲafɔ a ni a wuli ko ka bɔ saya rɔ.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Isa buruju</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin buruju le ɲin di. Isa tɛrɛ Dawuda ni Iburahima bɔnsɔn de ri.<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Iburahima ka Isiyaka sɔrɔn. Isiyaka ka Yakuba sɔrɔn. Yakuba ka Juda sɔrɔn, a ni wo kɔrɔcɛilu ni a dɔɔcɛilu. <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Juda ka Pɛrɛsi ni Serahi sɔrɔn. Woilu na tɔɔ le tɛrɛ ko Tamari. Perɛsi ka Hɛsirɔn sɔrɔn. Hɛsirɔn ka Ramu sɔrɔn. <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Ramu ka Aminadabu sɔrɔn. Aminadabu ka Nasɔn sɔrɔn. Nasɔn ka Salimɔn sɔrɔn. <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salimɔn ka Bɔwasi sɔrɔn. Wo na tɔɔ ko Rahabu. Bɔwasi ka Obedi sɔrɔn. Wo na le tɛrɛ Ruti ri. Obedi ka Jɛsɛ sɔrɔn. <verse eid="MAT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Jɛsɛ ka mansa Dawuda sɔrɔn. Dawuda ka Sulemani sɔrɔn. Wo na tɛrɛ Uriya muso le ri. <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Sulemani ka Rehobowan sɔrɔn. Rehobowan ka Abija sɔrɔn. Abija ka Asafu sɔrɔn. <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asafu ka Jusafati sɔrɔn. Jusafati ka Jehoramu sɔrɔn. Jehoramu ka Usiya sɔrɔn. <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Usiya ka Jotamu sɔrɔn. Jotamu ka Ahasi sɔrɔn. Ahasi ka Hɛsɛkiya sɔrɔn. <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Hɛsɛkiya ka Manase sɔrɔn. Manase ka Amɔn sɔrɔn. Amɔn ka Josiya sɔrɔn. <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Josiya ka Jekoniya ni dencɛ gbɛrɛilu sɔrɔn. Awa, Jekoniya tele rɔ, Babilɔnikailu ka Isirayɛlikailu mira ka wa ii ri kɛlɛkɔrɔbori rɔ Babilɔni jamana rɔ.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Isirayɛlikailu senin kɔ kɛlɛkɔrɔbori diya Babilɔni jamana rɔ, Jekoniya ka Selatili sɔrɔn. Selatili ka Serobabɛli sɔrɔn. <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Serobabɛli ka Abihudi sɔrɔn. Abihudi ka Eliyakimu sɔrɔn. Eliyakimu ka Asori sɔrɔn. <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Asori ka Sadɔki sɔrɔn. Sadɔki ka Akimu sɔrɔn. Akimu ka Eliyudi sɔrɔn. <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eliyudi ka Elasari sɔrɔn. Elasari ka Matan sɔrɔn. Matan ka Yakuba sɔrɔn. <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Yakuba ka Yusufu sɔrɔn. Yusufu ka Mariyamu furu. Mariyamu wo le ka Isa sɔrɔn, mɔɔilu ye a fɔla mɛn ma ko Ɲenematɔmɔnin.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Nba, ka bɔ Iburahima ma ka na sii Dawuda la, wo bɛɛ ladɛnnin kɛra farɔkɛ tan ni naanin de ri. Ka bɔ Dawuda ma ka na Isirayɛlikailu lawa waati rɔ kɛlɛkɔrɔbori rɔ Babilɔni jamana rɔ, wo bɛɛ ladɛnnin kɛra farɔkɛ tan ni naanin de ri. Ka bɔ ii wa waati ma kɛlɛkɔrɔbori diya Babilɔni jamana rɔ ka na a sii Ɲenematɔmɔnin na, wo bɛɛ ladɛnnin kɛra farɔkɛ tan ni naanin de fanan di.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa sɔrɔn ɲa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Nba, Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin sɔrɔnda ɲa mɛn ma, wo le ɲin di. A na Mariyamu mamiranin tɛrɛ Yusufu bolo. Kɔni sani a ye wa a sii Yusufu wara ka kɛ a muso ri, Nii Sɛniman ka a kɛ Mariyamu ka kɔnɔ ta. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Yusufu ka wo yen mɛn kɛ, a tun tɛ a fɛ ka Mariyamu tɔɔ tiɲan mɔɔilu ɲana, baa Yusufu tɛrɛ mɔɔ telennin de ri. Wo rɔ, a ka a latɛɛ ko a ri Mariyamu bila sutura bolo ma. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Ka Yusufu to a mirila wo ma, Maari la mɛlɛka ka a jɛrɛ yiraka a la sibo rɔ, ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Yusufu, Dawuda bɔnsɔn, i kana silan Mariyamu furu ko rɔ, baa Nii Sɛniman de ka a kɛ a ra kɔnɔ ta. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />A ri dencɛ sɔrɔn. I ye a tɔɔ la ko Isa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa tɔɔ kɔrɔ ye le, Allabatala mɛn ye kisiba ri.</char></note>, baa ale le kɛtɔ a la mɔɔilu kisila ii la kojuuilu ma.» <verse eid="MAT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Awa, ko woilu bɛɛ kɛnin sa Maari la kuma ri kanbali, a ka mɛn don a la keladen fisamante da rɔ ko: <verse eid="MAT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />«I ɲa lɔ! Sunkurun mɛn da a jɛrɛ lakandan, wo ri kɔnɔ ta ka dencɛ sɔrɔn. Dencɛ wo tɔɔ ri la ko Ɛmanuwɛli,» mɛn kɔrɔ le ko «Alla ye an tɛma.»<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Yusufu wulira sunɔɔ rɔ mɛn kɛ, a ka a kɛ ikomin Maari la mɛlɛka tun ka a fɔ a yɛ ɲa mɛn ma. A wara Mariyamu ta ka na a ri a wara, ka a kɛ a muso ri. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Kɔni ii ma dɛn fɔɔ Mariyamu moyira dencɛ la. Yusufu ka den tɔɔ la ko Isa.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Walijiilu ka Isa yɔrɔ ɲinin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Isa sɔrɔnda Bɛtilɛhɛmu so kɔndɔ, ni a ye Jude mara rɔ. Wo tuma, mansa Herodi siini mansaya la. Isa sɔrɔnnin kɔ, waliji doilu bɔra telebɔ rɔ ka na Jerusalɛmu. <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />Ii ka a maɲininka ko: «Judiyailu la mansa mɛn sɔrɔnda sisɛn, wo ye min? Ka an to an wara telebɔ rɔ, an ka a lolo yen. An da na a bonya diya.» <verse eid="MAT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Kuma wo fɔra mansa Herodi yɛ tuma mɛn na, a kɔndafilira, a ni Jerusalɛmukailu bɛɛ. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Mansa ka Isirayɛlikailu la sarakalaselailu ni sariya karanmɔɔilu bɛɛ ladɛn, ka ii maɲininka ko, «Ɲenematɔmɔnin ka kan ka sɔrɔn min?» <verse eid="MAT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Ii ka a fɔ ko: «A ka kan ka sɔrɔn Bɛtilɛhɛmu le, ni a ye Jude mara rɔ, baa keladen fisamante do ka a sɛbɛ ko:<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />‹Ile Bɛtilɛhɛmu, ile mɛn ye Jude mara rɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">i tɛ Jude mara soilu rɔ dɔɔmannin di de!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">Baa kuntii do ri bɔ i kɔndɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">mɛn di a janto n na jama Isirayɛlikailu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wo sɛbɛnin Mika la kitabu kɔndɔ suran 5 kuma diya 2</char></note> rɔ.›»<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Herodi ka waliji woilu kili dokon dɔ ka ii maɲininka lolo bɔ waati ma. Ii tun ka a yen waati mɛn, ii ka wo fɔ a yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Wo rɔ, a ka sila di ii ma ko ii ye wa Bɛtilɛhɛmu. A ka a fɔ ko: «Ai ye wa den yɔrɔ ɲinin koɲuma. Ai wa a yen, ai ye kela lana n ma, sa n fanan di wa a bonya.» <verse eid="MAT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Herodi ka kuma wo fɔ ka ban tuma mɛn na, walijiilu bɔra ye ka wa. Ka ii to sila kan, ii ka lolo kelen wo yen ii ɲɛfɛ, ii tun ka mɛn yen ii wara telebɔ rɔ. Den tɛrɛ ye yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ, lolo wo wara a lɔ yɔrɔ wo kun dɔ. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Walijiilu ka lolo yen tuma mɛn na, ii jusu sɛwara kosɛbɛ. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Ii don mɛn kɛra bon na, ii ka den ni a na Mariyamu yen ye. Ii ka ii ɲɔnkin ka den bonya. Wo kɔ rɔ, ii ka ii la kankirailu da laka ka sɔlifen sankɔgbɛlɛnilu labɔ ka woilu di den ma. Ii ka sanin di a ma, a ni wusulan ni latikɔlɔn sumaduman mɛn tɔɔ ko muri. <verse eid="MAT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Alla ka a lasobi walijiilu la sibo rɔ ko ii kana ii kɔsɛ Herodi wara butun. Wo rɔ, ii ka sila gbɛrɛ ta ka wa ii la jamana rɔ.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu ka Mariyamu ni Isa ta ka wa Misiran</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Nba, walijiilu wanin kɔ, Maari la mɛlɛka do ka a jɛrɛ yiraka Yusufu la sibo rɔ, ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I wuli ka den ni a na ta ka i bori ka wa Misiran jamana rɔ. I ye to ye fɔɔ n wa a fɔ i yɛ lon mɛn ko i ye na, baa Herodi kɛtɔ den yɔrɔ ɲininna a faa ko rɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Wo rɔ, Yusufu wulira su rɔ, ka den ni a na ta ka wa Misiran. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />A tora Misiran fɔɔ ka Herodi sa. Wo kɛra ka Maari la kuma kanbali, a tun ka mɛn don a la keladen fisamante da rɔ ko: «N ka n dencɛ kili ko a ye bɔ Misiran.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wo sɛbɛnin Hoseya la kitabu kɔndɔ suran 11 kuma diya 1</char></note><verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Nba, Herodi ka a ɲayen tuma mɛn na ko walijiilu ra a majuuwaya, a jusu bɔra kojuuya. A ka mɔɔilu lawa Bɛtilɛhɛmu so kɔndɔ, a ni a mara yɔrɔ bɛɛ rɔ. Ko den cɛman mɛnilu si ma tamin san fila kan fɔlɔ, ii ye woilu bɛɛ faa. Herodi danda san fila dencɛilu ma ka a bɛn walijiilu la lolo yen waati ma, ii tun ka mɛn fɔ a yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Wo rɔ, keladen fisamante Jeremiya tun ka mɛn fɔ, wo kanbalira ko:<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />«Kan do bɔra Rama so kɔndɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">kasi mankan ba ni jusumakasa mankan ba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Rasɛli ye kasila a denilu la ko la.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">A tɛ sɔn a ye masabari ka a masɔrɔn a denilu tɛ ye butun.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wo sɛbɛnin Jeremiya la kitabu kɔndɔ suran 31 kuma diya 15</char></note><verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu bɔra Misiran ka a kɔsɛ Isirayɛlikailu la jamana rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Herodi sanin kɔrɔ, Maari la mɛlɛka do ka a jɛrɛ yiraka Yusufu la sibo rɔ Misiran. <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />Mɛlɛka ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I wuli ka den ni a na ta. Ai ye i kɔsɛ Isirayɛlikailu la jamana rɔ, baa mɔɔ mɛnilu tɛrɛ ye a ɲininna ka den faa, woilu ra sa.» <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Yusufu wulira wo le rɔ, ka den ni a na ta ka wa Isirayɛlikailu la jamana rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Kɔni Yusufu ka a mɛn ko Arikilayosi le siinin mansaya la Jude mara kun na a fa Herodi nɔ rɔ. Wo rɔ, a silanda ka wa Jude mara rɔ. Alla ka a lasobi sibo rɔ ko a ye wa Kalile mara rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />A wara a sii Nasarɛti so kɔndɔ. Wo kɛni sa Alla la kuma ri kanbali, a ka mɛn don a la kelalaselailu da rɔ ko mɔɔilu ri a fɔ Isa ma ko Nasarɛtika.<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Yaya ka kawandili kɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Nba, wo waati rɔ, Yuhana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mɔɔ ye Yuhana ɲin tɔɔla fanan ko Yaya.</char></note> mɛn ye mɔɔ sunna ji rɔ, a sera Jude wula kɔndɔ. A tɛrɛ mɔɔilu kawandila ko: <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />«Ai ye tubi, baa harijeene mansaya waati ra se.» <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Baa keladen fisamante Esayi ka Yaya la ko fɔ ko:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">«Kilikan ba bɔra wula kɔndɔ ko:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">‹Ai ye sila rabɛn Faama ɲɛrɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">ka silaninilu latelen a ɲɛrɔ.›»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wo sɛbɛnin Esayi la kitabu kɔndɔ suran 40 kuma diya 3.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Nba, duruki mɛn tɛrɛ ye Yaya kan na, wo tɛrɛ ye ɲɔɔmɛ si le ri. A tɛsidinin tɛrɛ gbolojulu la. A la dɔɔnnifenilu tɛrɛ ye tonkasailu ni waa rɔ li le ri. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Mɔɔ siyaman ba tɛrɛ ye bɔla Jerusalɛmu so kɔndɔ, a ni Jude mara rɔ, a ni Juridɛn Ba laminin yɔrɔilu bɛɛ rɔ, ka wa Yaya tɛrɛn ye. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />A ri ii sun ji rɔ Juridɛn Ba rɔ, ii wa i lɔ ii la julumun na waati mɛn dɔ.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Farisi siyaman ni Sadusi siyaman tɛrɛ ye nala Yaya ma sun ji rɔ kanma. A ka wo yen ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Aile, fɔnfɔnnin na munuɲailu! Alla la kiti mɛn natɔ, yon de ka ai lali ko ai ye ai bori wo kɔrɔ ten? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Ai ye kɛwaliilu kɛ, mɛnilu ri a yiraka ko ai ra tubi. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Ai kana ai miri ka a fɔ ko a ri bɛn ka a masɔrɔn Iburahima le ye ai benba ri! Ɛn-ɛn. N di a fɔ ai yɛ ko Alla ri se kabakudun ɲinilu yɛlɛmanna ka ii kɛ Iburahima bɔnsɔnilu ri. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Sisɛn, tɛɛran tii ra wuli jiri lulu tɛɛ kanma. Jiri mɛnilu tɛ den ɲuma kɛla, woilu bɛɛ ri tɛɛ ka lafili ta rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Nde ye ai sunna ji le rɔ, ka a yiraka ko ai ra tubi. Kɔni mɔɔ mɛn natɔ n kɔ, wo fanka ka bon n ta ri. Hali ka a la sanbara mira a yɛ, wo ka bon nde ma. Ale ri ai sun Nii Sɛniman dɔ, a ni ta. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />A la baarafen ye a bolo, ka sumankisɛ ni a bu bɔ ɲɔɔn dɔ. A ri a la binbiriba magbasi gbere lagbɛ, ka sumankisɛ kɛ bondon kɔndɔ, ka bu bɛɛ janin ta la. Ta wo ye ta sabali le ri.»<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaya ka Isa sun ji rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa bɔra Kalile mara rɔ ka na Yaya tɛrɛn Juridɛn Ba dala sa Yaya ri a sun ji rɔ, <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />kɔni Yaya tɛrɛ ye a fɛ ka a ban. A ka a fɔ Isa yɛ ko: «Ile le ka kan ka nde sun ji rɔ. Nfenna i ra na n tɛrɛn ten?» <verse eid="MAT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Isa ka a jabi: «I ye diɲɛ wo ma fɔlɔ, baa a bɛnnin an ye wo kɛ sa an di Alla sawo bɛɛ lakanbali.» Wo rɔ, Yaya sɔnda ka a sun ji rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Isa sun ji rɔ wo kɔ, a bɔra ji rɔ i kɔrɔ. Sankolo da lakara. A ka Alla la Nii jiitɔla yen a kan ikomin kanba. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Kumakan do bɔra sankolo rɔ ko: «N diyanan dencɛ le ten. N sɛwanin ale la kosɛbɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Ibulusa ka Isa kɔrɔbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Nii Sɛniman ka Isa ɲɛmira ka wa a ri wula kɔndɔ a kɔrɔbɔ kanma Ibulusa bolo. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Isa ka tele binaanin (40) ni su binaanin (40) kɛ, a ye sun donna. Wo bannin kɔ, kɔnkɔ ka a mira. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Majuuwalila ka a madon a la, ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Ni ile le ye Alla Dencɛ ri, i ye a fɔ kabakudun woilu yɛ ko ii ye yɛlɛman ka kɛ buru ri.» <verse eid="MAT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Kɔni Isa ka a jabi: «A sɛbɛnin Alla la kitabu kɔndɔ ko:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:4">‹Mɔɔ ti se balola buru gbansan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:4">Ɛn-ɛn, mɔɔ mako ye Alla la kumailu fanan na ka balo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:4">kuma mɛnilu bɛɛ ye bɔla Alla da rɔ.›»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wo sɛbɛnin Sariyailu kitabu kɔndɔ suran 8 kuma diya 3</char></note><verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Ibulusa ka Isa ta ka wa a ri Jerusalɛmu, ni a ye so sɛniman di. A ka a lalɔ Alla batobonba kun dɔ, <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Ni ile le Alla Dencɛ ri, i ye i juran ka bɔ yan, baa a sɛbɛnin ko:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">‹Alla ri a la mɛlɛkailu jamari i la ko rɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">Wo rɔ, ii ri ii bolo sii i kɔrɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">kosa i sen ti nala latula kaba si la.›»<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Isa ka Ibulusa jabi: «A sɛbɛnin fanan ko: ‹I kana i Maari Alla kɔrɔbɔ.›»<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Ibulusa wara a ri koyinkɛ jan ba do kan, ka dunuɲa mansaya bɛɛ yiraka a la, a ni ii la gbiliya. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />A ka a fɔ Isa yɛ ko: «Ni i sɔnda ka i ɲɔnkin n kɔrɔ ka n bato, n di woilu bɛɛ di i ma.» <verse eid="MAT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I bɔ n kɔ fɛ Setana, baa a sɛbɛnin ko: ‹I ye i Maari Alla le bato ka baara kɛ ale kelen pe yɛ.›»<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Wo rɔ, Ibulusa bɔra a kɔfɛ ka wa. Mɛlɛkailu nara ka Isa makoilu ɲa.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka kawandili kɛ Kalile mara rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Isa ka a mɛn tuma mɛn na ko Yaya ra mira ka a bila kaso la, a ka a kɔsɛ ka wa Kalile mara rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Kɔni a ma a sii Nasarɛti so kɔndɔ. A wara Kapɛrinahumu so le kɔndɔ ka a sii ye. So wo ye Kalile dalaba dala, Sabulɔn mara ni Nafitali mara rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Wo kɛra sa Alla la kuma ri lakanbali, a ka mɛn don a la keladen fisamante Esayi da rɔ ko:<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />«Sabulɔn jamana ni Nafitali jamana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">mɛnilu ye Kalile dalaba fan fɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">Juridɛn Ba telebe rɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">Kalile mara kɔnin, siya gbɛrɛ mɔɔ siinin yɔrɔ mɛn.<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Mɔɔ mɛnilu siinin tɛrɛ dibi rɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">woilu ka kɛnɛ ba do yen.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">Mɛnilu siinin tɛrɛ saya dibi rɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">kɛnɛya bɔra woilu ma.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wo sɛbɛnin Esayi la kitabu kɔndɔ suran 9 kuma diya 1-2</char></note><verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Awa, kɛbi waati wo rɔ, Isa ka kawandili damira ka a fɔ ko: «Ai ye tubi, baa harijeene mansaya ra madon ai la.»<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka mɔɔ doilu kili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Lon do rɔ, Isa tɛrɛ ye taamanna Kalile Dala dala. A ka nakelenɲɔɔma fila yen, Simɔn (a ye fɔla mɛn ma ko Piyɛri) a ni Andere. Woilu tɛrɛ ye jɔɔ filila ji rɔ, baa ii ye sɔmɔnɔilu le ri. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye na ai bila n kɔfɛ. Ai ye jɛɛ ɲininna, kɔni n di ai karan mɔɔilu ɲininna.» <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Ii ka ii la jɔɔilu to ye i kɔrɔ ka ii bila Isa kɔfɛ.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Isa taminnin yɔrɔ wo la dɔɔnin, a ka badenma fila yen mɛn ye na ni fa la. Woilu tɛrɛ ye Sebede dencɛ Yakuba a ni Yuhana le ri. Ii ni ii fa siinin tɛrɛ ye ii la jɔɔilu rabɛnna kulun kɔndɔ. Isa ka Yakuba ni Yuhana kili. <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />Ii ka ii bila Isa kɔfɛ i kɔrɔ, ka ii fa ni kulun to ii kɔma ye.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa tɔɔ bɔra Kalile mara rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Isa tɛrɛ ye Kalile mara fan bɛɛ rataamala. A tɛrɛ ye mɔɔilu karanna ii la salibonilu la, ka harijeene mansaya kibaro ɲuma lase, ka mɔɔilu lakɛndɛya ka ii bɔ ii la jankarɔ rɔ a ni ii la fɛɛmaya bɛɛ rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Isa tɔɔ bɔra Siri jamana yɔrɔ bɛɛ rɔ. Mɔɔilu tɛrɛ ye nala jankarɔtɔilu bɛɛ ri a ma. Jankarɔ su siyaman tɛrɛ ye woilu la. Mɛnilu tɔrɔnin kojuuya farikɔrɔ dimin na, ii nara woilu ri, a ni jenatɔilu ni kerekeremansatɔilu ni kɔrɔngbɔbatɔilu. A ka woilu bɛɛ lakɛndɛya. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Mɔɔ siyaman ba bilanin tɛrɛ a kɔfɛ. Ii bɔnin tɛrɛ Kalile mara rɔ, a ni Dɛkapɔli mara ni Jerusalɛmu so ni Jude mara ni Juridɛn Ba kɔma.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s">Mɔɔ mɛnilu ye barakadenilu ri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Isa ka jama yen tuma mɛn na, a yɛlɛra koyinkɛ kan ka a sii. A la karandenilu ka ii madon a la. <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />A ka ii karan damira ko:<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />«Mɔɔ mɛnilu ka a lɔn ko ii mako ye Alla la, woilu ye barakaden de ri, baa harijeene mansaya ye ii ta le ri.<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Mɔɔ mɛnilu jusumakasani, woilu ye barakaden de ri, baa Alla ri ii jususuma.<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Mɔɔ mɛnilu sabarinin, woilu ye barakaden de ri, baa Alla ri duukolo di ii ma ka a kɛ ii ta ri.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Mɔɔ mɛnilu ye a fɛ ka kɛ telenbailu ri, ni wo lɔɔ ye gbala ii la ikomin dɔɔnnin lɔɔ ni minnin lɔɔ ye gbala mɔɔilu la ɲa mɛn ma, woilu ye barakaden de ri, baa ii ye mɛn ɲininna, Alla ri wo di ii ma.<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Mɔɔ mɛnilu ye hinala ii mɔɔɲɔɔilu la, woilu ye barakaden de ri, baa Alla ri hina ii la fanan.<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Mɔɔ mɛnilu kɔndɔ gbɛnin, woilu ye barakaden de ri, baa ii ri Alla yen.<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Mɔɔ mɛnilu ye hɛrɛ donna ii ni ii mɔɔɲɔɔilu tɛma, woilu ye barakaden de ri, baa Alla ri ii jate a denilu ri.<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Mɔɔ mɛnilu ye tɔrɔla mɔɔilu bolo ka a masɔrɔn ii ye Alla diyanan koilu kɛla, woilu ye barakaden de ri, baa harijeene mansaya ye ii ta le ri.<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />Mɔɔilu wa ai nanin, ka ai tɔrɔ, ka wuya la ai la, ka kuma juu su bɛɛ fɔ ai ma nde la ko kosɔn, ai ye barakaden de ri. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Ai ye sɛwa ka ɲaalen, baa ai ri baraji ba sɔrɔn harijeene rɔ, baa keladen fisamante mɛnilu taminda ai ɲɛfɛ, ii ka woilu fanan tɔrɔ ten de.<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dunuɲa kɔɔ a ni dunuɲa yelen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />«Nba, aile le kɔɔ ri duukolo kan. Kɔni ni kɔɔ tunya bɔra a la, a ri se tunyala ikɔ tuun wa? A tɛ foyi ɲala butun. A ri lafili kɛnɛ ma, mɔɔilu tamintɔ ri a radɔn.<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />«Aile le ye yelen di dunuɲa rɔ yan. So mɛn siinin tindi kan, wo ti se doonna. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Mɔɔ tɛ fitinna lamɛlɛnna ka a sii see kɔrɔ. Ɛn-ɛn, a ri a sii fitinnasiifen kan sa a ri yelen di bonkɔndɔ mɔɔilu bɛɛ ma. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Fɔɔ ai la yelen ye bɔ ten mɔɔilu ɲana, sa ii ri ai la koɲuma kɛnɛninilu yen ka ai Fa gbiliya, ai Fa mɛn ye sankolo rɔ.<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka mɛn fɔ Alla la sariya la ko rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />«Ai kana ai miri ko n nara le ka Musa la sariya wala kelalaselailu la kumailu bɔ ye. Ɛn-ɛn, n ma na ka woilu bɔ ye, fɔɔ ka ii kanbali. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: haan ka wa se sankolo ni duukolo ban lon ma, foyi ti nala bɔla sariya la hali sariyatonbe kelen wala a sɛbɛli den kelen fɔɔ sariya bɛɛ wa lakanbali. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Wo rɔ, mɔɔ mɛn wa jamarili ɲinilu do tiɲan, hali jamarili mɛn ma bon a tɔilu bɛɛ ko, ka mɔɔilu fanan karan jamarili wo tiɲanna, wo tii ri jate bɛɛ rɔ dɔɔmannin di harijeene mansaya rɔ. Kɔni mɔɔ mɛn wa jamarili ɲinilu labato, ka mɔɔilu fanan karan woilu labatola, wo tii ri jate mɔɔba ri harijeene mansaya rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ ko na ai la telenbaya ma tamin Farisiilu ni sariya karanmɔɔilu ta la, ai ti nala donna harijeene mansaya rɔ fewu.<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɔɔfaa ni duɲa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />«Ai ka a mɛn ko a fɔra ai benbailu yɛ ko: ‹I kana mɔɔ faa,› ko ‹ni mɔɔ wa mɔɔ faa, a ri a lɔ Alla ɲakɔrɔ a kiti kanma.› <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Kɔni n ye a fɔla ai yɛ ko ni mɔɔ mɔɔ duɲara a badenma kanma, wo bɛnnin de ka a makiti. Ni mɔɔ mɛn ka a badenma nanin ko a mɔɔ koron, mɔɔilu ka kan ka wa wo tii ri Judiya la kititɛɛ dɛkuru tɛma. Ni mɔɔ mɔɔ ka a fɔ a badenma ma ko a hankilidɔɔ, wo tii bɛnnin jahanama ta le rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Wo le rɔ, i wa kɛ sɔlifen bɔla Alla la saraka bɔ diya ɲakɔrɔ, ni i hankili jiira a la ko ko do ye i ni i badenma tɛ, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />i ye i la sɔlifen to Alla la saraka bɔ diya ɲakɔrɔ. I ye wa ka i ni i badenma tɛrabɛn fɔlɔ. Wo kɔ rɔ, i ri wa i la sɔlifen di Alla ma.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />«Ni mɔɔ do wara i ri kititɛɛla wara ko a ye a makasila i kan, ai watɔla, i ye ko bɛɛ kɛ ka kɛlɛ ban jonna. Ni wo tɛ, ni a wara i don kititɛɛla bolo, wo ri i don kaso bon kuntii bolo. Wo fanan di i bila kaso la. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />N di tuɲa fɔ i yɛ. I ti nala bɔla kaso la fewu, fɔɔ i wa ban wodi fɔnin muumɛ sarala.<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaninkɛla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />«Ai ka a mɛn ko a fɔra ko: ‹I kana kaninkɛ.› <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Kɔni n ye a fɔla ai yɛ ko ni i ka muso do ragbɛ ka kunfan a fɛ, i ra ban kaninkɛ kɛla muso wo fɛ i jusu rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Wo rɔ, ni i bolokininma ɲa kɛra sababu ri ka i lɔ kojuu kɛla, i ye a labɔ ka a lafili, baa ni i bɔnɔra i farikolo yɔrɔ kelen de rɔ, wo le ka fisa i ma sani i farikolo dafanin ye lafili jahanama kɔndɔ. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Ni i bolokinin kɛra sababu ri ka i lɔ kojuu kɛla, a tɛɛ a la ka a lafili, baa ni i bɔnɔra i farikolo yɔrɔ kelen de la, wo le ka fisa i ma sani i farikolo dafanin ye wa jahanama kɔndɔ.<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Furusa ma ɲin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />«A fɔra fanan ko: ‹Ni cɛɛ mɛn ye a fɛ ka a muso bila, fɔɔ a ye furusa sɛbɛ di a ma.› <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Kɔni n ye a fɔla ai yɛ ko mɔɔ mɔɔ wa a muso bila ka a tɛrɛn muso wo tun ma jalonya kɛ, wo tii ra kaninkɛla sila le bila muso wo kɔrɔ. Mɔɔ mɛn wa muso furusanin furu, wo tii fanan da kaninkɛ.<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ai kana ai kali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />«Fanan, ai ka a mɛn ko a fɔra ai benbailu yɛ ko: ‹I kana i kalilikan tiɲan. I wa dakan mɛn ta Alla yɛ, i ye wo dafa.› <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Kɔni n ye a fɔla ai yɛ ko ai kana ai kali muumɛ. Ai kana ai kali sankolo la, baa Alla la mansaya siifen de wo ri. <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />Ai kana ai kali duukolo la, baa Alla sen lɔ yɔrɔ le wo ri. Ai kana ai kali Jerusalɛmu la, baa Mansaba Alla la so le wo ri. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Ai kana ai kali ai jɛrɛ kun na, baa ai ti se hali ai kunsi kelen gbɛla, wala ka a fin. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Ni ai sɔnda ko ma, ai ye a fɔ dɔrɔn ko ‹ɔɔn›. Ni ai ma sɔn ko ma, ai ye a fɔ dɔrɔn ko ‹ɛn-ɛn›. Ai ye dan wo ma. Mɛnilu wa la wo kan, woilu bɛɛ bɔni Setana le rɔ.<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ai kana ai ta sara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />«Ai ka a mɛn ko a fɔra ko: ‹Ni mɛn ka ai ɲa te, ai ye wo fanan ɲa te. Ni mɛn ka ai ɲin kadi, ai ye wo fanan ɲin kadi.› <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Kɔni n ye a fɔla ai yɛ ko ai kana ai ta julu sara mɔɔ la mɛn ye a fɛ ka kojuu kɛ ai la. Ɔɔn, ni mɔɔ do ka i bolokininma gbanfudu gbasi, i ni a to kelen fanan lɔ a yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Ni mɔɔ ye a fɛ ka wa i ri kiti diya sa a ri i la duruki kɔrɔbila mira i la, i ye i la durukiba fanan di a ma. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Ni mɔɔ ka i diyagboya ko i ye a la donin ta ka kilo kelen taama kɛ a fɛ, i ye a la donin ta ka kilo fila taama kɛ a fɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Ni mɔɔ ka i tara fen na, i ye a sɔ. Ni mɔɔ ka a fɔ ko i ye i la fen sinkan a ma, i kana i ban a ma.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ai ye ai juuilu kanin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />«Ai ka a mɛn ko a fɔra ko: ‹I ye i mɔɔɲɔɔilu kanin, ka i juuilu kɔn.› <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Kɔni n ye a fɔla ai yɛ ko ai ye ai juuilu kanin, ka Alla tara ai tɔrɔbailu yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />Ni ai ka a kɛ ten, ai ri kɛ sankolo rɔ Fa denilu ri. Baa ale le ye a la tele labɔla mɔɔ juuilu ni mɔɔ ɲuma fila bɛɛ yɛ. A ye sanci nanala mɔɔ telenninilu ni mɔɔ telenbaliilu fila bɛɛ yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Ni wo tɛ, ni ai ka ai kaninbailu dɔrɔn kanin, ai ri baraji ɲuman sɔrɔn wo la? Hali niisɔnkɔmiralailu ye wo ɲɔɔn kɛla. <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Ni ai ye ai badenmailu le dɔrɔn fola, wo ye ko ba le ri wa? Ɛn-ɛn. Hali Alla lɔnbaliilu ye wo ɲɔɔn kɛla. <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Ai ye kɛ mɔɔ dafaninilu ri ikomin sankolo rɔ Fa dafanin ɲa mɛn ma.»<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s">Dɛsɛbatɔ sɔ ɲa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />«Ai ye ai janto ai jɛrɛ rɔ. Ai kana ai la telenbaya kɛwaliilu kɛ mɔɔilu ɲana sa ii ri woilu kɛni yen ai bolo. Ni ai ka wo kɛ, ai Fa mɛn ye sankolo rɔ, wo tɛna baraji foyi dila ai ma.<verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />«Wo rɔ, i wa kɛ dɛsɛbatɔ sɔla, i kana buru fɛ i mayira kanma ikomin jɛrɛmayuwailu ye a kɛla ɲa mɛn ma. Ii ye wo kɛla salibonilu kɔndɔ, a ni sila dailu la, sa mɔɔilu ri ii tando. N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: ii la baraji dan de mɔɔilu la tandoli wo ri. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />I wa kɛ dɛsɛbatɔ sɔla i bolokinin na, i bolomaran ma kan ka wo lɔn, <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />kosa, i la dɛsɛbatɔ sɔli ri kɛ dokon dɔ. Mɛn ye kɛla dokon dɔ, i Fa Alla ye wo yenna, ka i baraji.<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alla tara ɲa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />«Ai wa kɛ Alla tarala, ai kana wo kɛ ikomin jɛrɛmayuwailu ye a kɛla ɲa mɛn ma. Baa a duman ii yɛ ka ii lɔ salibonilu kɔndɔ, a ni sila dailu la, ka Alla tara, sa mɔɔilu ri ii yen. N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: ii la baraji dan de mɔɔilu la tandoli wo ri. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Kɔni i wa kɛ Alla tarala, i ye don i la bon na ka da tuun i jɛrɛ ma. I ye i Fa Alla tara ye, baa a ye yɔrɔ doonnin wo rɔ. Mɛn ye kɛla dokon dɔ, i Fa Alla ye wo yenna, ka i baraji. <verse eid="MAT 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />Ai wa kɛ a tarala, ai kana kuma siyaman fɔ fuu ikomin Alla lɔnbaliilu ye a kɛla ɲa mɛn ma. A ye woilu kɔndɔ ko ii la kuma siyaya le kosɔn ii la tarali ri lamɛn. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Ai kana wo ɲɔɔn kɛ, baa ai mako ye fen fen na, ai Fa Alla ka wo lɔn sani ai ye a tara.<verse eid="MAT 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />«Ai ka kan ka Alla tara ɲa mɛn ma, wo le ɲin di:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">An Fa mɛn ye sankolo rɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">i tɔɔ sɛniman ye bonya.<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />I la mansaya ye na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">I sawo ye kɛ duukolo kan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">ikomin a ye kɛla sankolo rɔ ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />An mako ye dɔɔnnin mɛn na bi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:11">i ye wo di an ma.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />I ye an na kojuuilu makoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:12">ikomin an fanan da mɔɔilu makoto, mɛnilu ra kojuu kɛ an na.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />I kana a to an ye manɛɛn ka bila kojuu rɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">Kɔni i ye an bɔsi Setana bolo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛbɛli kura doilu ka kuma doilu bila ɲin dɔ ko: «Baa mansaya ye i ta le ri kadawu, a ni sebaya ni gbiliya. Amina.»</char></note><verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />«Ni ai ka ai hakɛtabailu makoto, ai Fa mɛn ye sankolo rɔ, wo fanan di ai makoto. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Kɔni ni ai ma ai hakɛtabailu makoto, ai Fa fanan ti nala ai la hakɛilu makotola.<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sun don ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />«Ai wa kɛ sun donna lon mɛn na, ai kana ai ɲakɔrɔ sidi ikomin jɛrɛmayuwailu ye a kɛla ɲa mɛn ma. Woilu ye ii ɲakɔrɔ sidila sa mɔɔilu ri a lɔn ko ii ye sun dɔ. N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: ii la baraji dan de mɔɔilu la tandoli ri. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />I wa kɛ sun donna, i ye i ɲa lako, ka tulu sumaduman kɛ i kun dɔ, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />sa mɔɔilu ti nala a lɔnna ko i ye sun dɔ. Kɔni i Fa mɛn doonnin, wo ri a lɔn. Mɛn ye kɛla dokon dɔ, i Fa ye wo yenna, ka i baraji.<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nanfulu ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />«Ai kana nanfulu ladɛn ai jɛrɛ yɛ dunuɲa rɔ yan, ɲɛnbɛrɛilu ni kɔrikɔri ye tiɲanni kɛla yɔrɔ mɛn. Sonilu fanan ye da kadila ka don ka suɲali kɛ. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Ai ye nanfulu ladɛn ai jɛrɛ yɛ sankolo rɔ, ɲɛnbɛrɛilu ni kɔrikɔri ti se tiɲanni kɛla yɔrɔ mɛn. Sonilu fanan ti se da kadila ka suɲali kɛ ye. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Baa i la nanfulu ye yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ, i sɔnɔmɛ fanan ye yɔrɔ wo le rɔ.<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɔɔ ɲa le a farikolo fitinna ri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />«Mɔɔ ɲa le ye a farikolo fitinna ri. Wo rɔ, ni i ɲa kisɛ ka ɲin, kɛnɛ ri don a la, ka i kɔndɔ gbɛ. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Kɔni ni i ɲa kisɛ ma ɲin, i fari fan bɛɛ ri to dibi rɔ. Nba, yelen mɛn ka kan ka tɛrɛn i rɔ, ni wo ra to dibi rɔ, dibi ba le wo ri fewu!<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alla ko ni wodi ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />«Mɔɔ ti se ka baara kɛ kuntii fila yɛ waati kelen. Ni kuntii kɛra fila ri jɔncɛ ri do kanin ka tamin do kan. A ri do kumakan bonya ka tamin do ta la. Wo rɔ, ai ti se ai jii lala Alla ni nanfulu rɔ.<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ai kana hamin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />«Wo le kosɔn, n ye a fɔla ai yɛ ko ai kana hamin ai la dunuɲaratɛɛ la, ai la dɔɔnnin ko la; wala a faribanku la ko la, ai ye mɛn bilala a ma. Ai la niimaya ma bon dɔɔnnin ko ri wa? Ai fari la ko ma bon feriyabɔ ko ri wa? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Ai ye kɔnɔilu kɔrɔsi, mɛnilu ye ii gbanna san ma. Ii tɛ sɛnɛ kɛla, ii tɛ suman kala. Ii tɛ suman nadonna bondon kɔndɔ. Kɔni ai Fa mɛn ye sankolo rɔ, wo ye ii balola. A ye di? Ai ɲatɔnɔ ka bon ii ta ri, wo tɛ? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Yon ye ai tɛma, mɛn di se waati kelen lala a si kan a la hamin baraka rɔ? <verse eid="MAT 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />Nfenna ai ye haminna ai la feriyabɔ ko la? Ai ye waa rɔ binilu kɔrɔsi, ii ye wulila ɲa mɛn ma. Ii tɛ baara kɛla, ii tɛ feriyabɔ ladanna. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Kɔni n ye a fɔla ai yɛ ko hali mansa Sulemani mɛn kɛra nanfulutiiba ri, wo ma faanin si don mɛn keɲi ka se bin fere woilu kelen dɔ. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Nba, bin mɛnilu ye waa rɔ bi, woilu ri janin ta la sini. Ni Alla ka fereilu bila ii la, mɛnilu ye ikomin ii la feriyabɔ, Alla ti se feriyabɔ dila ai fanan ma wa, ai mɛn na lemɛniya ka dɔɔ? <verse eid="MAT 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />Wo le rɔ, ai kana hamin ka a fɔ ko: ‹An di nfen dɔɔn, an di nfen min, an di feriyabɔ sɔrɔn di?› <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Siya gbɛrɛ mɔɔilu le ye haminna ko woilu la. Ai Fa mɛn ye sankolo rɔ, wo ka a lɔn ko ai fanan mako ye fen woilu bɛɛ la. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Ai ye a ɲinin Alla la mansaya ni a la telenbaya ko le ma fɔlɔ. Ni ai ka a kɛ ten, fen bɛɛ ri di ai ma fanan. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Ai kana hamin sini koilu la. Ai ye sini koilu to sini yɛ. Mɔɔilu ye tɔrɔya mɛn sɔrɔnna lon kelen kɔrɔ, wo ri lon wo bɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s">Ai kana kiti labe mɔɔilu kan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />Isa tora kumala ko: «Ai kana mɔɔ kiti, sa ai fanan kana makiti; <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />baa ai wa mɔɔilu makiti ɲa mɛn ma, ai fanan ye kitila wo ɲa kelen de ma. Ai ye sumannifen mɛn jatela mɔɔilu yɛ, wo sumannifen kelen de fanan ye jatela ai fanan yɛ Alla bolo. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Nfenna i ye ɲamanin mafɛnɛla i badenma ɲa ma, ka a tɛrɛn i tɛ fɛrɛn kɔrɔsila, mɛn ye i jɛrɛ ɲa ma? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />A ye di? Ka fɛrɛn to i jɛrɛ ɲa ma, i ri se a fɔla i badenma yɛ di ko: ‹I ye a to n ye ɲamanin wo bɔ i ɲa ma›? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Jɛrɛmayuwa! I ye fɛrɛn bɔ i jɛrɛ ɲa ma fɔlɔ. Ni i ka a kɛ ten, i ri fen yen koɲuma ka se ɲamanin bɔla i badenma ɲa ma.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />«Ai kana fen sɛniman di wuluilu ma. Ni wo tɛ, ii ri ii kɔsɛ ai ma ka ai rafarafara. Ai kana koron kisɛ di kɔsɛilu ma. Ni wo tɛ, ii ri wo radɔn.<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alla tara ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />«Ai wa a matara foyi la, ai ri wo sɔrɔn; ai wa foyi ɲinin, a ri a sɔrɔn; ai wa da makonkon, a ri laka ai yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Baa mɔɔ si wa foyi matara, a ri a sɔrɔn; mɔɔ wa fen ɲinin, a ri a sɔrɔn; mɔɔ wa da makonkon, a ri laka a yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />A ye di? Ni i dencɛ ka i maɲininka buru ko ma, yon de ai rɔ, mɛn di kabakudun di a ma? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Wala, ni i dencɛ ka i maɲininka jɛɛ ko rɔ, a ri saa don a bolo wa? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Nba, ni aile, adamadenilu mɛn ka juu, ai kusan fen ɲuma dila ai denilu ma, wo gbɛnin de an Fa Alla mɛn ye sankolo rɔ wo ri fen ɲumailu di a mataralailu ma! <verse eid="MAT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />Wo rɔ, ai ye a fɛ mɔɔilu ye ko mɛnilu bɛɛ kɛ ai yɛ, ai jɛrɛ ye woilu ɲɔɔn kɛ ii yɛ, ka a masɔrɔn wo ye sariya ni kelalaselailu la sɛbɛli dafanin de.»<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sila ba ni sila dɔɔmannin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />«Ai ye don don diya dɔɔmanni fɛ, baa sila mɛn ye wala mɔɔ halaki diya ma, wo don diya ka bon. Sila wo taama duman. Mɔɔ siyaman ye wala sila wo le fɛ. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Kɔni sila mɛn ye wala ɲenemaya rɔ, wo don diya dɔɔman. Wo sila taama gboman. A sɔrɔnbailu fanan ma siya.<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jiri su ri lɔn a den fɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />«Ai ye ai jɛrɛ kɔrɔsi wuya kelalaselailu ma. Ii ye ii jɛrɛ kɛla ikomin saailu, mɛnilu ma juu, ka a tɛrɛn bakɔrɔn kuduilu le. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Ai ri woilu lɔn ii la kɛwaliilu le fɛ, ikomin jiri ye lɔnna a den fɛ ɲa mɛn ma. A ye di? Mɔɔ ri se rɛsɛnden tɔnsɔn kadila nɔnbɔwɔninma la wa? Mɔɔ ri se toroden kadila jiri tunin wɔninma la wa? Wo kuma tɛ. <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Jiri ɲuma bɛɛ ye den ɲuma le kɛla, kɔni jiri juu koron ye den koron de kɛla. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Jiri ɲuma ti se den juu kɛla, jiri juu fanan ti se den ɲuma kɛla. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Jiri mɛnilu tɛ den ɲuma kɛla, woilu bɛɛ ri tɛɛ ka lafili ta rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Wo le rɔ, ai ri se wuya kelalaselailu lɔnna ii la kɛwaliilu fɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛnilu ye Maari tɔɔ fɔla ii da rɔ gbansan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />«Mɔɔ mɛnilu ye a fɔla ko: ‹Maari, Maari,› woilu bɛɛ tɛ donna harijeene mansaya rɔ fɔɔ mɛnilu ye n Fa Alla sawo kɛla. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Mɔɔ siyaman di a fɔ n yɛ wo lon ko: ‹Maari, Maari, an ma nabiya kuma fɔ i tɔɔ rɔ wa? An ma jenailu gbɛn ka ii bɔ mɔɔilu fɛ i tɔɔ rɔ wa? An ma kabannako siyaman kɛ i tɔɔ rɔ wa?› <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Wo lon, n di a fɔ ii yɛ ka a gbɛ ko: ‹N ma ai lɔn fewu. Aile sariya tiɲannailu, ai ye bɔ n fɛ de!›»<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bonlɔla fila la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />«Nba, mɔɔ mɔɔ wa a tolo malɔ n na kuma la, ka wo labato, wo tii ri kɛ ikomin cɛɛ famunyani mɛn ka a la bon lɔ fara kan. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Sanci nara, ji woyenda, sanci fɔɲɔ sera bon wo ma. Kɔni bon ma be, baa a juu siinin fara kan. <verse eid="MAT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />Kɔni mɔɔ mɔɔ wa a tolo malɔ n na kuma ɲin na kɔni a ma wo labato, wo tii ye ikomin cɛɛ nalonma, mɛn ka a la bon lɔ kiɲɛ kan. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Sanci nara, ji woyenda, sanci fɔɲɔ sera bon wo ma. Bon wo bera ka tiɲan fewu.»<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Nba, Isa bannin kuma ɲinilu fɔla, a la karan ka jama kabannakoya, <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />baa a ka ii karan ikomin se ye mɛn bolo mɔɔilu kan. A ma ii karan ikomin ii la sariya karanmɔɔilu ye ii karanna ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Isa ka kunatɔ do lakɛndɛya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Isa jiira ka bɔ koyinkɛ kan tuma mɛn na, jama ba bilara a kɔfɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Kunatɔ do nara a ɲɔnkin duu ma Isa kɔrɔ, ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Maari, ni i sɔnda, a se ye i yɛ ka n nadaha.» <verse eid="MAT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Isa ka a bolo rasɔmɔn ka a maa cɛɛ la, ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «N da sɔn, i ye ladaha.» A la kuna dahayara i kɔrɔ. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I ye i janto i jɛrɛ rɔ, i kana wo ko fɔ mɔɔ si yɛ. Wa sarakalasela tɔrɔfɛ, a ye i fari ragbɛ. Wo wa ban, Musa ka saraka mɛn fɔ, ka a kɛ sereya ri, i ye wo bɔ ka a yiraka bɛɛ la ko i ra kɛndɛya.»<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka tɛsidi kuntii do la baaraden nakɛndɛya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Awa, Isa wara Kapɛrinahumu. A dontɔla so kɔndɔ, tɛsidi kuntii do nara ka a madiya ko: <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />«Maari, n na baaraden lanin bon na. Kɔrɔngbɔ jankarɔ ra a mira ka a lala. A tɔrɔnin kojuuya.» <verse eid="MAT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «N di wa a lakɛndɛya.» <verse eid="MAT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Kɔni tɛsidi kuntii ka a fɔ ko: «Maari, i ma kan ka don n wara, baa a bɛnnin tɛ n ma ko i ye don n na bon na! Kɔni ni i ka kuma kelen fɔ dɔrɔn, n na baaraden di kɛndɛya wo rɔ, <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />baa n ye kuntii do la se kɔrɔ, tɛsidi doilu fanan ye n na se kɔrɔ. N wa a fɔ mɛn yɛ ko a ye wa, wo ri wa. N wa a fɔ mɛn yɛ ko a ye na, wo ri na. N wa a fɔ n na jɔn yɛ ko a ye mɛn kɛ, a ri wo kɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Isa ka kuma wo mɛn tuma mɛn na, a kabannakoyara. A ka a fɔ a kɔfɛbilalailu yɛ ko: «N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ ko n ma mɔɔ si sɔrɔn Isirayɛlikailu tɛma fɔlɔ, mɛn lemɛniyanin ikomin cɛɛ ɲin. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />N di a fɔ ai yɛ ko lon do rɔ, mɔɔ siyaman di bɔ telebɔ ni telebe rɔ ka na i sii dɔɔnnin diya Iburahima ni Isiyaka ni Yakuba dafɛ harijeene mansaya rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Kɔni mɛnilu tɛrɛ ka kan ka kɛ Alla la mansaya mɔɔilu ri, ii ri lafili dibi rɔ kɔkan, kasi ni ɲin macin ye yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Isa ka a fɔ tɛsidi kuntii yɛ ko: «Wa i wara. I ka mɛn ɲinin, wo ri kɛ i yɛ i la lemɛniya kosɔn.» Wo waati kelen, tɛsidi kuntii la baaraden kɛndɛyara.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka jankarɔtɔilu lakɛndɛya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Isa wanin Piyɛri wara lon do rɔ, a ka Piyɛri biranmuso lanin yen. Fari makaliya ye a la. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Isa ka a maa muso bolo la, fari makaliya bɔra a fari rɔ. A wulira ka gba don ii yɛ.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Wura donnin, jama nara mɔɔ siyaman di Isa tɔrɔfɛ jena juuilu ye mɛnilu fɛ. Isa ka jenailu gbɛn a la kuma la, ka jankarɔtɔilu bɛɛ lakɛndɛya. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Wo kɛra sa Alla la kuma ri kanbali, a ka mɛn don keladen fisamante Esayi da rɔ ko:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:17">«Fen mɛnilu tɛrɛ ye an sɛɛla, a ka woilu ta.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:17">Jankarɔ mɛnilu tɛrɛ ye an kan, a ka woilu bɔ an kan.»<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Doilu ye a fɛ ka ii bila Isa kɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Isa ka a yen ko jama ba ye a laminin dɔ mɛn kɛ, a ka a fɔ a la karandenilu yɛ ko: «An ye wa dala kɔma.» <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Sariya karanmɔɔ do ka a madon Isa la, ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Karanmɔɔ, i wa kɛ wala fan fan, n di n bila i kɔfɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Isa ka a jabi: «Denka ye banbanilu bolo, ɲaa ye kɔnɔilu bolo. Kɔni yɔrɔ si tɛ Mɔɔ Dencɛ bolo, a ri a la ka a ɲɔɲɔ yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Isa la karanden gbɛrɛ ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Maari, i ye a to n ye wa n fa su don fɔlɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I ye i bila n kɔfɛ. I ye a to mɔɔ saniilu ye ii la mɔɔ saniilu suilu don.»<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka fɔɲɔ ba lalɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Isa ka a sii kulun kɔndɔ tuma mɛn na, a la karandenilu wara a kɔfɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Ka ii to ji kan, fɔɲɔ ba do wulira i kɔrɔ. Fɔɲɔ bonya kojuu ma, ji wunwannailu tɛrɛ ye donna kulun kɔndɔ. Wo ka a tɛrɛn Isa ye sunɔɔ rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Karandenilu ka ii madon a la ka a lakunun ko: «Maari, i ye an nakisi! An faatɔ le!» <verse eid="MAT 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />A ka ii jabi: «Nfenna ai ye silanna? Ai tɛ lemɛniyala kosɛbɛ!» A wulira ka ji ni fɔɲɔ makuma. Mankan masumara fewu. <verse eid="MAT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Cɛɛilu kabannakoyara. Ii ka a kɛ a fɔ ri i ɲɔɔn yɛ ko: «Ee! Cɛɛ ɲin ye mɔɔ su ɲuman de ri? Hali fɔɲɔ ni ji ye a kan mirala.»<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka jena gbɛn ka bɔ cɛɛ fila fɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Isa ni a la karandenilu banda dala tɛɛla ka se Kadara mara rɔ. Jenatɔ fila bɔra kaburu so la ka na Isa kunbɛn. Jenatɔ woilu fadiman, fɔɔ mɔɔ tun ti se taminna ye. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Ii kulera ii kan ba la ko: «Alla Dencɛ, i ye nfen ɲininna an fɛ? I nanin an tɔrɔ diya le, sani an na tɔrɔya waati ye se wa?»<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Wo ka a tɛrɛn kɔsɛ kuru ba ye dɔɔnninna yɔrɔ jan. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Jenailu ka Isa madiya ko: «Ni i ka an gbɛn, i ye diɲɛ an ye wa don kɔsɛ kuru ɲin dɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye wa!» Jenailu bɔra cɛɛ fila wo fɛ ka wa don kɔsɛilu rɔ. Ii donda kɔsɛilu rɔ mɛn kɛ, kɔsɛilu bɛɛ ka ii bori kojuuya, ka jii tindi la ka wa don dala ji rɔ. Ii bɛɛ tununda ji rɔ ka faa.<verse eid="MAT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Kɔsɛ gbɛnnailu ka ii bori ka wa so kɔndɔ. Ko mɛnilu kɛnin, ii ka wo bɛɛ lakali, katɛrɛtɛ jenatɔilu lakɛndɛyara ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />So kɔndɔ mɔɔilu bɛɛ bɔra ka na Isa tɛrɛn. Ii ka a yen tuma mɛn na, ii ka a madiya ko a ye a sabari ka bɔ ii la mara rɔ.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Isa ka kɔrɔngbɔbatɔ do lakɛndɛya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Isa donda kulun kɔndɔ, ka dala tɛɛ, ka wa se a jɛrɛ la so kɔndɔ. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Ka a to ye, mɔɔilu nara kɔrɔngbɔbatɔ do ri a ma, wo lanin gbeke ma. Isa ka a yen ko ii ra lemɛniya ko a ri se cɛɛ lakɛndɛyala. Wo rɔ, a ka a fɔ kɔrɔngbɔbatɔ yɛ ko: «N dencɛ, i sɛɛbɛ don. I la kojuuilu ra makoto.»<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Sariya karanmɔɔ doilu ka wo mɛn ka a fɔ ii jɛrɛ kɔndɔ ko: «Cɛɛ ɲin ye Alla tanama kuma fɔla.» <verse eid="MAT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Isa ka ii miriya lɔn. A ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Nfenna miriya juu ɲin ɲɔɔn ye ai jusukun dɔ? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />A ye di? Ka a fɔ ko ‹i la kojuuilu ra makoto› wala ka a fɔ ko ‹i ye wuli ka taama,› wo fila rɔ ɲuman de fɔ duman? <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Nba, n di a yiraka ai la ko a se ye nde Mɔɔ Dencɛ yɛ ka kojuuilu makoto dunuɲa rɔ yan.» Wo rɔ, a ka a fɔ kɔrɔngbɔbatɔ yɛ ko: «I wuli ka i la lafen ta ka wa i wara.»<verse eid="MAT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Cɛɛ wulira ka wa a wara. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Jama ka wo yen tuma mɛn na, ii silanda. Ii ka Alla bonya, baa ale le ka se ba ɲin di mɔɔilu ma!<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka Matiyu kili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Isa bɔra ye ka wa. A watɔla, a ka cɛɛ do siinin yen niisɔnkɔ mira diya, cɛɛ mɛn tɔɔ ko Matiyu. Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I ye na i bila n kɔfɛ.» Matiyu wulira ka a bila Isa kɔfɛ.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Lon do rɔ, Isa wara dɔɔnnin diya Matiyu wara. Niisɔnkɔmirala siyaman ni kojuu kɛla siyaman fanan nanin tɛrɛ ye. Woilu tɛrɛ ye dɔɔnninna Isa ni a la karandenilu fɛ. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Farisi doilu ka wo yen tuma mɛn na, ii ka a fɔ Isa la karandenilu yɛ ko: «Nfenna ai la karanmɔɔ ye sɔnna ka dɔɔnnin kɛ niisɔnkɔmiralailu ni kojuukɛlailu fɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Isa ka wo mɛn ka ii jabi: «Mɔɔ mɛnilu kɛndɛ, woilu mako tɛ dandalila la. Jankarɔtɔilu le mako ye dandalila la. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Kuma mɛn sɛbɛnin Alla la kitabu kɔndɔ ɲin di, ai ye wa ai miri wo kɔrɔ ma. A sɛbɛnin ko: ‹N ye a fɛ mɔɔ ye kininkinin mɔɔ ma. Wo duman n yɛ ka tamin saraka bɔ la.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hoseya suran 6 kuma diya 6</char></note> Nba, n ma na ka mɔɔ telenbailu kili fɔɔ kojuukɛlailu.»<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ii ka Isa maɲininka sun ko ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Wo kɔrɔ, Yaya la karandenilu nara Isa tɛrɛn, ka a maɲininka ko: «Andeilu ni Farisiilu dorinin sun donna. Nfenna i la karandenilu tɛ wo kɛla?» <verse eid="MAT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Isa ka ii jabi: «A ye di? Ka kɔɲɔcɛ to a duɲɔɔilu tɔrɔfɛ kɔɲɔmalɔ rɔ, kɔɲɔcɛ duɲɔɔilu ri se ii ɲakɔrɔ sidila wa? Wo kuma tɛ. Kɔni lon do natɔ, kɔɲɔcɛ ri bɔ ii tɛma. Wo lon, ii ri sun don.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />«Mɔɔ tɛ faanin kura kunkundun ta ka faanin kɔrɔ labadi. Ni mɔɔ ka wo kɛ, faanin kura ri faanin kɔrɔ sɔmɔn ka a fara. A faraɲa wo ri juuya ka tamin fɔlɔmanta la. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Mɔɔ tɛ rɛsɛnji kura burundun foroko kɔrɔ kɔndɔ. Ni mɔɔ ka wo kɛ, foroko ri fara, rɛsɛnji ri bɔ. Foroko ri tiɲan. Ɔɔn, mɔɔ ri rɛsɛnji kura kɛ foroko kura le kɔndɔ. Wo rɔ, fen si tɛ tiɲan.»<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muso jankarɔtɔ ni ɲɛmɔɔ denmuso la koilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Ka Isa to kuma ɲin fɔla, Judiya ɲɛmɔɔ do nara a ɲɔnkin Isa kɔrɔ, ka a madiya ko: «N denmuso sasan de ten ten. I ye na i bolo la a kan. Wo rɔ, a ri to a nii la.» <verse eid="MAT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Isa ni a la karandenilu wulira ka ii bila cɛɛ kɔfɛ ka wa. <verse eid="MAT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Wo ka a tɛrɛn, muso jankarɔtɔ do ye ye. A ra san tan ni fila kɛ jelibɔ jankarɔ ye a la. A ka a madon Isa la a kɔfɛ ka a maa a la durukiba dakun na, <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />baa a tɛrɛ ye a fɔla a jɛrɛ kɔndɔ ko: «Ni n sera ka n maa a la duruki la gbansan, n di kɛndɛya.» <verse eid="MAT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Isa ka a kɔfɛnin ka muso yen. A ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «N denmuso, i sɛɛbɛ don. I la lemɛniya ra i lakɛndɛya.» Muso kɛndɛyara i kɔrɔ ye.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Nba, Isa donda ɲɛmɔɔ la bon kɔndɔ. A ka fulɛfɔlailu tɛrɛn ye, a ni jama mɛn ye mankanba bɔla. <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />A ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye wa. Sunkurun ma sa, a ye sunɔɔ le rɔ tuun.» Kɔni ii ka a bɔrɔbɔ. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Jama bɛɛ labɔra kɛnɛma tuma mɛn na, Isa donda bon kɔndɔ, ka sunkurun su mira a bolo ma. Sunkurun wulira. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Mɔɔilu ka wo ko kibaro mɛn wo jamana yɔrɔ bɛɛ rɔ.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka ɲa funyen fila lakɛndɛya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Isa bɔra ye ka wa. Ɲa funyen fila wulira ka ii bila a kɔfɛ, ii ye wɔyɔla ko: «Dawuda dencɛ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«Dawuda dencɛ» wo kɔrɔ le ko Mansa Dawuda bɔnsɔn de, mɛn di se ka kɛ mansa ri a nɔ rɔ. Wo rɔ, cɛɛ ɲinilu ka a yen ko Isa ye Mansa Dawuda bɔnsɔn de ri mɛn di se ka kɛ mansa ri. Wo le ko ii ka famun ko Isa ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin de ri.</char></note> i ye hina an na.» <verse eid="MAT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Isa donda bon na tuma mɛn, ɲa funyen fila ka ii madon a la. A ka ii maɲininka ko: «Ai lanin a la ko n di se ai ɲa lakala wa?» Ii ka a fɔ ko: «Ɔɔn, Maari, an lani wo la.» <verse eid="MAT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Wo rɔ, Isa ka a bolo maa ii ɲa la. A ka a fɔ ko: «Ai la lemɛniya kosɔn, ai ɲa ri laka.» <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Ii ɲa lakara. Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ka a magbɛlɛnya ko: «Ai kana ko wo fɔ mɔɔ si yɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Kɔni ii bɔnin kɔ so kɔndɔ, Isa tun ka mɛn kɛ, ii ka wo lakali mara fan bɛɛ rɔ.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka bobo do lakɛndɛya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Cɛɛ fila wo bɔra tuma mɛn na ka wa, mɔɔilu nara cɛɛ jenatɔ do ri Isa ma wo waati kelen. Jena tun da cɛɛ wo kɛ bobo ri. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Isa ka jena gbɛn mɛn kɛ dɔrɔn, bobo cɛɛ wo kumara. Jama kabannakoyara ka a fɔ ko: «Wo ɲɔɔn ma kɛ Isirayɛlikailu la jamana kɔndɔ fɔlɔ fewu.» <verse eid="MAT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Kɔni Farisiilu ka a fɔ ko: «Jenailu la kuntii ye se dila Isa ma ka jenailu gbɛn ka bɔ mɔɔilu fɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɔɔilu kininkinin donda Isa rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Isa tɛrɛ ye soilu ni bondailu bɛɛ rataamala. A tɛrɛ ye mɔɔilu karanna ii la salibonilu la, ka harijeene mansaya kibaro ɲuma lase, ka mɔɔilu lakɛndɛya ka ii bɔ ii la jankarɔ rɔ a ni ii la fɛɛmaya bɛɛ rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />A ka jama yen tuma mɛn na, ii kininkinin donda a rɔ. Ii bɛɛ haminnin, ka tunnagboya. Ii ye ikomin saailu, gbɛngbɛnna tɛ mɛnilu la. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />A ka a fɔ a la karandenilu yɛ ko: «Suman kata ka siya, kɔni baaraden ma siya. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Wo le rɔ, ai ye sɛnɛtii madiya, sa a ri baaradenilu lɔ suman kala a la sɛnɛ rɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">Isa ka mɔɔ tan ni fila suwandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa ka a la karanden tan ni fila kili, ka sebaya di ii ma sa ii ri se jena juuilu gbɛnna, a ni ka jankarɔ juuilu su bɛɛ lakɛndɛya a ni ka fɛɛmailu bɛɛ lakɛndɛya ii la fɛɛmayailu bɛɛ ma. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Talibidenba tan ni fila woilu tɔɔ le ɲin di: fɔlɔman Simɔn, mɔɔilu ye a fɔla mɛn ma ko Piyɛri, a ni a dɔɔcɛ Andere, a ni Sebede dencɛ Yakuba ni a dɔɔcɛ Yuhana, <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />a ni Filipe ni Baritɔlɔmi, a ni Tomasi ni Matiyu mɛn ye niisɔnkɔmirala ri, a ni Alife dencɛ Yakuba ni Tade, <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />a ni Simɔn Fabaden, a ni Judasi Sikariyɔti, mɛn natɔ Isa donna mɔɔilu bolo.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka keladenilu kelaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Isa ka mɔɔ tan ni fila woilu kelaya. A ka a fɔ ko: «Ai kana wa siya gbɛrɛilu fɛ, ai kana don Samarikailu la so si kɔndɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Kɔni ai ye wa Isirayɛlikailu fɛ, wo mɛnilu tununnin ikomin saailu. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Ai wa taa fan fan, ai ye mɔɔilu kawandi ko harijeene mansaya waati ra se. <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Ai ye jankarɔtɔilu lakɛndɛya, ka suilu lawuli ka bɔ saya rɔ, ka kunatɔilu lakɛndɛya, ka jenailu gbɛn ka ii bɔ mɔɔilu fɛ. Ai ka a sɔrɔn gbansan, ai fanan ye a di gbansan. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Ai kana sanin, wala wodigbɛ, wala daɲa si bila ai la tɛmasidi rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />Ai kana bɔrɔ ta, ai kana duruki kɔrɔbila fila ta. Ai kana sanbara fila ta, wala gbeleke fila, baa baaraden ni dɔɔnnin de ka kan.<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />«Ni ai donda so ba do kɔndɔ, wala so mɛsɛn, ai ye mɔɔ bɛrɛ do ɲinin, a bɛnnin mɛn ye ai jiya. Ai ye to wo bolo fɔɔ ai bɔ waati wa se so wo kɔndɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Ai wa don wo tii la bon na, ai ye ye mɔɔilu tuwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Ni a bɛnnin ii ma ka ai ramira koɲuma, ai la duwawu ri mira ii ma. Ni a bɛnnin tɛ ii ma ka ai ramira koɲuma, ai la duwawu ri a kɔsɛ ai ma. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Ni mɔɔilu ti nala sɔnna ka ai jiya, ni wo tɛ, ni ii ti nala sɔnna ai la kuma rɔ, ai bɔtɔla lu ma, wala so kɔndɔ, ai ye ye gbangban bɔ ai sen ma. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: Alla wa mɔɔilu kiti lon mɛn na, mɔɔ woilu la kiti ri gbɛlɛnya ka tamin hali Sɔdɔmu ni Kɔmɔri ta la.<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka a la karandenilu lasobi ii la tɔrɔyailu la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />«Ai ye ai tolo malɔ! N ye ai lawala kela diya ikomin saailu, mɛnilu bilanin bakɔrɔn kuduilu tɛma. Ai ye kɛ hankilimailu ri, ikomin duuma sailu. Ai ye kɛ kojuukɛbali ri ikomin kanbailu. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Ai ye ai janto ai jɛrɛ rɔ mɔɔilu kanma. Ii ri ai mira ka wa ai ri kititɛɛ diya. Ii ri ai gbasi gbiɲɛ la ii la salibonilu kɔndɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Ii ri ai mira ka wa ai ri faamailu ni mansailu ma, ka a masɔrɔn ai ye n na karandenilu ri. Ai ri kɛ n sere ri wo rɔ, ka n na ko fɔ ii yɛ, ka n na ko fɔ siya gbɛrɛilu fanan yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Ii wa ai mira ka wa ai ri kiti diya, ai ka kan ka kuma mɛnilu fɔ ye, a ni ai ka kan ka woilu fɔ ɲa mɛn ma, ai kana hamin woilu la, baa ai ka kan ka mɛn fɔ, Alla jɛrɛ ri wo don ai da rɔ wo waati kelen na. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Baa ai ri kuma mɛn fɔ, woilu ti nala kɛla ai jɛrɛ la kuma ri. Ai Fa Alla Nii le ri kuma donna ai da rɔ.<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />«Mɔɔ ri a badenma don mɔɔilu bolo sa ii ri a faa. Fa fanan di wo ɲɔɔn kɛ a den na. Mɔɔilu ri murunti ii sɔrɔnbailu kanma, ka ii don mɔɔilu bolo sa ii ri ii faa. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Ai ri gboya mɔɔilu bɛɛ yɛ n tɔɔ kosɔn. Kɔni mɔɔ mɛn wa a muɲun haan a la ban, wo tii ri kisi. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Ni ii ka ai tɔrɔ so do la, ai ye ai bori ka wa so gbɛrɛ la. N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: sani ai ye ban Isirayɛlikailu la jamana so bɛɛ taamanna, Mɔɔ Dencɛ ri na.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />«Karanden tɛ bonyala a karanmɔɔ ri. Jɔn fanan tɛ bonyala a jɔntii ri. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Ni karanden kɛra a la karanmɔɔ ɲɔɔn di, a dan de wo ri. Ni jɔn kɛra a jɔntii ɲɔɔn di, a dan de wo ri. A ye di? Ni mɔɔilu ka kuma juu fɔ lutii jɛrɛ ma ko Ibulusa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Setana tɔɔ gbɛrɛ le ye Ibulusa ri.</char></note> le ye a ri, ii tɛ do fɔ lu kɔndɔ mɔɔilu ma ka tamin wo kan wa?<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />«Wo le kosɔn, ai kana silan mɔɔ woilu yɛ. Fen fen doonnin, wo bɛɛ ri bɔ gbɛ rɔ. Gbundu ko tɛ ye, mɛn ti nala lɔnna. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />N wa mɛnilu fɔ ai yɛ dibi rɔ, ai ye wo fɔ tele rɔ. N wa mɛnilu fɔ ai yɛ tolo kɔrɔ kuma rɔ, ai ye ai lɔ bon kun bilinin kan ka wo fɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Ai kana silan mɛn di se mɔɔ farikolo halakila kɔni wo ti se foyi kɛla mɔɔ nii la. Ai ye silan mɛn ɲɛrɔ mɛn di se mɔɔ nii ni a faribanku bɛɛ halakila jahanama kɔndɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Ai ye kɔnɔ mɛsɛn fila mayirala wodi gbanan mɛsɛn kelen na, ko di? Kɔni hali kɔnɔ wo kelen tɛ be duu ma ni ai Fa Alla ma sɔn a ma. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Ai ta fan fɛ, ai Fa ka hali ai kunsiilu bɛɛ jate lɔn. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Wo le rɔ, ai kana silan. Ai ɲatɔnɔma ka tamin kɔnɔ mɛsɛn siyaman nadɛnnin kan.<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />«Ni mɔɔ mɔɔ ka a fɔ mɔɔilu ɲana ko a ye n ta ri, n fanan di a fɔ n Fa Alla yɛ, mɛn ye sankolo rɔ, ko wo tii ye n ta ri. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Kɔni ni mɔɔ mɛn ka a fɔ mɔɔilu ɲana ko a tɛ n ta ri, n fanan di a fɔ n Fa Alla yɛ, mɛn ye sankolo rɔ, ko wo tii tɛ n ta ri.<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />«Ai kana ai miri ko n da na jususuma di duukolo kan de. N ma na jususuma di de. N nani fanmuru le ri. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Baa n nanin ka dencɛ ni a fa bila ɲɔɔn na, ka denmuso ni a na bila ɲɔɔn na, ka muso ni a dencɛ muso bila ɲɔɔn na. <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Mɔɔ juuilu ri kɛ a jɛrɛ la mɔɔilu ri.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wo sɛbɛnin de Mika suran 7 kuma diya 6 kɔndɔ.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />Kɔni mɔɔ mɛn wa a fa wala a na kanin ka tamin n kan, wo tii ti se kɛla n na karanden di. Mɔɔ mɛn wa a dencɛ wala a denmuso kanin ka tamin n kan, wo tii fanan ti se kɛla n na karanden di. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Mɔɔ mɛn ma sɔn ka a jɛrɛ gbɔngbɔn jiri ta ka a bila n kɔ, wo tii ti se kɛla n na karanden di, <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />baa mɔɔ mɛn ye a fɛ ka a nii lakisi, wo tii ri bɔnɔ ɲenemaya bɛrɛbɛrɛ rɔ. Kɔni ni mɔɔ mɛn bɔnɔra a faribanku rɔ nde kosɔn, wo tii ri a jɛrɛ lakisi.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />«Ni mɔɔ mɛn ka ai mira koɲuma, wo tii ra n mira koɲuma. Ni mɔɔ mɛn ka n mira koɲuma, wo tii ra n kelayaba mira koɲuma. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Ni mɔɔ mɛn ka keladen fisamante do ramira koɲuma ka a masɔrɔn keladen fisamante le, keladen fisamante ye baraji mɛn sɔrɔnna, wo tii fanan di wo ɲɔɔn sɔrɔn. Ni mɔɔ mɛn ka mɔɔ telennin do ramira koɲuma ka a masɔrɔn mɔɔ telennin de, mɔɔ telennin ye baraji mɛn sɔrɔnna, wo tii fanan di wo ɲɔɔn sɔrɔn. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: ni mɔɔ mɛn ka hali ji suma jilafɛ ɲa kelen di n na mɔɔ dɔɔmanin do ma ka a masɔrɔn n na karanden de, wo tii tɛ bɔnɔ baraji wo rɔ. Sika tɛ wo rɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Yaya ka a la karandenilu kelaya Isa ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Nba, Isa banda lalilikan woilu fɔla a la karanden tan ni fila yɛ tuma mɛn na, a bɔra ye ka wa Judiya la soilu kɔndɔ ka mɔɔilu karan, ka ii kawandi.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Awa, ka Yaya to kaso la, Ɲenematɔmɔnin na kɛwaliilu fɔra a ɲana. Wo rɔ, a ka a la karanden doilu kelaya Isa ma. <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />Ii wara Isa maɲininka ko: «Alla kɛtɔ mɔɔ mɛn nanala, wo ye ile le ri wa, wala an ye mɔɔ gbɛrɛ makɔnɔ?» <verse eid="MAT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Isa ka ii jabi: «Ai ye mɛnilu mɛnna, a ni ai ye mɛnilu yenna, ai ye wa woilu fɔ Yaya yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />Ko ɲa funyenilu ɲa ra laka, nambarailu ra taama koɲuma, kunatɔilu ra kɛndɛya, tologbedenilu tolo ra laka, suilu ra wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ, kibaro ɲuma ra lase bolokolonilu ma. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Sɛwa ye wo tii yɛ mɛn tɛ bilala fili rɔ n na ko rɔ!»<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka Yaya ko fɔ mɔɔilu yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Yaya la keladenilu watɔla, Isa kumara jama yɛ Yaya la ko rɔ. A ka a fɔ ko: «Ai wara nfen dagbɛ diya wula kɔndɔ? Ai ka bin gbansan de ragbɛ wa, fɔɲɔ ye mɛn namaala? Wo kuma tɛ! <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Ai wara nfen dagbɛ diya wo rɔ? Faanin dagbɛlɛn tii wa? Wo kuma tɛ. Mɛnilu ye faanin dagbɛlɛn donna, woilu ye sɔrɔnna mansabolon de kɔndɔ. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Ai wara nfen dagbɛ diya? Ii ma wa keladen fisamante do ragbɛ wa? N di a fɔ ai yɛ ko keladen fisamante le tɛrɛ. Kɔni ale ka bon keladen fisamante ri paaɔn. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />A la ko sɛbɛnin Alla la kitabu kɔndɔ ko:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:10">‹A ragbɛ, n di n na keladen nawa i ɲɛrɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:10">Wo ri i la sila rabɛn i yɛ.› <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Malaki suran 3 kuma diya 1</char></note><verse eid="MAT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />«N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: muso si ma den sɔrɔn fɔlɔ mɛn ka bon Yaya ri. Wo bɛɛ ni a ta, mɛn ka dɔɔ a tɔ bɛɛ ri harijeene mansaya rɔ, wo tii ka bon Yaya ri. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Ka bɔ Yaya la kawandili kɛ waati ma haan ka na se bi ma, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛbɛli do ye a fɔla ko: «Harijeene mansaya ye nala sebaya la.»</char></note>mɔɔilu ye harijeene mansaya kɛlɛla fanka la. Mɔɔ fadinmailu ye a ɲininna ka a mira, <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />baa sani Yaya ye na, kelalaselailu bɛɛ ni Musa la sariya ka harijeene mansaya ko fɔ. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Ni ai sɔnda ka la a la, Eliya tɔɔ mɛn ko fɔra ko a ri na ikɔ tuun, Yaya le wo ri. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Tolo ye mɛn ma, wo tii ye a tolo malɔ kuma wo la.<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />«N ye bi mɔɔilu lala nfen ma? Ii bɔnin denninilu le la, mɛnilu siinin lɔfɛ rɔ. Ii ye a fɔla ii duɲɔɔilu yɛ ko:<verse eid="MAT 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />‹A ragbɛ. An ka fule fɔ ai yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:17">kɔni ai ma sɔn ka dɔn kɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:17">An ka saya donkili la ai yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:17">kɔni ai ma kasi.›<verse eid="MAT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />«Baa Yaya nara, a ma dɔɔnnin kɛ, a ma minnin kɛ. Wo rɔ, mɔɔilu ka a fɔ ko jenatɔ le a ri. <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Mɔɔ Dencɛ fanan nara. A ye dɔɔnnin kɛla, a ye minnin kɛla. Wo rɔ, ai ka a fɔ ko wo ye noma ni dolominna le ri. Ko a la duɲɔɔilu ye niisɔnkɔmiralailu ni kojuukɛlailu le ri. Kɔni famunyali ri jo sɔrɔn a kɛwaliilu fɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka so doilu jalaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa tun ka kabannako siyaman kɛ so mɛnilu kɔndɔ, a wulira wo mɔɔilu jalakila, baa ii tun ma tubi. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />Isa ka a fɔ ko: «Korasɛnkailu, gbalo ye ai yɛ. Bɛtisayidakailu, gbalo ye ai fanan yɛ. Kabannako ba mɛnilu kɛra ai rɔ, ni woilu tun kɛra Tiri so kɔndɔ, wala Sidɔn so kɔndɔ, ye mɔɔilu tun di kojuu kɛ boloka kɛbi waati jan. Ii tun di buurigbɛ kɛ ii kun dɔ, ka kasanbɔrɔ faanin bila ii kan na, ii la tubi tɔɔmasere ri. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Kɔni, n ye a fɔla ai yɛ ko kiti lon wa se, ai la kiti ri gbɛlɛnya ka tamin Tirikailu ni Sidɔnkailu ta la. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Kapɛrinahumukailu, ai don? Ai ri yɛlɛ haan ka se sankolo rɔ wa? Wo kuma tɛ! Ai ri jii fɔɔ ka se jahanama kɔndɔ! Baa kabannako mɛnilu kɛra ai tɛma, ni woilu tun kɛra Sɔdɔmu so kɔndɔ, Sɔdɔmu so tun di tɛrɛn ye haan bi. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Kɔni n ye a fɔla ai yɛ ko kiti lon wa se, ai la kiti ri gbɛlɛnya ka tamin Sɔdɔmukailu ta la.»<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka baraka bila a Fa Alla yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Wo tuma, Isa ka a fɔ ko: «N Fa Alla, sankolo ni duukolo Maari, n ye baraka bilala i yɛ, i ka lɔnnin yiraka denninilu la, i ka wo doon mɔɔ famunyaniilu ni hankilimailu ma. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Ɔɔn, n Fa. A diyara i yɛ ka wo kɛ.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />«N Fa Alla ra fen bɛɛ karifa n na a la ko rɔ. Mɔɔ si ma Fa Alla Dencɛ lɔn bɛrɛbɛrɛ kɛ fɔɔ Fa Alla. Mɔɔ si fanan ma Fa Alla lɔn bɛrɛbɛrɛ kɛ fɔɔ a Dencɛ. Dencɛ wo wa a Fa yiraka mɛnilu la, woilu fanan di se a lɔnna.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />«Ai mɛnilu sɛɛnin ai la donin ba kɔrɔ, ai ye na n ma. N di lafɔɲɔ di ai ma. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Ai ye n na donin ta gbeleke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.29</char> <char style="fk">Donin ta gbeleke</char> ɲin kɔrɔ le ko mɔɔilu ka kan ka Isa la dunuɲaratɛɛ ɲa ta. Wo tɛ mɔɔilu kɛ jɔn di, kɔni a ye ii lahɔrɔyala ii julumun jɔnya le ma.</note> ta, ka n na karan mira, nde n jɛrɛ majiinin, ai ri niilafɔɲɔ sɔrɔn. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Baa, n na donin ta gbeleke tɛ gbiliyanin, n na donin fɛya de.»<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">Isa ka mɛn fɔ Ɲɔɲɔ Lon na ko rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />A ma mɛn ba kɛ wo kɔ, Isa ni a la karandenilu tɛrɛ ye taminna sɛnɛ do tɛma Ɲɔɲɔ Lon do rɔ. Kɔnkɔ tɛrɛ ye karandenilu la. Wo rɔ, ii ka sɛnɛsuman tɔnsɔn doilu kadi ka woilu ɲuun. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Farisi doilu ka wo yen tuma mɛn na, ii ka a fɔ Isa yɛ ko: «A ragbɛ, i la karandenilu ye ko mɛn kɛla ten Ɲɔɲɔ Lon, wo dahanin tɛ!»<verse eid="MAT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Isa ka ii jabi: «A ye di? Mansa Dawuda ka mɛn kɛ kɔrɔman, ai ma wo karan wa? Kɔnkɔ tɛrɛ ye a ni a taamaɲɔɔnilu la. <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Wo rɔ, Dawuda donda Alla la bon kɔndɔ ka buru dɔɔn, buru mɛn bilanin Alla yɛ ye. Kɔni ka a bɛn sariya ma, a ni a taamaɲɔɔnilu tun ma kan ka buru wo dɔɔn fɔɔ sarakalaselailu kelen. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Ai ma a karan Musa la sariya rɔ ko sarakalaselailu ye baara kɛla Alla batobonba kɔndɔ Ɲɔɲɔ Lon wa? Ii ye Ɲɔɲɔ Lon sariya tiɲanna ten de, kɔni wo tɛ jatela kojuu ri. <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />N di a fɔ ai yɛ ko do ye yan, mɛn ka bon Alla batobonba ri. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Alla ye a fɔla a la kitabu kɔndɔ ko: ‹N ye a fɛ mɔɔ ye kininkinin mɔɔ ma. Wo duman n yɛ ka tamin saraka bɔ la.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hoseya suran 6 kuma diya 6</char></note> Ni ai tun ka kuma wo kɔrɔ lɔn, ai tun tɛ kiti labe mɔɔilu kan, mɛnilu ma kojuu kɛ, <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />baa Mɔɔ Dencɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa ka fɔ a jɛrɛ ma ko «Mɔɔ Dencɛ». Wo kɔrɔ le ko Ɲenematɔmɔnin de. A mafɛnɛ Daniyɛli suran 7 kuma diya 13 haan 14.</char></note> le ye Ɲɔɲɔ Lon tii ri.»<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka cɛɛ bolofaanin do lakɛndɛya Ɲɔɲɔ Lon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />A bɔra ye ka wa wo mɔɔilu la salibon na. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Wo ka a tɛrɛn cɛɛ bolofaanin do ye ye. Mɔɔ doilu ka Isa maɲininka ko: «Ka mɔɔ lakɛndɛya Ɲɔɲɔ Lon, wo dahanin wa?» Baa ii tɛrɛ ye fɛrɛ ɲininna a ma. <verse eid="MAT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ni saa kelen pe ye ai do bolo don? Ni saa wo bera denka kɔndɔ Ɲɔɲɔ Lon, a tii tɛ a labɔ wa? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Mɔɔ ka fisa saa ri paaɔn! Wo le rɔ, ka koɲuma kɛ mɔɔ yɛ Ɲɔɲɔ Lon, wo le dahanin.» <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Isa ka ii jabi mɛn kɛ ten, a ka a fɔ cɛɛ bolofaanin yɛ ko: «I bolo rasɔmɔn.» Cɛɛ ka a bolo rasɔmɔn mɛn kɛ, a bolo kɛndɛyara fewu ka kɛ ikomin a bolo tɔ kelen. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Farisiilu bɔra ka wa i ɲɔɔn yen ka Isa faa ɲaɲinin.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ye Alla la baaraden suwandinin le ri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Ii tɛrɛ ye mɛn kan, Isa ka wo lɔn. Wo rɔ, a bɔra ye ka wa. Jama ba bilara a kɔfɛ. A ka bɛɛ lakɛndɛya. <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />Kɔni a ka a fɔ woilu yɛ ka a magbɛlɛya ko ii kana a la ko fɔ mɔɔ si yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />A ka wo kɛ le kosa Alla la kuma ri lakanbali, a ka mɛn don keladen fisamante Esayi da rɔ ko:<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />«N na baaraden de ten, n ka mɛn suwandi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">A duman n yɛ kosɛbɛ, n ye niisɔndiyala a la ko rɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">N di n na Nii Sɛniman nana a kan, a ri kiti ko fɔ siya tɔilu yɛ.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />A ti nala sɔsɔli kɛla, a ti nala sɔnkɔsɔnkɔla.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:19">Mɔɔilu ti nala a kan mɛnna sila kan.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />A ti nala gbala jaran dakadila, hali mɛn da ratiɲan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">A ti nala fitinna lasala, hali mɛn ta ye sala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">haan telen ye kunnafulen sɔrɔn.<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Siyailu bɛɛ ri ii jii la ale kan.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Esayi suran 42 kuma diya 1 haan 4 </char></note><verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa la fanka ma bɔ Ibulusa rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Wo kɔ rɔ, ii nara jenatɔ do ri Isa ma. Jena tun da a ɲa funyen ka a kɛ bobo ri. Isa ka a lakɛndɛya. Jenatɔ kumara, a ɲa lakara. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Mɔɔilu bɛɛ kabannakoyara. Ii ka a fɔ ko: «Mɛn di kili ko Mansa Dawuda dencɛ, ale le ɲin di wa?» <verse eid="MAT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Farisiilu ka wo mɛn tuma mɛn na, ii ka a fɔ ko: «Jenailu la kuntiiba Ibulusa le ye se dila cɛɛ ɲin ma ka jenailu gbɛn ka bɔ mɔɔilu fɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Kɔni Isa ka ii la miriya lɔn. Wo rɔ, a ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Mansaya mɛn mɔɔilu wa wuli ka i ɲɔɔn kɛlɛ, wo mansaya ri tiɲan fewu. So kelen mɔɔilu, wala denbaya kelen mɔɔilu, wa wuli ka i ɲɔɔn kɛlɛ, so wo ti nala mɛnna, bon wo fanan ti nala mɛnna. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Wo ɲa kelen ma, ni Setana ye Setana gbɛnna, a ye a jɛrɛ le kɛlɛla. A la mansaya ri mɛn wo rɔ di? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />A ye di? Ni n ye jenailu gbɛnna Ibulusa baraka le rɔ, ai la karandenilu ye jenailu gbɛnna yon baraka rɔ? Ai la karandenilu ri ai la kiti tɛɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Kɔni ni n ye jenailu gbɛnna Alla la Nii baraka le rɔ, wo ra a yiraka ko Alla la mansaya ra se ai tɛma. <verse eid="MAT 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />Mɔɔ ti se donna cɛɛ fankama la bon kɔndɔ ka wo bolofenilu suɲa na a ma cɛɛ fankama wo mira fɔlɔ ka a sidi, wa di? A wa a sidi, a ri a bolofenilu suɲa.<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />«Nba, mɔɔ mɛn tɛ n fɛ, wo ye n juu le ri. Mɔɔ mɛn tɛ ii ladɛnna n fɛ, wo ye jɛnsɛnna le. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Wo le kosɔn n di a fɔ ai yɛ: mɔɔilu la kojuuilu bɛɛ ni Alla tanama kumailu bɛɛ ri se makotola. Kɔni ni mɔɔ mɔɔ ka Nii Sɛniman tanama ko kɛ, Alla ti nala wo tii makotola fewu. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Ni mɔɔ ka Mɔɔ Dencɛ mafɔ, a ri se makotola. Kɔni ni mɔɔ ka Nii Sɛniman mafɔ, a ti nala makotola dunuɲa ɲin dɔ yan, a tɛ makoto sini natɔ fanan.<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jiri ri lɔn a den fɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />«Jiri mɛn ka ɲin, wo den ka ɲin. Jiri mɛn ma ɲin, wo den ma ɲin. Jiri ye lɔnna a den de fɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Aile fɔnfɔnnin munuɲailu! Ai ma ɲin. Ai ri se kuma ɲuma fɔla wo rɔ di? Mɔɔ jusukun fanin mɛn na, a da ye wo le fɔla. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Mɔɔ ɲuma ri koɲuma kɛ, baa wo ye bɔla a ɲuma yɔrɔ lakandannin de rɔ. Kɔni mɔɔ mɛn ma ɲin, wo ri kojuu kɛ, baa wo ye bɔla a juu yɔrɔ lakandannin de rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />N di a fɔ ai yɛ ko Alla la kiti tɛɛ lon wa se, mɔɔilu ka kuma ɲatɔnɔntan mɛnilu fɔ ii da rɔ, ii ri woilu bɛɛ fɔkun fɔ Alla yɛ, <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />baa i la kumailu ri kɛ sababu ri, Alla ri jɔ di i ma, wala a ri kiti labe i kan.»<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Farisiilu ka a fɔ ko Isa ye tɔɔmasere kabannakoma do kɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Farisi doilu ni sariya karanmɔɔ doilu ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «An na karanmɔɔ, an ye a fɛ i ye tɔɔmasere kabannakoma do kɛ an ɲana, ka a yiraka ko Alla ye i fɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Isa ka ii jabi: «Bi mɔɔilu kɛwaliilu juuman. Ii tɛ sɔnna ka to Alla kɔ. Ii ye a fɛ ka tɔɔmasere kabannakoma yen, kɔni tɔɔmasere si tɛ yiraka ii la ni keladen fisamante Junusa ta tɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Baa Junusa ka tele sawa ni su sawa kɛ jɛɛ ba kɔndɔ ɲa mɛn ma, Mɔɔ Dencɛ fanan di tele sawa ni su sawa kɛ duu kɔrɔ wo ɲa ma. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Alla wa mɔɔilu la kiti tɛɛ lon mɛn, Ninibekailu ri wuli ka sɔn la bi mɔɔilu la, baa Junusa ka woilu kawandi tuma mɛn na, ii ka tubi ka na Alla ma. Sisɛn, mɔɔ do ye yan, mɛn ka bon Junusa ri. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Alla wa mɔɔilu la kiti tɛɛ lon mɛn, Seba jamana mansa muso ri wuli ka sɔn la bi mɔɔilu la, baa a bɔra fɔɔ dunuɲa kun do la ka na a tolo malɔ mansa Sulemani la famunyali kumailu la. Sisɛn, mɔɔ do ye yan, mɛn ka bon mansa Sulemani ko.<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />«Jena wa gbɛn ka bɔ cɛɛ do rɔ, a ri yɔrɔ jaranilu taamataama kiɲɛ fufu kɔndɔ ka ɲɔɲɔ diya ɲinin. Kɔni a ri kaɲa. <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />Wo kɔ rɔ, a ri a fɔ ko: ‹N di n kɔsɛ ka wa n bɔ diya rɔ.› A wa se ye, a ri a tɛrɛn ko yɔrɔ wo rakolon de, ka sɛninya ikomin bon mɛn da firan ka a kɔndɔ rabɛn. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Wo rɔ, jena ri wa ka jena wɔrɔnwula ladɛn, mɛnilu ka juu a jɛrɛ ri. A ni woilu bɛɛ ri na ka don yɔrɔ wo rɔ ka ii sii ye. A laban, jenatɔ la ko ri juuya ka tamin a fɔlɔman na. Bi mɔɔ juuilu ta ye kɛla wo ɲa le ma.»<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa na ni a dɔɔcɛilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Nba, ka Isa to kumala jama yɛ, a na a ni a dɔɔcɛilu nara ii lɔ kɛnɛ ma, ko ii ye a fɛ ka kuma a yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Mɔɔ do ka a fɔ Isa yɛ ko: «I na ni i dɔɔcɛilu lɔnin kɛnɛ ma. Ii ye a fɛ ka kuma i yɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Isa ka mɔɔ wo jabi: «Yon ye n na ri? N dɔɔcɛilu ye yon ni yon di?» <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />A ka a bolo lɔ a la karandenilu la. A ka a fɔ ko: «Mɔɔ ɲinilu le n na ni n dɔɔcɛilu ri, <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />baa mɔɔ mɛnilu ye n Fa sawo kɛla, n Fa mɛn ye sankolo rɔ kɔnin, woilu le ye n dɔɔcɛilu ri, a ni n dɔɔmusoilu ni n nailu.»<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Sifoyila kuma kɔrɔlama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Wo lon kelen, Isa bɔra bon na ka wa a sii dala da la. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Jama ba ka ii ladɛn a laminin dɔ. Wo rɔ, a donda kulun do kɔndɔ ka a sii. Jama bɛɛ lɔnin tora gbele ma ye. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />A ka ko siyaman fɔ ii yɛ kuma kɔrɔlamailu rɔ. A ka a fɔ ko: «Ai ye ai tolo malɔ. Sifoyila do bɔra ka wa si foyi diya sɛnɛ rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Ka a to si foyila, si doilu bera sila dala. Kɔnɔilu nara woilu ta ta. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Si doilu bera farama yɔrɔ kan, banku ma siya yɔrɔ mɛn. Si woilu fɛrɛnda jonna, baa banku ma siya ye. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Tele bɔra kosɛbɛ tuma mɛn na, ii mɔrɔmɔrɔra. Ii jara, baa ii luluilu ma don duu rɔ kosɛbɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Si doilu bera nɔnbɔwɔninma yɔrɔ rɔ. Sumanilu wulira mɛn kɛ, wɔninilu fanan wulira ka ii dɔɔn. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Nba, si doilu fanan bera duu ɲuma rɔ. Suman woilu sɔnda kosɛbɛ. Si doilu ka ii ɲɔɔn kɛmɛ (100) kɛ, doilu ka ii ɲɔɔn biwɔɔrɔ (60) kɛ, doilu ka ii ɲɔɔn bisawa (30) kɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Tolo ye mɛn ma, wo tii ye a tolo malɔ kuma wo la.»<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka kuma kɔrɔlamailu la kun mɛn na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Karandenilu ka ii madon Isa la ka a maɲininka ko: «Nfenna i ye kumala mɔɔilu yɛ kuma kɔrɔlamailu rɔ?» <verse eid="MAT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />A ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Harijeene mansaya ko mɛnilu doonnin tɛrɛ, woilu lɔnnin da di ai le ma. Kɔni wo ma di ii ma, <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />baa fen ye mɛn bolo, do ri la wo tii ta kan. A ta ri siyaya. Kɔni fen tɛ mɛn bolo, hali fitinin mɛn ye a bolo, wo ri mira a la. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Wo le kosɔn, n ye kumala ii yɛ kuma kɔrɔlamailu rɔ, baa ii ye ragbɛli kɛla, kɔni ii tɛ foyi yenna. Ii ye ii tolo malɔla, kɔni ii tɛ foyi mɛnna, ii tɛ foyi famunna. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Wo rɔ, ii ka a kɛ, Esayi ka mɛn fɔ, wo ra lakanbali. A ka a fɔ ko:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">‹Ai ri ai tolo malɔ kosɛbɛ, kɔni ai tɛna foyi famunna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">Ai ri ragbɛli kɛ kosɛbɛ, kɔni ai ti nala foyi yenna.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Baa siya ɲin da ii ban famunyali ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Ii ra ii tolo gbeden</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">ka ii ɲa masidi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Ni wo tɛ, ii ɲa tun di yennin kɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">ii tolo tun di mɛnnin kɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">ii hankili tun di famunyali sɔrɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">ii tun di ii kɔsɛ ka na nde Alla ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Wo rɔ, n tun di ii lakisi.›<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />«Kɔni ai ye barakaden de ri, baa ai ɲa ye yennin kɛla, ai tolo fanan ye mɛnnin kɛla. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: ai ɲa ye mɛn yenna, a lɔɔ tɛrɛ ye keladen fisamante siyaman ni mɔɔ telennin siyaman na ka wo yen, kɔni ii ma fɛrɛ sɔrɔn ka ii ɲa la wo kan. Ai tolo ye mɛn namɛnna, a lɔɔ tɛrɛ ye ii la ka wo mɛn, kɔni ii ma fɛrɛ sɔrɔn ka ii tolo malɔ a la.»<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka sifoyila kuma kɔrɔlama kɔrɔ fɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />Isa ka a fɔ ko: «Ai tolo malɔ, ai ri sifoyila kuma kɔrɔlama la kɔrɔ lamɛn. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Mɛnilu wa harijeene mansaya kuma lamɛn, kɔni ii tɛ a famun, Ko Juu Tii nala wo rɔ, ka a bɔ ii jusu rɔ. Woilu kɛnin de ikomin si mɛnilu bera sila kɔfɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Si mɛn bera farama yɔrɔ kan, wo ye mɔɔilu le ri mɛn da Alla la kuma lamɛn, ka a mira i kɔrɔ ka sɛwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Kɔni lulu ti ye, a ni kuma wo ma sabati ii jusukun dɔ bɛrɛ bɛrɛ kɛ. Ii tɛ mɛn bakɛ lemɛniya sila kan, baa ni gbɛlɛnya ka ii sɔrɔn, wala ni mɔɔilu ka ii tɔrɔ Alla la kuma kosɔn, ii ri sila bila i kɔrɔ. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Si mɛn bera nɔnbɔwɔninma yɔrɔ rɔ, wo le mɔɔilu le ri mɛn ka Alla la kuma lamɛn, kɔni dunuɲa koilu hamin da don ii jusukun dɔ. Nanfulu lɔɔ ri ii mira ka ii magbɛrɛn kɛ. Ko woilu bɛɛ kosɔn, Alla la kuma ri mabali ii jusukun dɔ, ka kɛ ikomin sɛnɛ rɔ fen ɲatɔntan, mɛn ma a den. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Nba, si mɛn bera duu duman dɔ, wo le mɔɔ ri mɛn ye Alla la kuma mɛnna ka a famun. Kuma wo ri sabati a jusukun dɔ, ka kɛ ikomin suman si mɛn ye ɲala ka i ɲɔɔn kɛmɛ (100) kɛ, wala i ɲɔɔn biwɔɔrɔ (60), wala i ɲɔɔn bisawa (30).»<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kɔmɔɔ la maalo kuma kɔrɔlama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Isa ka kuma kɔrɔlama gbɛrɛ fɔ ii yɛ. A ka a fɔ ko: «Harijeene mansaya ye ikomin cɛɛ do la ko. A ka suman si ɲuma foyi a la sɛnɛ rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Kɔni, ka mɔɔilu bɛɛ to sunɔɔ rɔ su rɔ, a juu nara kɔmɔɔ la maalo kisɛ foyi a la sɛnɛ rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Nba, maalo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.26 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">maalo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛbɛli kɔndɔ a ye fɔla a ma ko binbiriba, kɔni yan mɔɔilu ka maalo ni kɔmɔla maalo la ko lɔn kosɛbɛ, kɔmɔla maalo ye bin juu ba le ri.</char></note> fɛrɛnda ka wuli, ka a kisɛ. Wo tuma, mɔɔilu ka kɔmɔɔ la maalo fanan yen. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Sɛnɛtii la jɔnilu wara a fɔ a yɛ ko: ‹An tii, i ma maalo si ɲuma le foyi i la sɛnɛ rɔ wa? Kɔmɔɔ la maalo woilu bɔnin min ten?› <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Sɛnɛtii ka a fɔ ko: ‹N juu do nɔ le.› Ii ka a maɲininka ko: ‹I ye a fɛ an ye wa kɔmɔɔ la maalo mabɔ sɛnɛ rɔ wa?› <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />A ka a fɔ ko: ‹Ɛɛn, ai ye a to ye. Ni wo tɛ, ni ai ka kɔmɔɔ la maalo mabɔ, ai ri maalo doilu fanan mabɔ a fɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Ai ye ii bɛɛ to ye. Ii ye wuli ii ɲɔɔn fɛ fɔɔ sumanka waati wa se. Ni sumanka waati sera, n di a fɔ sumankalailu yɛ ko ii ye kɔmɔɔ la maalo fɔlɔ ka, ka a lasidi, ka a janin. Wo wa kɛ, ii ri maalo ka ka a ladon n na bondon kɔndɔ.›»<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sɛbɛni fira kisɛ kuma kɔrɔlama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wo fanan sɛbɛnin Marika suran 4 kuma diya 30 haan 32, Luka suran 13 kuma diya 18 haan 19 kɔndɔ</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Isa ka kuma kɔrɔlama gbɛrɛ fɔ mɔɔilu yɛ. A ka a fɔ ko: «Harijeene mansaya ye ikomin bɔrɔn fira kisɛ. Cɛɛ do ka bɔrɔn fira kisɛ lan a la sɛnɛ rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Bɔrɔn fira kisɛ wo dɔɔman ka tamin fen kisɛilu bɛɛ kan. Kɔni a wa fɛrɛn ka wuli, a ri bonya ka tamin nakɔfen bɛɛ kan. A ri kɛ ikomin jiri, ka bolon bailu labɔ, fɔɔ waa rɔ kɔnɔilu ri se ii ɲaanilu lala a bolonilu la.»<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />A ka kuma kɔrɔlama gbɛrɛ fɔ ii yɛ. A ka a fɔ ko: «Harijeene mansaya ye ikomin lɛbɛn, muso ka mɛn doonin kɛ farinin muun kilo muwan ni kelen (21) dɔ ka wo kɛ dɛɛba ri. Lɛbɛn wo ka dɛɛba bɛɛ lawuli ka a funun.»<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Isa ka wo bɛɛ fɔ jamailu yɛ kuma kɔrɔlamailu le rɔ. A ma foyi fɔ ii yɛ ni a ma wo fɔ kuma kɔrɔlama rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />A ka a kɛ ten sa keladen fisamante la kuma ri kanbali, mɛn ka a fɔ ko:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">«N di kuma kuma kɔrɔlamailu rɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">Ko mɛnilu doonnin kɛbi dunuɲa dan waati la, n di woilu fɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka kɔmɔɔ la maalo kuma kɔrɔlama kɔrɔ fɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa bɔra jama rɔ ka wa don bon na. A la karandenilu ka ii madon a la, ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Kuma kɔrɔlama mɛn ye bin juu wuli la ko fɔla sɛnɛ rɔ, i ye wo kɔrɔ fɔ an yɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Isa ka ii jabi: «Mɛn ye suman si ɲuma foyila, wo ye Mɔɔ Dencɛ le ri. <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Sɛnɛ wo ye dunuɲa le ri. Suman si ɲuma, wo ye mansaya denilu le ri. Kɔmɔɔ la maalo ye Kojuu Tii la mɔɔilu le ri. <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />Juu mɛn ka kɔmɔɔ la maalo kisɛilu foyi sɛnɛ rɔ, wo ye Ibulusa jɛrɛ le ri. Sumanka waati, wo ye dunuɲa laban de ri. Sumankalailu ye mɛlɛkailu le ri. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Kɔmɔɔ la maalo juuilu ye ladɛnna ɲa mɛn ma ka janin ta la, wo ɲɔɔn di kɛ dunuɲa laban waati. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Mɔɔ Dencɛ ri a la mɛlɛkailu kelaya ka na. Mɛnilu ye mɔɔilu bilala kojuu kɛ rɔ, a ni mɛnilu ye kojuu kɛla, a la mɛlɛkailu ri woilu bɛɛ ladɛn ka ii bɔ Mɔɔ Dencɛ la mansaya rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />Mɛlɛkailu ri woilu lafili ta ba rɔ, kasi ni ɲin macin ye yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Kɔni mɔɔ telenninilu ri bonya sɔrɔn ka mɛlɛnmɛlɛn ikomin tele ii Fa la mansaya rɔ. Tolo ye mɛn ma, wo tii ye a tolo malɔ kuma wo la.»<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nanfulu dokonnin na ko kuma kɔrɔlama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />Isa kumara ikɔ tuun ko: «Harijeene mansaya ye ikomin nanfulu mɛn doonnin duukolo kɔrɔ sɛnɛ do rɔ. Lon do rɔ, cɛɛ do ka wo yen. A ka a ta ka a dokon duukolo kɔrɔ kokura. A sɛwanin ba wara a bolofenilu bɛɛ mayira, ka na sɛnɛ wo san.<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />«Harijeene mansaya ye ikomin julacɛ mɛn ye koron kisɛ ɲumailu ɲininna. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Lon do rɔ, a ka koron kisɛ ɲuma do yen, mɛn ka ɲin ka tamin. A wara a bolofenilu bɛɛ mayira, ka na koron kisɛ wo san.<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jɛɛmira jɔɔ kuma kɔrɔlama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />«Harijeene mansaya ye ikomin jɔɔ fanan, mɔɔilu ka mɛn nafili kɔɔji rɔ, ka jɛɛ su bɛɛ mira. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />A wa fa jɛɛ la, sɔmɔnɔilu ri a sɔmɔn ka a labɔ gbele ma. Ii ri ii sii ka jɛɛilu rawoloma. Mɛnilu ka ɲin, ii ri woilu bila muranilu kɔndɔ. Mɛnilu ma ɲin, ii ri woilu lafili. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />A ye kɛla wo ɲa le dunuɲa laban waati. Mɛlɛkailu ri mɔɔ juuilu rawoloma ka ii bɔ mɔɔ telenninilu rɔ, <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />ka ii lafili ta ba rɔ, kasi ni ɲin macin ye yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Isa ka karandenilu maɲininka ko: «Ai ka kuma ɲin bɛɛ famun wa?» Ii ka a fɔ ko: «Ɔɔn.» <verse eid="MAT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Wo rɔ, Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Nba, sariya karanmɔɔ mɛnilu ra karan harijeene mansaya la ko rɔ, woilu bɛɛ ye ikomin lutii mɛn ye fen kura ni fen kɔrɔ fila bɛɛ labɔla a la nanfulu lamara diya rɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nasarɛtikailu ka ii ban Isa rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Nba, Isa bannin kuma kɔrɔlama wo fɔla, a bɔra yɔrɔ wo rɔ ka wa. <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />A wara a wara so kɔndɔ. A tɛrɛ ye mɔɔilu karanna salibon kɔndɔ ye. A lamɛnbailu kabannakoyara, ka a fɔ ko: «Cɛɛ ɲin ka walijiya wo sɔrɔn min? Kabannako kɛ sebaya mɛn ye a bolo, a ka wo sɔrɔn min? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Jiribaarala dencɛ le tɛ wa? A na le tɛ Mariyamu ri wa? Yakuba ni Yusufu ni Simɔn ni Juda, a dɔɔcɛilu tɛ woilu ri wa? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />A dɔɔmusoilu bɛɛ tɛ an wara yan wa? Nba, a ka walijiya ni sebaya ɲin sɔrɔn min?» <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Miriya wo le kɛra sababu ri ka ii bɛɛ kundatiɲan, ii ma la Isa la. Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Mɔɔilu ye keladen fisamante bonyala yɔrɔ bɛɛ rɔ fɔɔ a jɛrɛ wara, a ni a la denbayailu tɛma.» <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Isa ma kabannako siyaman kɛ yɔrɔ wo rɔ, mɔɔilu la lemɛniyabaliya la ko rɔ.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">Yaya faa ɲa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Nba, wo waati rɔ, mansa Herodi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Herodi ɲin de tɛrɛ ye Kalile jamanatiiya la.</char></note> ka Isa la ko mɛn. <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />A ka a fɔ a la baaradenilu yɛ ko: «Yaya le ɲin di. A ra wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ. Wo le ka a kɛ, sebaya ye a bolo ka kabannakoilu kɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Nba, mansa Herodi tun da Yaya mira ka a sidi ka a bila kaso la. A ka wo kɛ a kɔrɔcɛ Filipe muso la ko le kosɔn, mɛn tɔɔ ko Herodiyasi, <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />baa Yaya tora a fɔla a yɛ ko: «Muso wo ma kan ka sii i kun. Wo dahanin tɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Herodi tun ye a fɛ ka Yaya faa, kɔni a silannin tɛrɛ jama yɛ, baa jama tɛrɛ ye Yaya jatela keladen fisamante le ri. <verse eid="MAT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Herodi la sɔrɔn kunɲɔɔ, ii ka tolon kɛ. Herodiyasi denmuso ka dɔn kɛ mɔɔilu tɛma tolon diya ye. Wo diyara Herodi yɛ kosɛbɛ. <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />Wo rɔ, a ka a kali sunkurun yɛ ko a wa mɛn ɲinin a fɛ, a ri wo di a ma. <verse eid="MAT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Sunkurun na ka a fɔ a yɛ a ka kan ka mɛn maɲininka mansa fɛ. Wo rɔ, a wara a fɔ mansa yɛ ko: «N ye a fɛ i ye muran di n ma, Yaya kun ye mɛn kɔndɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Kuma wo ka mansa niilafin kosɛbɛ. Kɔni a tun da ban a kalila a la mɔɔ kiliniilu bɛɛ ɲakɔrɔ. Wo rɔ, a ka jamarili di a la mɔɔilu ma ko ii ye Yaya kun di a ma. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />A ka mɔɔ lɔ Yaya kun tɛɛla a la kaso la. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />A ka a kun tɛɛ a la ka a bila muran do kɔndɔ. A nara wo ri sunkurun ma. Sunkurun wara a di a na ma. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Yaya la karandenilu nara a su ta ka wa a sutura. Ii wara wo kibaro lase Isa ma.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka dɔɔnnin di jama ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Isa ka Yaya faa ko mɛn tuma mɛn na, a kelen donda kulun dɔ ka bɔ ye ka wa. A wara se yɔrɔ do ma, mɔɔ tun tɛ yɔrɔ mɛn. Mɔɔilu ka a wa ko mɛn tuma mɛn na, ii bɔra soilu kɔndɔ ka wa a kɔfɛ ii sen ma. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Isa bɔra kulun kɔndɔ tuma mɛn na, a ka jama ba yen. Ii kininkinin donda a rɔ. Jankarɔtɔ mɛnilu tɛrɛ ii tɛma, a ka woilu lakɛndɛya. <verse eid="MAT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Wura fɛ, a la karandenilu ka ii madon a la ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «A ragbɛ, an ye wula le kɔndɔ yan. Su ra ko. I ye sila di jama ma sa ii ri wa dɔɔnnifen san diya yan naminin so mɛsɛnilu kɔndɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Isa ka ii jabi: «Ii mako tɛ wo la. Ai jɛrɛ ye dɔɔnnin di ii ma.» <verse eid="MAT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Karandenilu ka a fɔ ko: «Foyi tɛ an bolo yan fɔɔ burukala loolu a ni jɛɛ fila.» <verse eid="MAT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Isa ka a fɔ ko: «Ai ye na woilu ri n ma yan.» <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />A ka a fɔ jama yɛ ko ii ye ii sii duu ma bin kɛndɛ kan. Wo kɔ rɔ, a ka burukala loolu ni jɛɛ fila ta, ka a ɲa layɛlɛ sankolo rɔ ka baraka bila Alla yɛ. A ka buru rakadikadi, ka a di a la karandenilu ma. Ii ka a ratalan jama la. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Mɔɔ bɛɛ ka dɔɔnnin kɛ ka ii fa. Jama bannin dɔɔnninna, Isa la karandenilu ka buru kunkundun tɔilu ladɛn, ka see tan ni fila lafa wo la. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Jama mɛn ka dɔɔnnin wo kɛ, cɛɛ waa loolu (5,000) ɲɔɔn tɛrɛ ye a rɔ. Musoilu ni denilu ma jate.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka a taama ji kan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa ka a fɔ a la karandenilu yɛ i kɔrɔ ko ii ye don kulun kɔndɔ. Ko ii ye wa dala kɔma a ɲɛrɔ. Ko ale watɔ sila dila jama ma. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Nba, a bannin sila dila jama ma, Isa kelen wara Alla tara diya koyinkɛ do kan. Su kora ka a tɛrɛn a kelen ye ye fɔlɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />Wo tuma, karandenilu la kulun da janfa pon gbelemala la. Ji kuruilu tɛrɛ ye ii la kulun namaala. Fɔɲɔ tɛrɛ ye ii kunbɛnna. <verse eid="MAT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Dondon kasi waati ɲɔɔn, Isa ka a taama ji kan ka wa ii kɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Kɔni karandenilu ka a taamatɔla yen ji kan tuma mɛn na, silan ba ka ii mira. Ii ka a fɔ ko, «su kɔrɔ do jiya le!» Ii kulera, baa ii silanni. <verse eid="MAT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Kɔni Isa kumara ii yɛ i kɔrɔ. A ka a fɔ ko: «Ai ye ai jusulatɛɛ! Nde le. Ai kana silan!» <verse eid="MAT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Piyɛri ka a fɔ ko: «Maari, ni ile le, i ye n jamari ko n ye taama ji kan ka wa i tɛrɛn ye.» <verse eid="MAT 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Isa ka a fɔ ko: «Na.» Piyɛri jiira ka bɔ kulun kɔndɔ ka taama ji kan ka wa Isa kɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Kɔni Piyɛri ka a yen tuma mɛn na ko fɔɲɔ fanka ka bon kojuuya, a silanda ka jii damira ji kɔrɔ. A kulera ko: «Maari, i ye n nakisi!» <verse eid="MAT 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Isa ka a bolo rasɔmɔn i kɔrɔ ka Piyɛri mira. A ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Ile, mɛn na lemɛniya ka dɔɔ. Nfenna i ye sikasikala?» <verse eid="MAT 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Isa ni Piyɛri donda kulun kɔndɔ tuma mɛn na, fɔɲɔ ka a lɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Karanden mɛnilu tɛrɛ ye kulun kɔndɔ, woilu ka ii birin Isa kɔrɔ. Ii ka a fɔ ko: «Tuɲa le, ile le Alla Dencɛ ri.»<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka jankarɔtɔilu lakɛndɛya Kenesarɛti mara rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Nba, ii ban mɛn kɛnin dala tɛɛla, ii sera Kenesarɛti mara rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Ye mɔɔilu ka a ɲayen tuma mɛn na ko Isa le, ii ka mɔɔilu lɔ a na ko fɔla mara fan bɛɛ rɔ. Wo rɔ, mɔɔilu nara ii la jankarɔtɔilu bɛɛ ri Isa ma, <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />ka a madiya ko a ye diɲɛ ii ye ii bolo maa a la duruki dakun gbansan na. Mɔɔ mɔɔ ka a bolo maa a la, woilu bɛɛ kɛndɛyara.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Judiyailu la namun koilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Farisi doilu ni sariya karanmɔɔ doilu bɔra Jerusalɛmu ka na Isa tɛrɛn. <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />Ii ka a maɲininka ko: «Nfenna i la karandenilu ye an benbailu la namun tiɲanna? Ii ye dɔɔnnin kɛla ka a tɛrɛn ii ma ii bolo lako fɔlɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai don? Nfenna ai ye ai la namunilu bonyala ka Alla la sariya tiɲan? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Baa Alla ka a fɔ ko: ‹I ye i na ni i fa bonya.› Ko: ‹Ni mɔɔ mɛn ka a fa wala a na danka, wo tii ka kan ka faa le.› <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Kɔni ai ka a fɔ ko mɔɔ ri se a fɔla a fa wala a na yɛ ko: ‹I ka kan ka dɛmɛnfen mɛn sɔrɔn n bolo, n da wo bila a dan na Alla yɛ.› <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />Ai ka a fɔ ko ni a ka a fɔ ten, a diyagboyanin tɛ butun ka a fa bonya niilifen na. Wo rɔ, ai ra Alla la kuma to ye, ka ai la namunilu bila a nɔ rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Ai jɛrɛmayuwailu, Esayi ka mɛn fɔ ai la ko rɔ fɔlɔfɔlɔ, wo bɛnnin kosɛbɛ. A ka a fɔ ko:<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />‹Mɔɔ ɲinilu ye n bonyala ii da le la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:8">kɔni ii jusukun ma senin n na muumɛ!<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Ii ye n batola fuu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:9">Ii ye mɔɔilu karanna mɛnilu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:9">woilu tɛ foyi ri fɔɔ adamadenilu la jamariliilu.›»<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fen mɛnilu ye mɔɔ nɔɔla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa ka jama kili, ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai bɛɛ ye ai tolo malɔ n na kuma la ka a famun. <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Mɔɔ ye fen fen donna a da rɔ ka a dɔɔn, wo si ti se mɔɔ nɔɔla. Kɔni mɛnilu ye bɔla mɔɔ da rɔ, wo le ye mɔɔ nɔɔla.»<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />A la karandenilu ka ii madon a la, ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I ma a lɔn ko i la kuma gbara Farisiilu la wa?» <verse eid="MAT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Isa ka a fɔ ko: «N Fa mɛn ye sankolo rɔ, ni wo jɛrɛ ma lannifen mɛn lan, woilu ri bɔ ka faa. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Ai ye Farisiilu to ye. Ii ye ɲa funyenilu le ri, ii jɛrɛ le ye i ɲɔɔn na gbeleke mirabailu ri. Ni ɲa funyen don ka ɲa funyen do la gbeleke mira, ii fila bɛɛ ri be denka rɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Piyɛri ka a fɔ Isa yɛ ko: «Kuma kɔrɔlama wo kɔrɔ fɔ an yɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Isa ka a fɔ ko: «A ye di? Ai fanan ma se ko ɲayenna wa? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Ai ma a ɲayen wa ko fen mɛn ye donna mɔɔ da rɔ, wo ye wala a kɔnɔ le rɔ? Wo kɔrɔ, fen wo ri bɔ. <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Kɔni kuma mɛnilu ye bɔla mɔɔ da rɔ, woilu ye bɔla a jusukun de rɔ. Woilu le ye mɔɔ nɔɔla, <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />baa ko kɔrɔn mɛn ye bɔla mɔɔ jusukun dɔ, woilu le ɲin di: miriya juu, mɔɔfaa, kaninkɛla, jatɔya su bɛɛ, suɲali, sereya juu bɔ, a ni mɔɔ tɔɔ tiɲan. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Ko woilu le ye mɔɔ nɔɔla. Kɔni ka dɔɔnnin kɛ bolo lakobali la, wo tɛ mɔɔ nɔɔla.»<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siya gbɛrɛ muso do lara Isa la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa bɔra yɔrɔ wo rɔ ka wa Tiri ni Sidɔn mara rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Ye muso do nara Isa tɛrɛn. Kanaanka le tɛrɛ a ri. A tɛrɛ ye a kule kan nabɔla ko: «Maari, Dawuda dencɛ, i ye hina n na. Jena do ye n denmuso tɔrɔla kojuuya!» <verse eid="MAT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Kɔni Isa ma foyi fɔ. A la karandenilu ka ii madon a la, ka a madiya ko: «Muso ɲin gbɛn, baa a bilanin an kɔfɛ ka a kule kan nabɔ kojuuya.» <verse eid="MAT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Isa ka a fɔ ko: «Alla ma n kelaya mɔɔ gbɛrɛ si ma ni Isirayɛlikailu tɛ, woilu mɛnilu ye ikomin saa tununninilu.» <verse eid="MAT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Kɔni muso wo nara a be Isa sen kɔrɔ, ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Maari, i ye n dɛmɛn.» <verse eid="MAT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Isa ka a fɔ ko: «Ka denninilu la dɔɔnnin fen ta ka a lafili wuluilu kɔrɔ, wo ti bɛn.» <verse eid="MAT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Muso ka a jabi: «Maari, tuɲa le wo ri. Kɔni wuluilu ye dɔɔnnin buruburu dɔɔnna, mɛn ye bela duu ma ii tiilu la tabali kɔrɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Isa ka a jabi: «Aa, muso. I la lemɛniya ka bon! I ka mɛn ɲinin, a ye kɛ i yɛ.» A denmuso kɛndɛyara wo waati kelen.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka jankarɔtɔ siyaman nakɛndɛya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Isa bɔra yɔrɔ wo rɔ, ka wa Kalile Dala da la. A yɛlɛra koyinkɛ do kan ka a sii ye. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Jama ba nara a tɛrɛn. Ii nara nambarailu ri, a ni ɲa funyenilu ni bolokelenilu ni boboilu ni jankarɔtɔ siyaman gbɛrɛilu. Ii nara woilu bɛɛ ri, ka ii lala Isa kɔrɔ. A ka ii bɛɛ lakɛndɛya. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Ii ka ii yen tuma mɛn na ko boboilu ra kuma damira, bolokelenilu ra kɛndɛya, nambarailu ra ii taama, a ni ɲa funyenilu ɲa ra laka; jama kabannakoyara. Ii bɛɛ ka Isirayɛlikailu la Maari Alla tando.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka dɔɔnnin di mɔɔ waa naanin (4,000) ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Isa ka a la karandenilu kili, ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Jama ɲin kininkinin ye n na. Ii ra tele sawa le kɛ n dafɛ yan. Dɔɔnnifen si tɛ ii bolo. N tɛ a fɛ ka sila di ii kɔnkɔtɔ ma ten. Ni wo tɛ, ii ri kirɔn la sila la.» <verse eid="MAT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Karandenilu ka Isa jabi: «An di buru sɔrɔn min wula kɔndɔ yan, mɛn di jama ba ɲin ɲɔɔn bɔ?» <verse eid="MAT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Burukala yɛli ye ai bolo?» Ii ka a fɔ ko: «Burukala wɔrɔnwula, a ni jɛɛ mɛsɛnni dɔndɔ»<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Isa ka a fɔ jama yɛ ko ii ye ii sii duu ma. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />A ka burukala wɔrɔnwula ni jɛɛ woilu ta, ka baraka bila Alla yɛ, ka ii rakadikadi, ka ii di karandenilu ma. Karandenilu ka woilu ta ka ii ratalanna jama tɛma. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Jama bɛɛ ka dɔɔnnin kɛ ka ii fa. Buru kunkundun ni jɛɛ tɔ mɛn tonin, Isa la karandenilu ka see wɔrɔnwula lafa wo rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Cɛɛ mɔɔ waa naanin (4,000) ka dɔɔnnin kɛ. Musoilu ni denninilu ma jate. <verse eid="MAT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />A ka sila di jama ma, Isa donda kulun do kɔndɔ ka wa Makadan mara rɔ.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Farisiilu ni Sadusiilu ka a fɔ ko Isa ye tɔɔmasere kabannakoma do kɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Farisiilu ni Sadusiilu nara ka Isa kɔrɔbɔ. Ii ka a fɔ ko a ye tɔɔmasere kabannakoma do kɛ ii ɲana, mɛn bɔni sankolo rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Isa ka a fɔ ko: «Ni ai ka sankolo ɲa lawulennin yen fitiri waati, ai ri a fɔ ko sanci tɛna nala sini. <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Sɔɔma, ni ai ka sankolo ɲa lafinnin yen, ai ri a fɔ ko sanci ri na bi, baa san da fin. Nba, ai kusan sankolo koilu faranfaasila ka woilu famun. A ye di wo rɔ? Tɔɔmasere mɛnilu ye kɛla waati ɲin na, nfenna ai ti se ka woilu famun? <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Mɔɔ juuilu ni lemɛniyabaliilu ye a fɛ ka tɔɔmasere kabannakoma yen, kɔni tɔɔmasere si tɛ yiraka ai la ni Junusa ta su tɛ.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 16:4">Wo kɔ rɔ, a ka ii to ye ka wa.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Farisiilu ni Sadusiilu la lɛbɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Nba, Isa ni a la karandenilu wara dala kɔma. Kɔni karandenilu ɲinara, ii ma buru ta. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ɲa lɔ. Ai ye ai janto ai jɛrɛ rɔ Farisiilu ni Sadusiilu la lɛbɛn kanma.» <verse eid="MAT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Karandenilu ka a fɔ i ɲɔɔn yɛ ko: «An ma na buru ri. Wo le ka a kɛ, a ka kuma wo fɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Isa ka ii la miriya lɔn. Wo rɔ, a ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai la lemɛniya ka dɔɔ! Nfenna ai ye a fɔla a ɲɔɔn yɛ ko buru tɛ ai bolo? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Ai ma a ɲayen fɔlɔ wa? N ka burukala loolu ta ka cɛɛ waa loolu (5,000) balo mɛn kɛ, a ni ai ka see jate mɛn nafa buru kunkundun tɔilu la, wo ra bɔ ai kɔndɔ wa? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />N ka burukala wɔrɔnwula ta ka cɛɛ waa naanin (4,000) balo mɛn kɛ, a ni ai ka see jate mɛn nafa buru kunkundun tɔilu la, wo ra bɔ ai kɔndɔ wa? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />N kan tun tɛ buru ma. Nfenna ai ma wo ɲayen fɔlɔ? Nba, ai ye ai janto ai jɛrɛ rɔ Farisiilu ni Sadusiilu la lɛbɛn kanma.» <verse eid="MAT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Wo rɔ, karandenilu ka a ɲayen ko Isa ma a fɔ ii yɛ ko «ai ye ai janto ai jɛrɛ rɔ buru lɛbɛn kanma.» A ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko «ai ye ai janto ai jɛrɛ rɔ Farisiilu ni Sadusiilu la karan de kanma.»<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Piyɛri ka a fɔ ko Isa ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin di</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Awa, Isa ni a la karandenilu seni Sesare Filipi mara rɔ, a ka ii maɲininka ko: «Mɔɔilu ye Mɔɔ Dencɛ jatela yon di?» <verse eid="MAT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Ii ka a jabi: «Doilu ka a fɔ ko Yaya le. Doilu ka a fɔ ko Eliya le. Dogbɛrɛilu ka a fɔ ko Jeremiya le, wala keladen fisamante gbɛrɛ, mɛn taminda kɔrɔman.» <verse eid="MAT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />A ka ii maɲininka ko: «Ai don? Ai ye n jatela yon di?» <verse eid="MAT 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Simɔn Piyɛri ka a fɔ ko: «I ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin de ri, mɛn ye Alla ɲenema Dencɛ ri.» <verse eid="MAT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Isa ka a jabi: «Junusa dencɛ Simɔn, i ye barakaden de ri, baa i ka mɛn fɔ ɲin di, adamaden si ma wo fɔ i yɛ. N Fa Alla mɛn ye sankolo rɔ, wo le ka a yiraka i la. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />N di a fɔ i yɛ fanan ko ile le Piyɛri ri, mɛn kɔrɔ ye ko farakolo. N di n na lemɛniya jama lalɔ farakolo wo kan. Saya ni a fanka ti nala nɔ sɔrɔnna dɛkuru wo ma. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />N di harijeene mansaya daɲinilu di i ma. Ni i ka fen fen sidi duukolo kan yan, wo ri sidi sankolo rɔ. Ni i ka fen fen fulɛn duukolo kan yan, wo ri fulɛn sankolo rɔ fanan.» <verse eid="MAT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ka a magbɛlɛnya kosɛbɛ ko ii kana a fɔ mɔɔ si yɛ ko ale le Ɲenematɔmɔnin di.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka a faa ko ni a wuli ko fɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />A ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko a ka kan ka wa Jerusalɛmu ka tɔrɔya siyaman ba sɔrɔn mɔɔbakɔrɔilu ni sarakalasela kuntiilu ni sariya karanmɔɔilu bolo. A ka kan fanan ka faa, ni tele sawanan, ka wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Piyɛri ka a kili ka a mabɔ karanden tɔilu la dɔɔni, ka a makuma damira. A ka a fɔ ko: «Maari, Alla ye i tanka wo ma. Wo ti kɛla fewu!» <verse eid="MAT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Kɔni Isa ka a kɔfɛnin ka Piyɛri makuma ko: «Ile, Setana. Bɔ n kɔrɔ! Ile ye n kundatiɲanna le ri, baa Alla sawo ye mɛn di, i tɛ i mirila wo ma, fɔɔ mɔɔilu sawo.»<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɔɔ ri a bila Isa kɔ ɲa mɛn ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa ka a fɔ a la karandenilu yɛ ko: «Ni mɔɔ mɛn ye a fɛ ka a bila n kɔ, fɔɔ wo tii ye a ban a jɛrɛ rɔ ka a gbɔngbɔn jiri mira ka a jɛrɛ bila n kɔ, <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />baa mɔɔ mɛn ye a fɛ ka a nii kisi, wo tii ri bɔnɔ ɲenemaya bɛrɛbɛrɛ rɔ. Kɔni ni mɔɔ mɛn bɔnɔra a nii rɔ nde kosɔn, wo tii ri a jɛrɛ kisi. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />A ye di? Ni mɔɔ ka dunuɲa bɛɛ sɔrɔn ka bɔnɔ ɲenemaya bɛrɛbɛrɛ rɔ, dunuɲa sɔrɔn di nfen ɲa a ma wo rɔ? Mɔɔ ri se nfen dila ka a nii kunka? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Nde Mɔɔ Dencɛ ri na n Fa nɔɔrɔ rɔ, n ni a la mɛlɛkailu. Wo lon, n di bɛɛ sara ka a bɛn a tii kɛwaliilu ma. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />N di tuɲa fɔ ii yɛ. Doilu ye ai tɛma yan, mɛnilu ti nala sala ni ai ma Mɔɔ Dencɛ natɔla yen ka kɛ mansa ri.»<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">Isa kɛɲa yɛlɛmanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Nba, tele wɔɔrɔ taminnin kɔrɔ, Isa ka Piyɛri ni Yakuba ni wo dɔɔcɛ Yuhana kili ka wa ii ri koyinkɛ jan do kan. Mɔɔ gbɛrɛ tun tɛ ye. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Isa kɛɲa yɛlɛmanda karanden sawa woilu ɲakɔrɔ. A ɲakɔrɔla mɛlɛnmɛlɛnda ikomin tele. A la faaninilu gbɛra pepe ikomin yelen. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Musa ni Eliya bɔra gbɛ rɔ karanden sawa woilu ɲakɔrɔ. Woilu ni Isa tɛrɛ ye kumala i ɲɔɔn yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Piyɛri ka a fɔ Isa yɛ ko: «Maari, ka an na yan, wo bɛnnin. Ni i sɔnda, n di gba sawa lɔ, i ta kelen, Musa ta kelen, a ni Eliya ta kelen.» <verse eid="MAT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Ka Piyɛri to kuma wo la, duru yelen nara ka birin ii kun na. Kumakan do bɔra duru rɔ ko: «N diyanan dencɛ le ten. N sɛwani ale la kosɛbɛ. Ai ye ai tolo malɔ a la.» <verse eid="MAT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Karandenilu ka kuma wo mɛn tuma mɛn na, ii silanda kojuuya fɔɔ ka ii be duu ma ka ii ɲa labirin. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Kɔni Isa ka a madon ii la ka a bolo maa ii la, ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai kana silan, ai ye wuli.» <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Ii ka ii ɲakɔrɔta tuma mɛn na, ii ma mɔɔ si yen fɔɔ Isa kelen pe.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Ka Isa ni a la karandenilu to jiila ka bɔ koyinkɛ la, a ka ii jamari ko, «Ai ka ko mɛn yen, ai kana wo fɔ mɔɔ si yɛ, fɔɔ Mɔɔ Dencɛ wa wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Ii ka a maɲininka ko: «Nfenna sariya karanmɔɔilu ye a fɔla ko Eliya fɔlɔ le ka kan ka na?» <verse eid="MAT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Isa ka ii jabi: «Tuɲa le, Eliya ri na ka fen bɛɛ rabɛn. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />N ye a fɔla ai yɛ ko Eliya ra ban nala. Kɔni mɔɔilu ma a lɔn. Ii ka ii sawonan koilu bɛɛ kɛ a la. Mɔɔ Dencɛ fanan di tɔrɔ ii bolo wo ɲa kelen de ma.» <verse eid="MAT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Karandenilu ka a ɲayen wo rɔ ko a ye kumala ii yɛ Yaya le la ko kan.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka den jenatɔ do lakɛndɛya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Isa ni karandenilu sera jama rɔ tuma mɛn na, cɛɛ do ka a madon Isa la. A ka a ɲɔnkin Isa kɔrɔ ka a fɔ ko: <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />«Maari, i ye hina n dencɛ la. Kerekeremansa ye a la, a ye tɔrɔla kosɛbɛ. Siɲa siyaman a ri a labe ta rɔ, walama ji rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />N nara a ri i la karandenilu ma, kɔni ii ma se a lakɛndɛyala.»<verse eid="MAT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Isa ka a fɔ ko: «Ai bi mɔɔilu ye lemɛniyabali ni kun gbɛdɛnilu le ri. N di to ai tɛma haan waati ɲuman? N di ai la ko muɲunnin fɔɔ waati ɲuman? Nba, ai ye na den di n ma yan.» <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Isa jamanda jena ma. Wo rɔ, jena bɔra den fɛ. Den kɛndɛyara i kɔrɔ ye.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa la karandenilu ka ii madon a la ka a maɲininka ii dan na ko: «Nfenna andeilu ma se jena wo gbɛnna?» <verse eid="MAT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Isa ka ii jabi: «Ai ma se ka a masɔrɔn ai la lemɛniya le ka dɔɔ. N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: Hali ni ai la lemɛniya dɔɔman ikomin bɔrɔn fira kisɛ, ni ai ka a fɔ koyinkɛ ɲin yɛ ko a ye bɔ a nɔ rɔ ka wa, a ri wa. Ko si tɛ ye, ai ti se mɛn kɛla. <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />[Kɔni jena ɲin ɲɔɔn ti se bɔla mɔɔ fɛ, ni ai ma sun don ka Alla tara.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kuma diya ɲin tɛ sɔrɔn Sɛbɛli kɔrɔ doilu kɔndɔ.</char></note>»<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka a la saya ni a wuli ko fɔ ikɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Nba, lon do rɔ, karandenilu bɛɛ ka i ɲɔɔn nadɛn Kalile mara rɔ. Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Mɔɔ Dencɛ kɛtɔ donna mɔɔilu bolo. <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />Woilu ri a faa. Kɔni tele fila a sawana, a ri wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ.» Kuma wo ka karandenilu jusukasi kosɛbɛ.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ni Piyɛri ka Alla batobonba wodi sara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Isa ni a la karandenilu sera Kapɛrinahumu so kɔndɔ. Ka ii to ye, Alla batobonba niisɔnkɔ miralalailu ka ii madon Piyɛri la ka a maɲininka ko: «Ai la karanmɔɔ tɛ Alla batobonba wodi sarala wa?» <verse eid="MAT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Piyɛri ka a jabi: «Ɔɔn, a ye a sarala.» Piyɛri wara don bon kɔndɔ. Kɔni sani a ye kuma, Isa fɔlɔ le ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Simɔn, dunuɲa mansailu ye mɔɔ niisɔnkɔ ni fen tɔilu niisɔnkɔ mirala yon na? Ai denilu wa, wala londanilu? I la miriya ye di?» <verse eid="MAT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Piyɛri ka a jabi: «Londanilu.» Isa ka a fɔ ko: «Wo rɔ, a denilu sen tɛ a rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Wo bɛɛ ni a ta, an tɛ a fɛ ka mɔɔ ɲinilu tɔrɔ. Wo le kosɔn, i ye wa dala da la ka lɔn bila ji rɔ. I wa jɛɛ fɔlɔ mɛn mira, i ye wo da laka ka a dakɔndɔla ragbɛ. I ri wodi gbanan do yen ye. I ye wa wo di ii ma. Nde ni ile ka kan ka wodi mɛn sara, wo ri a bɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Mɔɔ mɛn ye ɲɛmɔɔ ri harijeene mansaya rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Nba, waati wo rɔ, karandenilu ka ii madon Isa la, ka a maɲininka ko: «Yon ye ɲɛmɔɔ ri harijeene mansaya rɔ?» <verse eid="MAT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Isa ka den do kili, ka wo lalɔ ii tɛma, <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: na ai ma ai sɔn yɛlɛman ka kɛ ikomin denninilu, ai tɛna donna harijeene mansaya rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Mɔɔ mɛn wa a jɛrɛ fanmajii ka kɛ ikomin denni ɲin, wo tii le ye ɲɛmɔɔ ri harijeene mansaya rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Ni mɔɔ mɛn sɔnda ka denni ɲin ɲɔɔn damira koɲuma nde kosɔn, wo tii ra n jɛrɛ le ramira wo ri.<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kundatiɲan ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />«Den mɛnilu lemɛniyani n ma ɲin di, ni mɔɔ do kɛra sababu ri ka woilu kɛ kojuu kɛla ri, a ka fisa ko kabakudun belebeleba ye sidi wo tii kan na ka a lafili kɔɔji dun ba rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Gbalo ye dunuɲa mɔɔilu yɛ ka a masɔrɔn ko mɛnilu ye mɔɔilu bilala julumun dɔ a fɛrɛ ti ye fɔɔ wo ko suilu ye kɛ le kɔni ii ye farala mɔɔ mɛnilu la, gbalo ye wo tiilu yɛ!<verse eid="MAT 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />«Ni i bolo kelen wala i sen kelen ye kɛla sababu ri ka i lɔ kojuu kɛla don? I ye wo tɛɛ a la ka a bɔ ye, baa ni i fɛɛtɔ wala i sen kelen donda ɲenemaya jɛrɛ jɛrɛ rɔ, wo ka fisa i ma sani i bolofilatii wala i senfilatii ye wa don jahanama kɔndɔ, ta sabali ye yɔrɔ mɛn. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Ni i ɲa kelen ye kɛla sababu ri ka i lɔ kojuu kɛla don? I ye a labɔ ka a lafili, baa ni i ɲakelentii donda ɲenemaya jɛrɛ jɛrɛ rɔ, wo ka fisa i ma sani i ɲafilatii ye lafili jahanama kɔndɔ, ta ye yɔrɔ mɛn.<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saa tununni kuma kɔrɔlama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10-11" />«Ai ye ai janto ai jɛrɛ rɔ. Ai kana denni ɲinilu si dɔɔya, baa n di a fɔ ai yɛ ko mɛlɛka mɛnilu ye ii jantola ii rɔ, woilu ri se ii madonna n Fa Alla la harijeene rɔ tuma bɛɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.10-11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛbɛli kura doilu ka kuma diya 11 bila ɲin ka a fɔ ko: «Baa Mɔɔ Dencɛ nani mɔɔ tununnilu ɲinin kanma ka woilu kisi.»</char></note><verse eid="MAT 18:10-11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />A ye di? Ni saa kelen tununda saa kɛmɛ (100) tii ma, a tɛ a tɔ bikɔnɔndɔ ni kɔnɔndɔ (99) to koyinkɛ yɔrɔ rɔ ye ka wa saa tununni ɲinin diya wa? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: ni a ka a yen, a ri sɛwa a la ka tamin a tɔ bikɔnɔndɔ ni kɔnɔndɔ (99) la ko la, mɛnilu ma tunun a ma. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Wo ɲa kelen de ma, ai Fa mɛn ye harijeene rɔ, wo tɛ a fɛ hali dennin ɲinilu kelen pe a ye fɔ a la.<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ni i badenma ka kojuu kɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />«Nba, ni i badenma ka kojuu kɛ, i ye wa a tɛrɛn. A ka mɛn kɛ, i ye wo ɲafɔ a yɛ, i kelen a kelen. Ni a sɔnda i la kuma ma, i ni a ri kɛ badenmailu jɛrɛ jɛrɛilu ri ikɔ tuun. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Kɔni ni a ti nala sɔnna i la kuma ma, i ye mɔɔ kelen wala mɔɔ fila ta, ka wa a tɛrɛn, sa fen fen wa fɔ, woilu bɛɛ ye fɔ sere fila wala sere sawa ɲana.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mafɛnɛ Sariyailu suran 19 kuma diya 15.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Kɔni ni a ka a ban ii la kuma rɔ, i ye ko wo fɔ lemɛniya jama yɛ. Ni a ka a ban dɛkuru wo la kuma rɔ, a ye kɛ i ma ikomin siya gbɛrɛilu wala niisɔnkɔmirala. <verse eid="MAT 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: ni ai ka fen fen sidi duukolo kan yan, wo ri sidi sankolo rɔ. Ni ai ka fen fen fulɛn duukolo kan yan, wo ri fulɛn sankolo rɔ fanan.<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɔɔ fila wa Alla tara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />«N di do la wo kan. Ni ai rɔ mɔɔ fila bɛnda ko do rɔ ka Alla tara a la duukolo kan yan, n Fa Alla mɛn ye sankolo rɔ, a ri wo kɛ ai yɛ, <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />baa ni mɔɔ fila wala mɔɔ sawa ka i ɲɔɔn nadɛn n tɔɔ rɔ, n ye ii tɛma ye.»<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baaraden hinabali sanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Nba, Piyɛri ka a madon Isa la, ka a maɲininka ko: «Maari, ni n badenma ye kojuu kɛla n na, n ka kan ka a makoto fɔɔ siɲa yɛli? Siɲa wɔrɔnwula wa?» <verse eid="MAT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Isa ka a jabi: «Ɛɛn, i kana dan siɲa wɔrɔnwula ma. I ye wo tii makoto fɔɔ siɲa biwɔrɔnwula (70) sii diyama wɔrɔnwula (7).<verse eid="MAT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />«Wo le rɔ, harijeene mansaya ye ikomin tariku ɲin. Mansacɛ do tɛrɛ ye ye, mɛn na julu tɛrɛ ye a la baaraden doilu la. A tun ye a fɛ ka wodi ko wo ɲanabɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />A wulira wo ɲanabɔla tuma mɛn na, mɔɔilu ka a la baaraden do lana a ma, a la kɛwuli siyaman julu ye mɛn na. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Se tun tɛ baaraden yɛ ka julu wo sara. Wo rɔ, maari ka jamarili di ko ii ye baaraden wo feere, ka a muso ni a denilu fanan feere, a ni a bolofenilu bɛɛ, sa julu wo ri sara. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Kɔni baaraden ka a be duu ma ka a la maari sen kɔrɔ. A ka a madiya kosɛbɛ ko: ‹I ye i muɲun. N di i la wodi bɛɛ sara.› <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Baaraden kininkinin donda maari rɔ. Wo rɔ, a ka baaraden bila, ka diɲɛ a la julu ma.<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />«Baaraden bɔra ye ka wa. A bɛnda a baaraden ɲɔɔn di, a la julu tɛrɛ mɛn na. A ka wo mira a kan ma ka a raja fɔɔ ka a niilakili ja a rɔ, ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: ‹N na julu sara!› <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />A baaraden ɲɔɔn ka a be duu ma a sen kɔrɔ, ka a madiya ko: ‹I ye i muɲun, n di i la wodi sara.› <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Kɔni baaraden ma sɔn fewu. A ka cɛɛ mira ka a bila kaso la ko ni a ma a la julu sara, a tɛ bɔ ye. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />A baaraden ɲɔɔnilu ka wo yen tuma mɛn na, woilu jusu tɔrɔra kosɛbɛ. Ii wara wo bɛɛ fɔ ii la maari yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Maari ka baaraden wo kili, ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: ‹Ile, baaraden juu! Julu mɛn tɛrɛ ye i la, n ka wo bɛɛ to i yɛ ka a masɔrɔn i ka n madiya la. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />N hinara i la ɲa mɛn ma, i fanan tun ti se hinala i baaraden ɲɔɔn na wo ɲa ma?› <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />A la maari mɔnɛra kosɛbɛ. A ka a la baaraden bolo don kaso kandanilailu bolo ko ka a tɔrɔya haan a ye julu bɛɛ sara.»<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />«N Fa mɛn ye sankolo rɔ, wo fanan di wo ɲɔɔn kɛ ai kelen kelenna bɛɛ la na ai ma ai badenmailu makoto ai jusukun bɛɛ la.»<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Isa ka a fɔ ko furu ma kan ka sa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Nba, Isa banni wo fɔla, a bɔra Kalile mara rɔ ka wa Jude mara rɔ mɛn ye Juridɛn Ba kɔfɛ. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Jama ba bilara a kɔ. A ka woilu lakɛndɛya ye.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Farisi doilu ka ii madon Isa la. Ii tɛrɛ ye a kɔrɔbɔla. Wo rɔ, ii ka a maɲininka ko: «A dahani cɛɛ ye a muso bila ko bɛɛ rɔ wa?» <verse eid="MAT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Isa ka ii jabi: «Mɛn sɛbɛni kitabu kɔndɔ, ai ma wo karan wa? A sɛbɛni ko Danni Maari ka dunuɲa dan tuma mɛn na, a ka cɛɛ ni muso le dan. <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Alla ka a fɔ ko: ‹Wo le kosɔn, cɛɛ ri mataa a fa ni a na la, ka sidi a muso ma. Ii fila bɛɛ ri kɛ mɔɔ kelen di.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A Damira suran 2 kuma diya 24</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Wo rɔ, ii tɛ jatela mɔɔ fila ri butun fɔɔ mɔɔ kelen. Wo le kosɔn, Alla ka mɛnilu ladɛn ka ii kɛ kelen di, mɔɔ si kana woilu fara ka ii bɔ i ɲɔɔn na.»<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Farisiilu ka Isa maɲininka ikɔ tuun ko: «Ni wo le, nfenna Musa ka jamarili di ko ni cɛɛ ye a fɛ ka furusa, fɔɔ a ye furusa sɛbɛ rabɛn ka a muso bila.» <verse eid="MAT 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Isa ka ii jabi: «Ai kun gbɛlɛnman tɛrɛ. Wo le ka a kɛ, Musa sɔnda ai ye ai musoilu bila. Ni wo tɛ, fɔlɔfɔlɔ a tun tɛ ten. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Kɔni n di a fɔ ai yɛ ko ni mɔɔ mɛn ka a muso bila ka muso gbɛrɛ furu, ka a tɛrɛn a muso fɔlɔ wo tun ma kaninkɛ, wo tii ra kaninkɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Isa la karandenilu ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Aa! Ni a ye ten de cɛɛ ni a muso tɛma, a ka fisa cɛɛ ma ni a ma muso si ta.» <verse eid="MAT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Isa ka ii jabi: «Cɛɛilu bɛɛ ti se sɔnna kuma wo ma de, fɔɔ ni Alla ka a se di mɛnilu ma. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Ko doilu ye a kɛla, cɛɛilu ri ii ban muso tala. Kibatɛn doilu ye ye, mɛnilu sɔrɔnda ka a tɛrɛn ii ti se dɛla muso fɛ. Kibatɛn doilu fanan ye ye, mɔɔilu ra mɛnilu bɔ cɛɛya rɔ. Cɛɛ doilu fanan ye ye, mɛnilu ti sɔnna ka furu kɛ harijeene mansaya kosɔn. Mɔɔ mɛn di se sɔnna kuma ɲin ma, wo tii ye sɔn wo ma.»<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa duwara denninilu yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Mɔɔ doilu nara denninilu ri Isa ma, sa a ri a bolo la ii kan ka Alla matara ii yɛ, kɔni karandenilu jamanda denninilu ma. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye a to denninilu ye na n ma. Ai kana ii bali, baa harijeene mansaya ye ii ɲɔɔn su ta le ri.» <verse eid="MAT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Awa, a banni a bolo lala denninilu kan, a bɔra ye ka wa.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cɛɛ nanfulutii la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />A watɔla, cɛɛ do ka a madon a la, ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Karanmɔɔ, n ka kan ka koɲuma ɲuman kɛ, sa n di ɲenemaya banbali sɔrɔn?» <verse eid="MAT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Nfenna i ye n maɲininkala koɲuma ko ma? Alla kelen pe le ka ɲin. Ni i ye a fɛ ka ɲenemaya jɛrɛ jɛrɛ sɔrɔn, i ye Alla la sariya labato.» <verse eid="MAT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Cɛɛ ka a fɔ ko: «Sariya ɲuman?» Isa ka a jabi: «I kana mɔɔ faa, i kana kaninkɛ, i kana suɲali kɛ, i kana kɛ sere juu ri, <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />i ye i fa ni i na bonya, i ye i mɔɔɲɔɔ kanin ikomin i jɛrɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Kanberen ka a fɔ ko: «N da sariya woilu bɛɛ labato. Nfen toni sinɛn?» <verse eid="MAT 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Isa ka a jabi: «Ni i ye a fɛ i la koilu bɛɛ ye dafa, i ye wa i bolofenilu feere ka a wodi ratalan fantanilu la. Wo rɔ, nanfulu ba ri kɛ i bolo sankolo rɔ. Wo kɔ rɔ, i ye na bila n kɔfɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Kanberen ka wo mɛn tuma mɛn na, a niilafinni wulira ka wa, baa a bolofen ka siya.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Wo kɛni, Isa ka a fɔ a la karandenilu yɛ ko: «N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: nanfulutii don harijeene mansaya rɔ, wo gbɛlɛnman de! <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Ɔɔn, n di a fɔ ai yɛ ikɔ tuun ko ɲɔɔmɛ don duman sɛlan woo la ka tamin nanfulutii don kan Alla la mansaya rɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Karandenilu ka wo mɛn ka kabannakoya kosɛbɛ. Ii ka a fɔ ko: «Yon di se kisila wo rɔ sa?» <verse eid="MAT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Isa ka ii ragbɛ ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Mɔɔ ti se wo kɛla, kɔni Alla ri se ko bɛɛ kɛla.»<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Piyɛri ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «A ye di? Andeilu ra fen bɛɛ to ye ka an bila i kɔ. An di nfen sɔrɔn wo rɔ?» <verse eid="MAT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «N di tuɲa fɔ i yɛ: dunuɲa wa kɛ dunuɲa kura ri, Mɔɔ Dencɛ ri a sii a la mansaya siifen dɔ, mɛn gbiliyani. Ai mɛnilu ra ai bila n kɔ, ai fanan di ai sii mansaya siifen tan ni fila rɔ, ka Isirayɛlikailu la kabila tan ni fila la kiti tɛɛ. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Ni mɔɔ mɛn ka a la bon to a kɔ ye, wala a dɔɔilu ni a kɔrɔilu, wala a na, wala a fa, wala a denilu, wala a la sɛnɛilu, nde kosɔn, wo tii ri woilu ɲɔɔn kɛmɛ (100) sɔrɔn, ka ɲenemaya banbali fanan sɔrɔn. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Kɔni ɲɛmɔɔ siyaman di kɛ kɔmɔɔilu ri. Kɔmɔɔ siyaman di kɛ ɲɛmɔɔilu ri fanan.»<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Sɛnɛtii ni a la baaradenilu kuma kɔrɔlama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />Nba, Isa ka kuma kɔrɔlama do fɔ ii yɛ. A ka a fɔ ko: «Harijeene mansaya kɛnin ikomin sɛnɛtii do la ko. Sɛnɛtii wo bɔra sɔɔma da la jonna ka wa baaraden doilu ɲinin, mɛnilu ri sɔn ka wa baara diya a la rɛsɛnfɛ rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />A ka mɔɔ mɛnilu sɔrɔn, a ni woilu bɛnda a rɔ ko tele kelen baara sara ri kɛ wodi gbanan kelen di. Wo rɔ, a ka ii lawa baara diya a la rɛsɛnfɛ rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Waati sawa ɲɔɔn taminni kɔ, sɛnɛtii bɔra ikɔ tuun. A ka mɔɔ doilu lɔni yen bara rɔ, mɛn tɛ foyi kɛla. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />A ka a fɔ woilu yɛ ko: ‹Ai fanan ye wa baara diya rɛsɛnfɛ rɔ. Sara mɛn ka kan ka a di ai ma, n di wo di ai ma.› <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Mɔɔ woilu wara rɛsɛnfɛ rɔ. Midi waati, sɛnɛtii bɔra ka wa wo ɲɔɔn kɛ. Waati sawa taminni wo kɔ, a bɔra ka wa wo ɲɔɔn kɛ ikɔ tuun. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Wura fɛ, sɛnɛtii bɔra ikɔ tuun. A ka mɔɔ doilu lɔni yen ikɔ. A ka a fɔ woilu yɛ ko: ‹Nfenna ai ra tele bɛɛ kɛ lɔni yan, ai ma baara kɛ?› <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Ii ka a jabi: ‹An ma baara kɛ ka a masɔrɔn mɔɔ si ma an ta baara la.› A ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: ‹Ai fanan ye wa baara diya n na rɛsɛnfɛ rɔ.›<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />«Nba, tele bera tuma mɛn na, sɛnɛtii ka a fɔ a la baara kuntii yɛ ko a ye baaradenilu kili ka ii sara. Ko baaraden mɛnilu nara a tɔilu bɛɛ kɔ, ko a ye sarali damira woilu ma, ka na se mɔɔ fɔlɔilu ma. <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Wo rɔ, mɔɔ mɛnilu sera ye telebe tumana, a ka wodi gbanan kelen di ii kelen kelenna bɛɛ ma. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Mɔɔ mɛnilu fɔlɔ sera baara diya, sarali dakun seni ii ma, ii tɛrɛ ye ii mirila ko ii sara ri siyaya ka tamin tɔilu ta la. Kɔni woilu bɛɛ ka wodi gbanan kelen kelen sɔrɔn. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Nba, wodi dini kɔ ii ma, ii ka sɛnɛtii mafɔ damira. <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />Ii ka a fɔ ko: ‹Baaraden mɛnilu nara bɛɛ kɔ ɲin di, ii ka waati kelen pe baara le kɛ. Kɔni i ra an ni woilu bɛɛ sara kɛ kelen di, ka a tɛrɛn andeilu le ka an daja tele muumɛ kɔrɔ, ka baara kɛ tele kɔrɔ.› <verse eid="MAT 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />Sɛnɛtii ka kelen jabi ii rɔ: ‹N badenma, n ma i tɔɲɔ de! An bɛnda wodi gbanan kelen de ma, wo tɛ? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />I ye i la sara ta ka wa. Mɔɔ mɛn nara baara diya ai tɔ la, n ye a fɛ ka wodi gbanan kelen di wo fanan ma, ikomin n ka a di i ma ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />A ye di? N ma kan ka n bolofenilu kɛ ɲa ma mɛn duman n yɛ wa? Ni wo tɛ, n fonesere, wo ɲangboya ye i la wa?›<verse eid="MAT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />«Wo le rɔ, kɔmɔɔilu ri kɛ ɲɛmɔɔilu ri. Ɲɛmɔɔilu ri kɛ kɔmɔɔilu ri fanan.»<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka a la saya ni a wuli ko fɔ ikɔ tuun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Nba, Isa watɔla Jerusalɛmu, a ka a la karanden tan ni fila kili ii dan na. Ka ii to taamanna, a ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />«Ai ɲa lɔ! An watɔ Jerusalɛmu. Mɔɔ Dencɛ ri don sarakalasela kuntiiilu ni sariya karanmɔɔilu bolo. Woilu ri kiti labe a kan ko a ka kan ka faa. <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />Ii ri a don siya gbɛrɛ mɔɔilu bolo sa woilu ri a lafɛya, ka a gbasi bonsan na, ka a gbɔngbɔn jiri kan ka a faa. Kɔni tele fila a sawana, a ri wuli.»<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sebede muso ka Isa madiya mɛn kɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Nba, Sebede muso ni a dencɛ fila nara Isa tɛrɛn. A ka a majii Isa kɔrɔ ka a madiya ko do la. <verse eid="MAT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Ai ye a fɛ n ye nfen de kɛ ai yɛ?» A ka Isa jabi: «I ye a to n dencɛ fila ye ii sii i dafɛ. Kelen di a sii i bolokinin fɛ, a tɔ kelen di a sii i bolomaran fɛ, i wa don i la mansaya rɔ tuma mɛn na.» <verse eid="MAT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Kɔni Isa ka a jabi: «Ai ye ko mɛn tarala, ai ma wo kɔrɔ lɔn. Tɔrɔya mɛn kɛtɔ n sɔrɔnna, ai ri se wo muɲunna wa?» Sebede dencɛ fila ka Isa jabi: «Ɔɔn, an di se a kɔrɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Isa ka a fɔ ko: «N di tɔrɔya mɛn muɲun, ai fanan di wo ɲɔɔn muɲun. Kɔni sii diya mɛnilu ye n bolokinin ni n bolomaran fɛ, woilu diba tɛ nde ri. N Fa ka sii diya woilu rabɛn mɔɔ mɛnilu yɛ, a ri ii di woilu le ma.»<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Karanden tɔ tan ka kuma wo mɛn tuma mɛn na, woilu mɔnɛra badenma fila woilu kanma. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Kɔni Isa ka karandenilu bɛɛ kili, ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ka a lɔn ko jamana mansailu ye kuntiiya kɛla ii la jamanadenilu kan diyagboya la. Jamana mɔɔbailu ri fanka la jamanadenilu kan. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />A ma kan ka kɛ ten ai tɛma. Mɛn ye a fɛ ka kɛ mɔɔba ri ai rɔ, wo tii ka kan ka kɛ ai dɛmɛnba ri. <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />Mɛn ye a fɛ ka kɛ ai rɔ ɲɛmɔɔ ri, wo tii ye kɛ ai la jɔn di. <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Wo ɲa kelen ma, Mɔɔ Dencɛ ma na dunuɲa rɔ ko mɔɔilu ye baara kɛ a yɛ. A jɛrɛ nara baara kanma, a ni ka a nii di ka kɛ mɔɔ siyaman kunka sara ri.»<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka ɲa funyen fila ɲa laka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Nba, Isa ni a la karandenilu bɔtɔla Jeriko so kɔndɔ, jama ba bilara a kɔ. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Ɲa funyen cɛɛ fila siini tɛrɛ sila dala. Woilu ka a mɛn tuma mɛn na ko Isa le tamintɔ, ii wɔyɔra ko: «Maari, mansa Dawuda dencɛ, i ye hina an na.» <verse eid="MAT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Jama ka ii makuma ko ii ye ii makun. Kɔni ii pɛrɛnda ka tamin fɔlɔman kan ko: «Maari, mansa Dawuda dencɛ, i ye hina an na.» <verse eid="MAT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Isa ka a lɔ ka ii kili, ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye a fɛ n ye nfen de kɛ ai yɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Ii ka a fɔ ko: «Maari, an ye a fɛ i ye an ɲa laka.» <verse eid="MAT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Ii kininkinin donda Isa rɔ. A ka a maa ii ɲa la, ii ɲa lakara i kɔrɔ ye. Ii ka ii bila Isa kɔ i kɔrɔ.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">Isa donda Jerusalɛmu fali den kan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Awa, Isa ni a la karandenilu sudunyani Jerusalɛmu so la, ii sera Bɛtifase so kɔndɔ, ni a ye Olibiye Koyinkɛ ri. Ka ii to ye, Isa ka a la karanden mɔɔ fila kelaya. <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />A ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «So mɛsɛn mɛn ye an ɲɛfɛ wo ri, ai ye wa ye. Ai wa don so kɔndɔ, ai ri falimuso do sidinin yen i kɔrɔ. A den ye a dafɛ. Ai ye a fulɛn ka na ii ri yan. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Ni mɔɔ do ka ai maɲininka, ai ye wo tii jabi: ‹Maari le mako ye a la.› Wo tii ri a lana i kɔrɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Awa, ko woilu bɛɛ kɛni sa Maari la kuma ri kanbali, a ka mɛn don a la keladen fisamante da rɔ. Wo ka a fɔ ko:<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />«Ai ye a fɔ Siyonkailu yɛ ko:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">‹Ai ye ai ɲa lɔ! Ai la mansa natɔ le ten.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">A fanmajiini, a siini falimuso le kan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">Ɔɔn, a siini fali den kan, falimuso denni kɔnin.›»<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Nba, karandenilu wara a kɛ ikomin Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Ii nara falimuso ni a den di. Ii ka ii la durukibailu la faliilu kɔ rɔ. Isa yɛlɛra ka a sii ii kan. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Jama siyaman ba ka ii la durukibailu fɛnsɛn sila kan Isa ɲɛfɛ. Doilu ka jiri bolon mɛsɛnilu tɛɛ ka woilu fɛnsɛn sila kan a ɲɛfɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jama ka ii la durukibailu a ni jiribolon mɛsɛnilu fɛnsɛn sila kan Isa bonya kanma. Ii ma wo kɛ ka Isa bali.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Mɔɔ mɛnilu tɛrɛ ye Isa ɲɛfɛ, a ni mɛnilu tɛrɛ ye a kɔfɛ, woilu tɛrɛ ye ii kan ba labɔla ko:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">«Tandoli ye kɛ mansa Dawuda dencɛ yɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">Mɛn ye nala Maari tɔɔ rɔ ten,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">Alla ra ɲumaya kɛ wo yɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">Tandoli ye kɛ sankolo rɔ!»<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Isa donda Jerusalɛmu tuma mɛn na, so bɛɛ lamaara. Mɔɔilu bɛɛ ka a fɔ ko: «Ee, yon de ɲin di ten?» <verse eid="MAT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Jama ka ii jabi: «Keladen Isa le ɲin di, keladen fisamante mɛn ye bɔla Nasarɛti, Kalile mara rɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka julailu gbɛn ka bɔ Alla batobonba kɔndɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Awa, Isa donda Alla batobonba jin kɔndɔ. A ka jula ni sanninkɛla mɛnilu tɛrɛn Alla batobonba jin kɔndɔ ye, a ka woilu bɛɛ gbɛn ka ii labɔ ye. A ka wodifalennailu la tabaliilu labebe, ka kanba julailu la siifenilu fanan nabebe. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />A ka a fɔ ye mɔɔilu yɛ ko: «A sɛbɛnin Alla la Kitabu kɔndɔ ko: ‹N na bon di kɛ Alla tara diya ri.› Kɔni ai ra a kɛ bɛnkaninnailu dokon diya ri.»<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sarakalasela kuntiilu duɲara Isa kanma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Ɲa funyenilu ni senkelenninilu ka ii madon Isa la Alla batobonba jin kɔndɔ ye. A ka woilu lakɛndɛya. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Sarakalasela kuntiiilu ni sariya karanmɔɔilu ka Isa la kabannako kɛniilu yen ye. Ii ka denni doilu fanan yen, mɛnilu tɛrɛ ye ii kan ba labɔla Alla batobonba jin kɔndɔ ye ko: «Tandoli ye kɛ mansa Dawuda dencɛ yɛ!» Wo rɔ, sarakalasela kuntiiilu ni sariya karanmɔɔilu mɔnɛra. <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Ii ka a fɔ Isa yɛ ko: «I tolo ye denilu kan na wa?» Isa ka ii jabi: «Ɔɔn, n tolo ye a la. A ye di? Mɛn sɛbɛni Alla la kitabu kɔndɔ, ai ma wo karan fɔlɔ wa? A sɛbɛni ko:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:16">‹Denninilu ni sinmindenilu ye i tandola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:16">baa i jɛrɛ ka tandoli kan wo don ii da rɔ.›»<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Isa ka ii to ye ka wa. A bɔra so kɔndɔ ka wa su kɛ Betani.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka toroju danka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Wo duu sa gbɛ, Isa wulira ka a kɔsɛ Jerusalɛmu. A watɔla, kɔnkɔ ka a mira. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />A ka toroju do yen sila dala. A ka a madon a la ka a ragbɛ. Kɔni a ma toroden yen, fɔɔ fira gbansan. A ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I tɛna i den butun fewu!» Toroju jara i kɔrɔ ye. <verse eid="MAT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Karandenilu ka wo yen tuma mɛn na, ii kabannakoyara. Ii ka a fɔ ko: «Ee, toroju ɲin jara di i kɔrɔ?» <verse eid="MAT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Isa ka a fɔ ko: «N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: ni lemɛniya ye ai rɔ, ni ai fanan ma sikasika, n ka mɛn kɛ toroju la ɲin di, ai ri se wo ɲɔɔn kɛla. Ka a la wo kan, ni ai ka a fɔ koyinkɛ ɲin yɛ ko: ‹I ye bɔ i nɔ rɔ ka wa be kɔɔji rɔ,› a ri kɛ ten. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Ni ai ka lemɛniya la Alla rɔ, ai wa fen fen ɲinin a fɛ, ai ri wo sɔrɔn.»<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa la fanka bɔnin min?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Isa wara don Alla batobonba jin kɔndɔ. Ka a to mɔɔilu karanna ye, sarakalasela kuntiiilu ni mɔɔbakɔrɔilu nara a tɛrɛn ye, ka a maɲininka ko: «I ye baara mɛn kɛla ɲin di, yon ka i lɔ wo la? I ye yon na se kɔrɔ?» <verse eid="MAT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Isa ka ii jabi: «N fanan di ai maɲininka ko kelen ma. Ni ai ka n jabi, n di a fɔ ai yɛ mɛn ka n lɔ baara ɲin kɛla. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />A ye di? Yon de ka Yaya lɔ mɔɔilu sunna ji rɔ? Alla le ka a lɔ wa, wala mɔɔilu?» Ii ka a fɔ i ɲɔɔn yɛ ko: «Ni an ka a fɔ ko Alla le ka Yaya lɔ, a ri a fɔ an yɛ ko: ‹Wo rɔ, nfenna ai ma la Yaya la kuma la?› <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Kɔni an kana a fɔ ko: ‹Mɔɔilu le ka Yaya lɔ de!› An ye silan ii duɲa la, baa jama bɛɛ ye Yaya jatela keladen fisamante le ri.» <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Wo rɔ, ii ka Isa jabi: «An ma a lɔn.» Isa fanan ka ii jabi: «Nba, ni wo le, n tɛna a fɔla ai yɛ mɛn ka n lɔ baara ɲin kɛla.<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dencɛ fila la ko kɔrɔlama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />«Ai ye ai mirila di? Dencɛ fila tɛrɛ ye mɔɔbakɔrɔ do bolo. A ka a fɔ a dencɛ fɔlɔ yɛ ko: ‹N dencɛ, i ye wa baara kɛ rɛsɛnfɛ rɔ bi.› <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Den ka a fɔ ko: ‹N ti nala wala.› Kɔni kɔfɛ, a nimisara. A wara rɛsɛnfɛ rɔ wo rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Mɔɔbakɔrɔ ka kuma kelen wo fɔ dencɛ filana yɛ. A ka a fɔ ko: ‹N fa, n di wa.› Kɔni a ma wa. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Wo dencɛ fila rɔ, ɲuman de ka a fa sawo kɛ?» Ii ka a fɔ ko: «Dencɛ fɔlɔ wo.» Isa ka a fɔ ko: «N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: niisɔnkɔmiralailu ni sunkurunbailu ye donna ai ɲɛfɛ Alla la mansaya rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Baa Yaya nara ka telenbaya sila yiraka ai la, ai ma la ale la; kɔni niisɔnkɔmiralailu ni sunkurunbailu lara a la. Ai ka a yen ko ii lara Yaya la. Hali wo, ai ma nimisa kɔfɛ ka la ale la.<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rɛsɛnfɛ sɛnɛla juuilu kuma kɔrɔlama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />«Ai ye ai tolo malɔ kuma kɔrɔlama gbɛrɛ la. Lutii do ka rɛsɛnfɛ labɔ ka a laminin sansan na. A ka denka sen, mɛn di kɛ rɛsɛnji bɔ diya ri. A ka gbala mayɛlɛnin do fanan lɔ, mɛn di kɛ sɛnɛ kɔnɔgbɛn diya ri. A bannin wo bɛɛ la, a ka rɛsɛnfɛ karifa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«Karifa» wo kɔrɔ le Kirɛki kan dɔ ko sɛnɛkɛla woilu ka rɛsɛnfɛ ta sara le la. Tariku ye a yirakala an na ko rɛsɛnden mɔnin mɛnilu tun wa kadi rɛsɛnfɛ rɔ sɛnɛkɛla woilu bolo, wo fan kelen de tun ka kan ka di rɛsɛnfɛtii ma ka wo kɛ a sara ri.</char></note> sɛnɛkɛla doilu la. Wo kɔ rɔ, a wara taama rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Rɛsɛnden kadi waati sudunyara tuma mɛn na, a ka a la jɔnilu lawa sɛnɛkɛlailu tɛrɛn ye, ko ii ye a niiyɔrɔ di a ma rɛsɛnden kadiniilu rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Kɔni jɔnilu sera ye tuma mɛn na, sɛnɛkɛlailu ka ii mira. Ii ka do gbasi, ka dogbɛrɛ faa, ka dogbɛrɛ bon kabakudun la. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Nba, rɛsɛnfɛ tii ka jɔn gbɛrɛilu kelaya ikɔ tuun. Woilu ka siya tɛrɛ fɔlɔmantailu ri. Kɔni sɛnɛkɛlailu ka woilu fanan mira ikomin ii ka fɔlɔmantailu mira ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />A laban, a ka a jɛrɛ dencɛ kelaya ii ma. A ka a fɔ ko: ‹Sɛnɛkɛlailu ri n dencɛ bonya.› <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Kɔni sɛnɛkɛlailu ka dencɛ wo yen tuma mɛn na, ii ka a fɔ i ɲɔɔn yɛ ko: ‹Cɛtala le ɲin di. Ai ye na, an ye wa a faa ka a fa cɛ ta.› <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Ii ka dencɛ wo mira, ka a lafili rɛsɛnfɛ kɔkan, ka a faa.<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />«A ye di? Lutii wa se rɛsɛnfɛ rɔ, a ri nfen de kɛ sɛnɛkɛlailu la?» <verse eid="MAT 21:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Ii ka a jabi: «A ri be mɔɔ juu woilu kan hinabaliya la ka ii halaki. Wo kɔ rɔ, a ri a la rɛsɛnfɛ karifa mɔɔ gbɛrɛilu la, mɛnilu ri a ta niiyɔrɔ di a ma rɛsɛndenilu kadi waati.» <verse eid="MAT 21:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Mɛn sɛbɛnin Alla la kitabu kɔndɔ, ai ma wo karan fɔlɔ wa? A sɛbɛnin ko:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">‹Bon lɔlailu ka ii ban kabakudun mɛn dɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">wo le kɛra bon jusii kabakudun di.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Maari nɔ le wo ri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">A kɛra an ɲana kabannako ri.›»<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />«Wo le kosɔn, n di a fɔ ai yɛ ko Alla la mansaya ri ta ai bolo, ka di siya gbɛrɛ ma, mɛn di Alla la mansaya jiriden nawara. <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Nba, mɔɔ mɛn wa be kaba wo kan wo ri rakadi, kɔni kaba wo wa be mɔɔ mɔɔ kan wo ri mɔɲɔnkɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 21:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Sarakalasela kuntiiilu ni Farisiilu ka kuma kɔrɔlama woilu mɛn tuma mɛn na, ii ka a ɲayen ko Isa kan iile ma. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Ii ka a ɲa ɲinin ka Isa mira. Kɔni ii silanda jama yɛ, baa mɔɔilu tɛrɛ ye Isa jatela keladen fisamante le ri.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s">Kɔɲɔ dɔɔnninba kuma kɔrɔlama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Nba, Isa ka kuma kɔrɔlama dogbɛrɛilu fɔ ii yɛ ikɔ tuun. A ka a fɔ ko: <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />«Harijeene mansaya ye ikomin mansacɛ, mɛn ka dɔɔnninba rabɛn a dencɛ la kɔɲɔ ko rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Mansacɛ tun ka dɔɔnnin ko fɔ mɔɔ mɛnilu yɛ, a ka a la jɔncɛilu lɔ woilu kilila dɔɔnnin diya. Kɔni mɔɔ woilu tun tɛ a fɛ ka na. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Mansacɛ ka jɔn gbɛrɛilu lawa ikɔ tuun. A ka a fɔ ko: ‹Ai ye a fɔ mɔɔ kilini woilu yɛ ko «n da dɔɔnninba rabɛn. Ko torailu ra faa, a ni nisi tɔlɔninilu. Ko a bɛɛ ra mɔ. Ko ai ye na dɔɔnnin diya.»› <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Kɔni mɔɔ mɛnilu kilini, woilu si ma mansa la kilikan jate. Do bɔra ka wa a la sɛnɛ rɔ. Do bɔra ka wa a la julaya kɛ diya. <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />Tɔilu ka mansacɛ la jɔnilu mira, ka ii tɔrɔ kosɛbɛ, ka ii faa.<verse eid="MAT 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />«Mansacɛ mɔnɛra wo rɔ. A ka a la tɛsidiilu lawa mɔɔfaala woilu kanma. Tɛsidiilu ka ii bɛɛ faa, ka ii la so janin. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Mansacɛ ka a fɔ a la jɔnilu yɛ ko: ‹Kɔɲɔ dɔɔnninba ra rabɛn. Kɔni mɛnilu kilini tɛrɛ, woilu si tɛrɛ ma daha woilu ye ii kili. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Wo le rɔ, ai ye wa sila ba fara diyailu la. Ai wa mɔɔ mɔɔ tɛrɛn ye, ai ye ii bɛɛ kili ko ii ye na kɔɲɔ dɔɔnnin diya.› <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Jɔnilu wulira ka wa sila dailu la. Ii ka mɔɔ mɛnilu tɛrɛn ye, ii ka woilu bɛɛ kili dɔɔnnin diya, mɔɔ juuilu ni mɔɔ ɲumailu bɛɛ. Wo rɔ, kɔɲɔ dɔɔnninba tɛrɛ ye bon mɛn kɔndɔ, wo fara mɔɔ kiliniilu la.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />«Mansacɛ donda bon kɔndɔ kɔ ka a ɲa la mɔɔ kiliniilu kan. A ka cɛɛ do yen ye, kɔɲɔmalɔ faanin tɛ mɛn kan na. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Mansacɛ ka a fɔ cɛɛ wo yɛ ko: ‹N duɲɔɔcɛ, a ye di? Kɔɲɔmalɔ faanin tɛ i kan na. I donda bon na yan wo rɔ di?› Cɛɛ ma foyi sɔrɔn ka a fɔ. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Mansacɛ ka a fɔ baaradenilu yɛ ko: ‹Ai ye a senilu ni a boloilu sidi ka a lafili dibi rɔ kɔkan, kasi ni a ɲin macin ye yɔrɔ mɛn.›» <verse eid="MAT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Isa ka kuma do la wo kan ko: «Mɔɔ siyaman kilini, kɔni mɛnilu suwandinin, woilu ma siya.»<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Niisankɔ bɔ ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Farisiilu bɔra ye ka wa i ɲɔɔn yen ka ɲa ɲinin Isa la ko ma. Ii ye a fɛ a ye kuma do fɔ, mɛn di kɛ a mira sababu ri. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Ii ka ii la karanden doilu ni mansa Herodi kɔmɔɔ doilu lawa Isa ma. Woilu wara a fɔ Isa yɛ ko: «Karanmɔɔ, an ka a lɔn ko i ye kankelentii le ri. Mɔɔilu ka kan ka Alla la sila taama ɲa mɛn, i ye ii karanna wo la tuɲa jɛrɛ jɛrɛ rɔ. I tɛ silanna mɔɔ si yɛ, i tɛ mɔɔ bɔla mɔɔ rɔ fanan. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />A ye di wo rɔ? Ka niisɔnkɔ bɔ ka a di Romu mansa Sesari ma, wo bɛnnin an ma wa, wala wo bɛnnin tɛ? I ye i la miriya fɔ an yɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Kɔni Isa ka ii la miriyajuu lɔn. Wo rɔ, a ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai jɛrɛmayuwailu, nfenna ai ye n kɔrɔbɔla? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Ai ye niisɔnkɔ sarala wodi gbanan mɛn na, ai ye wo do yiraka n na, n ye a ragbɛ.» Ii ka gbanan wo kelen di a ma. <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />A ka ii maɲininka ko: «Yon munuɲa ni yon tɔɔ ye gbanan ɲin kan?» <verse eid="MAT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Ii ka a fɔ ko: «Romu mansa Sesari.» Isa ka a fɔ ko: «Nba, ai ye mansa Sesari la fen di mansa Sesari ma. Ai ye Alla fanan ta di Alla ma.» <verse eid="MAT 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Isa la jabili ka ii kabannakoya. Ii bɔra a fɛ ka wa.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sadusiilu ka ɲininkali kɛ Isa kun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Wo lon kelen, Sadusiilu nara Isa tɛrɛn. Sadusiilu ye a fɔla ko mɔɔ si tɛ wulila ka bɔ saya rɔ. Awa, wo doilu nara ka Isa maɲininka ko: <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />«Karanmɔɔ, Musa ka a fɔ ko ni i kɔrɔcɛ sara ka a muso densɔrɔnbali to ye, i ye muso wo ta sa a ri den sɔrɔn i kɔrɔcɛ yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Awa, cɛɛ wɔrɔnwula tɛrɛ ye an wara yan, mɛnilu tɛrɛ ye cɛɛ kelen denilu ri. Kɔrɔmamɔɔ ka muso do furu. A sara ka a muso densɔrɔnbali to a kɔ. A dɔɔcɛ ka muso wo ta. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Kɔni wo fanan sara, ka muso densɔrɔnbali to a kɔ. A kɛra wo ɲa le fɔɔ muso wo siira cɛɛ wɔrɔnwula woilu bɛɛ kun, kɔni a ma den sɔrɔn. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Cɛɛ woilu bɛɛ sani kɔ, muso fanan sara. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />A ye di? Su lawuli lon, muso ri kɛ yon ta ri cɛɛ wɔrɔnwula woilu tɛma? Baa a siira ii kelen kelen na bɛɛ kun.»<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Isa ka ii jabi: «Ai filini, baa ai ma Alla la kitabu kɔrɔ famun. Ai ma foyi lɔn Alla la sebaya ko rɔ fanan! <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Baa suilu wa wuli saya kɔrɔ, cɛɛ tɛna muso furula, muso fanan tɛna siila cɛɛ kun. Ii bɛɛ ri kɛ ikomin sankolo rɔ mɛlɛkailu. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Su lawuli ko fan fɛ, Alla ka mɛn fɔ ai yɛ a la kitabu kɔndɔ, ai ra wo karan, ko di? <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />A ka a fɔ ko: ‹N ye Iburahima Maari le ri, a ni Isiyaka ta, a ni Yakuba ta.› A tɛ suilu Maari ri. Ɛɛn de! A ye mɔɔ ɲenemailu Maari le ri.»<verse eid="MAT 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Jama ka kuma wo mɛn tuma mɛn na, ii kabannakoyara a la karan ma.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sariya mɛn gbɛlɛnman tɔilu ri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Farisiilu ka a mɛn tuma mɛn na ko Isa ka Sadusiilu da bɔ a rɔ, woilu ka ii ladɛn ka wa Isa tɛrɛn. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Sariya karanmɔɔ do tɛrɛ ye ii rɔ. Wo ka ɲininkali kɛ Isa kun a kɔrɔbɔ kanma. A ka a fɔ ko: <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />«Karanmɔɔ, sariya ɲuman gbɛlɛnman sariya tɔilu bɛɛ ri?» <verse eid="MAT 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «‹I ye i la Maari Alla kanin i jusukun bɛɛ rɔ, a ni i sɔnɔmɛ bɛɛ la, a ni i miriya bɛɛ la.› <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Wo ye sariya fɔlɔ le ri, mɛn gbɛlɛnman sariya tɔilu bɛɛ ri. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Sariya mɛn tuunni wo la, wo fanan gbɛlɛnman ikomin fɔlɔmanta. Ale le ɲin di: ‹I ye i mɔɔɲɔɔ kanin ikomin i jɛrɛ.› <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Sariya bɛɛ ni kelalaselailu la karan bɛɛ sidinin sariya fila wo le ma.»<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɲenematɔmɔnin ye mansa Dawuda la maari ri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Ka Farisiilu ladɛnnin to, Isa ka ɲininkali kɛ ii kun. <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />A ka a fɔ ko: «A ye di? Ai ye ai mirila di Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ko rɔ? Yon dencɛ le a ri?» Ii ka Isa jabi: «Mansa Dawuda dencɛ le.» <verse eid="MAT 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Kɔni Nii Sɛniman ka a kɛ, Dawuda jɛrɛ ka a fɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin ma ko Maari. Wo kɛra di? Baa Dawuda ka a fɔ ko:<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />‹Maari Alla ka a fɔ n na Maari yɛ ko:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">«Na i sii n bolokinin fɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">haan n wa ban i juuilu bilala i sen kɔrɔ.»›<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />«Awa, ni Dawuda jɛrɛ ye a fɔla a ma ko Maari le ten, a don di se kɛla a dencɛ ri di?» <verse eid="MAT 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Mɔɔ si ma se ka Isa jabi. Ka a ta wo lon ma, mɔɔ si ma sɔn ka ɲininkali kɛ a kun butun.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s">Gbalo ye sariya karanmɔɔilu ni Farisiilu yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa kumara jama ni a la karandenilu yɛ. A ka a fɔ ko: <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />«Ka mɔɔilu karan Musa la sariya la, se wo karifani Sariya karanmɔɔilu ni Farisiilu le la. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Wo rɔ, ii wa mɛn fɔ ai yɛ, ai ye wo labato. Kɔni ii jɛrɛ ye kɛwali mɛnilu kɛla, ai kana woilu ɲɔɔn kɛ de, baa ii ye mɛn fɔla, ii tɛ wo kɛla. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Ii ye donin gbilinilu sidila ka woilu sii mɔɔilu kun. Ii jɛrɛ don ti sɔn ka mɔɔ woilu dɛmɛn hali dɔɔni. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Wo rɔ, ii ye ko bɛɛ kɛla kosa mɔɔilu ye ii yen. Ka a masɔrɔn, ii ye Kitabu kumailu sɛbɛla, ii ye ii sidila ii tindailu la a ni ii boloilu la haan a bonyara ka dan natamin, ka ii la durukiilu masidini julu denni janilu la. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Sii diya ɲumaɲumailu le duman ii yɛ dɔɔnninba diya. Mɔɔbailu la sii diyailu duman ii yɛ salibonilu la. <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />Ii ye a fɛ mɔɔilu ye ii kɔndɔn jamama yɔrɔilu rɔ. Ii ye a fɛ fanan mɔɔilu ye a fɔ ii ma ko ‹Rabi›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rabi kɔrɔ ye Karanmɔɔ</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Kɔni ai kana sɔn mɔɔilu ye a fɔ ai ma ko ‹Rabi›, baa karanmɔɔ kelen de ye ai la. Ai tɔilu ye badenmailu le ri. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Ai kana a fɔ mɔɔ si ma duukolo kan yan ko n fa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A ti fɔla i sɔrɔn fa ma, kɔni a ye a fɔla karanmɔɔ wala duutii wala mɔɔ gbɛrɛ</char></note>, baa Fa kelen de ye ai la, ni a ye Alla ri, mɛn ye sankolo rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Ai kana sɔn mɔɔilu ye a fɔ ai ma ko ‹karanmɔɔ›, baa karanmɔɔ kelen de ye ai bolo, ni a ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin di. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Mɔɔ mɛn ka bon tɔilu ri ai tɛma, wo ye tɔilu la baaraden di. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Mɔɔ mɔɔ wa a jɛrɛ bonya, Alla ri wo majii. Kɔni mɔɔ mɔɔ wa a jɛrɛ fanmajii, Alla ri wo bonya.<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13-14" />«Gbalo ye ai sariya karanmɔɔilu ni Farisiilu yɛ! Ai jɛrɛmayuwailu! Baa ai ra harijeene mansaya da tuun mɔɔilu ɲɛrɔ. Ai jɛrɛ tɛ don a rɔ, mɛnilu fanan ye a fɛ ka don, ai ti sɔn woilu ye don.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.13-14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Do ye a sɛbɛla ko «Gbalo ye ai sariya karanmɔɔilu ni Farisiilu yɛ! Ai filanfilanteilu! Baa ai ye cɛsamusoilu bolofenilu bɛɛ dɔɔnna, ka ban ka mɛn Alla tarala sa mɔɔilu ri ai yen. Wo le kosɔn, Alla ri kiti labe ai kan, mɛn di juuya mɔɔ tɔilu ta ri.» Kɔni wo tɛ sɛbɛni kɔrɔman na</char></note><verse eid="MAT 23:13-14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />«Gbalo ye ai sariya karanmɔɔilu ni Farisiilu yɛ! Ai jɛrɛmayuwailu! Baa ai ye wala fan bɛɛ rɔ duukolo kan, ai ye kɔɔji fanan tɛɛla, sa ai ri mɔɔ ɲinin, mɔɔ mɛn di sɔn ka don ai la dina rɔ. Kɔni ai wa a ladon, ai ye a kɛla jahanamaden di ka tamin ai jɛrɛ kan fɔɔ siɲa fila.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />«Gbalo ye ai ɲa funyenilu yɛ mɛn ye ɲa funyen gbeleke mirala. Ai ka a fɔ ko ni mɔɔ do ka a kali Alla batobonba la, ko kalili wo tɛ foyi ri. Ko kɔni ni mɔɔ do ka a kali Alla batobonba kɔndɔ sanin na, ko fɔɔ wo tii ye kalilikan wo dafa. <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Ai nalonmailu ni ɲa funyenilu! Ɲuman de ka bon? Sanin de ka bon wa, wa Alla batobonba, wo mɛn ye sanin wo kɛla sanin sɛniman di? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Ai kan fanan ko ni mɔɔ ka a kali saraka bɔ diya la, ko wo tɛ foyi ri. Kɔni saraka mɛn ye saraka bɔ diya kan, ni mɔɔ ka a kali wo la, ko fɔɔ wo tii ye kalilikan wo dafa. <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Ai ɲa funyenilu! Ɲuman de ka bon? Saraka le ka bon wa, wala saraka bɔ diya, wo mɛn ye saraka wo kɛla saraka sɛniman di? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Ni mɔɔ ka a kali saraka bɔ diya la, fen fen ye a kan, wo tii ra a kali wo bɛɛ fanan na. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Ni mɔɔ ka a kali Alla batobonba la, wo tii ra a kali Alla batobonba la, a ni bontii Alla fanan na, mɛn siini bon na ye. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Ni mɔɔ ka a kali sankolo la, wo tii ra a kali Alla la mansaya siifen na, a ni Alla jɛrɛ le la, mɛn siini a rɔ.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />«Gbalo ye ai sariya karanmɔɔilu ni Farisiilu yɛ! Ai jɛrɛmayuwailu! Ai ye ai la nakɔ firamɛsɛnilu kelen kelenna bɛɛ jaa bɔla, ka Alla la sariya bonbailu to ye, ni ii ye telenbaya ko ni kininkinin ko ni lemɛniya ko ri. Ai ka kan ka woilu le fɔlɔ kɛ, ka a tɔilu la woilu kan. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Ai ɲa funyenilu yɛ mɛn ye ɲa funyen gbeleke mirala. Ai ye ai la minji sɛnsɛnna ka hali wolowolonin bɔ a rɔ, ka a tɛrɛn ai ye ɲɔɔmɛ lakununna.<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />«Gbalo ye ai sariya karanmɔɔilu ni ai Farisiilu yɛ! Ai jɛrɛmayuwailu! Ai ye jilafɛilu ni tasailu kɔkanna makola ka ii gbɛ. Kɔni woilu fani fen mɛnilu la, ai ka woilu sɔrɔn suɲali ni natabaya le rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Farisi funyen! I ye jilafɛ ni tasa kɔndɔ le fɔlɔ ko. Wo rɔ, kɔkanna fanan di daha.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />«Gbalo ye ai sariya karanmɔɔilu ni Farisiilu yɛ! Ai jɛrɛmayuwailu! Ai ye ikomin kaburu mɛn kɔkanna ra bɔrangbɛ ka keɲa, ka a tɛrɛn a kɔnɔ fanin mɔɔ koloilu ni nɔɔ su bɛɛ la. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Nba, ai fanan ye ten de. Ai wa kɛ mɔɔilu ɲakɔrɔ, ai kɛnin ikomin mɔɔ telenninilu. Kɔni ai kɔndɔ fanin jɛrɛmayuwaya ni kojuu la.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />«Gbalo ye ai sariya karanmɔɔilu ni ai Farisiilu yɛ! Ai jɛrɛmayuwailu! Ai ye kelalaselailu kaburuilu lɔla. Alla la telenba mɛnilu sani, ai ye woilu kaburuilu masidila ka ii lakeɲa. <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />Ai ye a fɔla ko: ‹Ni an tɛrɛ ye ye an benbailu la waati rɔ, an tun tɛ ii dɛmɛn kelalaselailu faala.› <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Ai ye a yirakala wo le fɛ ko ai le kelalaselailu faabailu denilu ri. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Nba, ai benbailu ka baara mɛn damira, ai ye wo dafa fasayi! <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Ai duuma sailu! Ai, fɔnfɔnni la munuɲailu! Alla ri kiti labe ai kan ka ai lafili jahanama kɔndɔ! Ai ri bɔ kiti wo kɔrɔ di? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Wo le kosɔn, n di kelalaselailu kelaya ai ma, a ni mɔɔ famunyaniilu ni sariya karanmɔɔilu. Ai ri doilu gbɔngbɔn jiri kan ka ii faa. Ai ri doilu gbasi gbiɲɛ la ai la salibonilu kɔndɔ. Ii wa bori ka bɔ so do la ka wa so gbɛrɛ la, ai ri ii kɔsaran. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />N di woilu kelaya ai ma sa telenbailu bɛɛ faa kunko ri be ai kan, telenba mɛnilu bɛɛ faara mɔɔilu bolo duukolo kan. Abila, mɛn telenba, a fɔlɔ faara. A laban, Berekiya dencɛ Sakariya faara. Ai ka wo le faa Alla batobonba ni saraka bɔ diya tɛma. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: mɔɔ woilu bɛɛ faa kunko ri be bi mɔɔilu kan.<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa jusukasira Jerusalɛmu kosɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />«Ee Jerusalɛmukailu, Jerusalɛmukailu. Ai ye kelalaselailu faala. Alla wa mɛnilu lɔ ai kawandila, ai ye woilu bonna kaba la ka ii faa. Siɲa siyaman, n tɛrɛ ye a fɛ ka ai ladɛn ikomin sisɛ ye a denilu ladɛnna ɲa mɛn ma ka ii dokon a kanban kɔrɔ. Kɔni ai ma sɔn. <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Sisɛn, ai la bon dakolon di to ai bolo, <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />baa n di a fɔ ai yɛ ko ai ɲa ti nala lala n kan butun fɔɔ ni ai ka a fɔ lon mɛn na ko:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 23:39">‹Mɛn ye nala Maari tɔɔ rɔ ten,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 23:39">Alla ra ɲumaya kɛ wo yɛ.›»<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s">Isa ka Alla batobonba te ko fɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Nba, Isa bɔra Alla batobonba jin kɔndɔ. A watɔla, a la karandenilu ka ii madon a la, ka a jin kɔndɔ bonilu yiraka Alla batobonba la. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Isa ka ii jabi: «Ai ɲa ye fen woilu bɛɛ la, wo tɛ? Awa, n di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: lon do rɔ, woilu bɛɛ ri tete, ka a kabakudunilu bɛɛ jɛnsɛn ka a bɔ i ɲɔɔn kan.»<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Ka Isa siini to Olibiye Koyinkɛ kan, a la karandenilu ka ii madon a la, ka a maɲininka ii dan na ko: «I kan ye ko mɛnilu ma, woilu ri kɛ waati ɲuman? Tɔɔmasere su ɲuman de ri a yiraka ko i natɔ, a ni ko waati laban wo ra se?» <verse eid="MAT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Isa ka ii jabi: «Ai ye ai janto ai jɛrɛ rɔ sa mɔɔ si kana ai lafili, <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />baa mɔɔ siyaman di na n tɔɔ rɔ, ka a fɔ ko: ‹Nde le ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin di.› Ii ri mɔɔ siyaman nafili wo rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />A ri kɛlɛ ko mɛn yɔrɔ do rɔ, wala ko kɛlɛ wulitɔ le yɔrɔ do rɔ, kɔni ai kana silan. Fɔɔ ko woilu ye kɛ. Kɔni wo tɛna kɛ waati laban di fɔlɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Siya ri wuli siya gbɛrɛ kanma. Mansaya do ri wuli dogbɛrɛ kanma. Kɔnkɔ ba ni duukolo yɛrɛyɛrɛ ri kɛ yɔrɔ doilu rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Ko woilu bɛɛ ye tɔrɔya damira le ri, ikomin tinkɔnɔdimin fɔlɔ mɛn ye muso moyitɔla mirala.<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />«Mɔɔilu ri ai don mɔɔilu bolo, sa woilu ri ai tɔrɔ, ka ai faa. Ai ri gboya dunuɲa mɔɔilu bɛɛ yɛ n tɔɔ kosɔn. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Mɔɔ siyaman di n na sila bila, ka i ɲɔɔn don mɔɔilu bolo, ka gboya i ɲɔɔn yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Wuya keladen fisamante siyaman di wuli, ka mɔɔ siyaman nafili. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Kojuukɛ ri wara kojuuya. Wo le kosɔn, mɔɔ siyaman di a mɔɔɲɔɔilu kanin boloka kosɛbɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Kɔni mɔɔ mɛn wa a muɲun fɔɔ tɔrɔya waati wa ban, wo tii ri kisi. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Kibaro ɲuma mɛn ye harijeene mansaya ko fɔla, wo ri kawandi dunuɲa yɔrɔ bɛɛ rɔ, sa siyailu bɛɛ ri a sereya mɛn. Wo kɔ rɔ, dunuɲa laban di se.<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />«Ai wa Fen Haramunnin yen lɔnin yɔrɔ sɛniman dɔ mɛn ye halaki kɛla, keladen fisamante Daniyɛli ka mɛn na ko fɔ, (Mɔɔ mɛn ye ɲin karanna, wo ri a kɔrɔ lɔn.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A ragbɛ Daniyɛli suran 9 kuma diya 27 ni suran 11 kuma diya 31 ni suran 12 kuma diya 11 kɔndɔ.</char></note>) <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />Ni waati wo sera, mɔɔ mɛnilu ye Jude mara rɔ, woilu ye ii bori ka wa koyinkɛilu kan. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Ni waati wo ka mɔɔ mɛn tɛrɛn bon kun bilinin kan, wo tii kana jii fenilu ta kanma bon kɔndɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Wo wa mɔɔ mɛn tɛrɛn sɛnɛ rɔ, wo tii kana a kɔsɛ a wara ko a ye a la durukiba tala. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Waati wo la, muso kɔnɔmailu ri tɔrɔ kosɛbɛ, a ni muso mɛnilu ye sinmin den tiilu ri. <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Ai ye Alla tara, sa ai la bori ko wo ti nala kɛla nɛnɛ tuma rɔ, wala Ɲɔɲɔ Lon, <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />baa wo tuma tɔrɔya ri gbɛlɛnya kojuuya. Wo ɲɔɔn ma kɛ fɔlɔ kɛbi dunuɲa danda waati mɛn na fɔɔ ka na se bi ma. Adon tɔrɔya wo ɲɔɔn tɛna kɛla butun habadan. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Ni wo waati tun ma rasudunya, mɔɔ si ti kisi wo rɔ, kɔni a la mɔɔ suwandininilu la ko kosɔn a ri a rasudunya. <verse eid="MAT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />Wo tuma, ni mɔɔ do ka a fɔ ko ‹A ragbɛ! Ɲenematɔmɔnin ye yan,› wala ‹A ye ye,› ai kana la a la, <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />baa wuya kelalaselailu ri wuli, a ni mɛnilu ka a fɔ ko iile ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin di. Ii ri tɔɔmasere bailu ni kabannakoilu kɛ ka Alla la mɔɔ suwandininilu lafili, ni wo ri se kɛla. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />N da wo bɛɛ fɔ ai yɛ sani ii ye kɛ.<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />«Wo rɔ, ni mɔɔilu ka a fɔ ai yɛ ko: ‹A ragbɛ! A ye kiɲɛ fufu kɔndɔ,› ai kana wa ye. Ni ii ka a fɔ ko: ‹A ragbɛ! A doonnin sutura yɔrɔ do rɔ yan,› ai kana la wo la, <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />baa sanfɛrɛn ye bɔla telebɔ rɔ ka san mɛlɛnmɛlɛn fɔɔ telebe rɔ ɲa mɛn ma, Mɔɔ Dencɛ natɔla ri kɛ wo ɲa. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Sobo su wa kɛ yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ, duwailu ri ii ladɛn yɔrɔ wo rɔ.<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɔɔ Dencɛ na ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />«Tɔrɔya tuma wa ban, tele ri fin i kɔrɔ. Karo ti nala kɛnɛ bɔla butun. Loloilu ri bebe ka bɔ sankolo rɔ. Sankolo kɔndɔ fankatiilu ri juujuu ka bɔ ii nɔ rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Wo tuma, mɔɔ Dencɛ la tɔɔmasere ri bɔ gbɛ rɔ sankolo rɔ. Duukolo kan siyailu bɛɛ ri jusumakasa. Ii ri Mɔɔ Dencɛ natɔla yen duru kan ka bɔ sankolo rɔ sebaya ni nɔɔrɔ ba rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Mɔɔ Dencɛ ri a la mɛlɛkailu kelaya buru fɛ kan ba la. Ii ri wa telebe ni telebɔ rɔ, a ni tele kankan bolomaran ni tele kankan bolokinin dɔ, ka a la mɔɔ suwandininilu ladɛn. Ka bɔ sankolo kun do fɔɔ ka wa se a kun do la, a la mɛlɛkailu ri woilu ladɛn.<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Toroju kuma kɔrɔlama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />«Ai ye famunyali sɔrɔn ka fara toroju kuma kɔrɔlama la. Ai wa a bolonilu yen naronna ka fira kurailu labɔ, ai ri a lɔn ko sanci kun na waati ra se. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Wo ɲa kelen ma, ni ai ka ko woilu bɛɛ yen tuma mɛn na, ai ri a lɔn ko wo waati ra sudunya, fɔdiya a ra se. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: sani bi mɔɔilu ye ban sala, ko woilu bɛɛ ri ban kɛla. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Lon do rɔ, sankolo ni duukolo ri ban ka tunun fewu, kɔni n na kumailu tɛ tamin habadan!<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɔɔ si ma dunuɲa laban waati lɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />«Ko woilu ri kɛ lon mɛn na, a ni waati mɛn na, mɔɔ si ma wo lɔn. Mɛlɛka mɛnilu ye sankolo rɔ, woilu fanan ma a lɔn. Hali Dencɛ jɛrɛ ma a lɔn, fɔɔ Fa kelen pe. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Ko mɛnilu kɛra Nuhan tele rɔ, Mɔɔ Dencɛ ri na ka ko woilu kɛni tɛrɛn. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Nuhan tele rɔ, sanci ba tun ma na tuma mɛn fɔlɔ, mɔɔilu tɛrɛ ye dɔɔnnin ni minnin kɛla. Ii tɛrɛ ye muso furula, ka ii denmuso di cɛɛilu ma furu la, haan Nuhan donda kulunba kɔndɔ lon mɛn dɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />Ii ma sobi foyi ma, fɔɔ sanci ba nara ka ii bɛɛ halaki. Mɔɔ Dencɛ na lon fanan di kɛ wo ɲa. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Wo lon, cɛɛ fila ri tɛrɛn sɛnɛ rɔ, kelen di ta ka kelen to ye. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Muso fila ri tɛrɛn suman si diya, ii ye sumankisɛ sila. Kelen di ta ka kelen to ye. <verse eid="MAT 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Wo rɔ, ai ye to ai ɲana, baa ai ma a lɔn ai la Maari ri na lon mɛn. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Ai ye ko ɲin famun: ni lutii tun ye a kalama ko son di na a wara waati mɛn, a tun di to a ɲana. Wo rɔ, a tun ti sɔn son ye don a la bon na. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Wo le kosɔn, ai fanan dabɛnni ye to, baa Mɔɔ Dencɛ ri na waati do rɔ, ai hankili tɛ waati mɛn na.<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />«Jɔn ɲuman ye jatela mɔɔ sɛbɛ ri, wala mɔɔ famunyani? Jɔntii ri baara karifa jɔn wo la ko a ye dɔɔnnin di jɔn tɔilu ma a waati la. <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Ni jɔntii nara ka jɔn wo tɛrɛn baara la, jɔn wo ri kɛ barakaden de ri. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: jɔntii ri jɔn wo kɛ a bolofenilu bɛɛ kunnasiila ri. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Kɔni ni jɔn wo kɛra jɔn juu ri, tumadɔ a ri a miri ko: ‹N jɔntii ra mɛn, a ti nala jonna.› <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />Wo rɔ, tumadɔ a ri wuli a baaraden ɲɔɔn tɔilu gbasila, ka dɔɔnnin kɛ ka dɔlɔ min mɔɔilu fɛ, mɛnilu ɲa lamininni. <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />Kɔni jɔn wo jɔntii ri na lon do rɔ, jɔn hankili tɛ lon mɛn ma, a hankili tɛ waati mɛn ma. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />A wa na, a ri jahadi la jɔn kan kojuuya, ka a bila jɛrɛmayuwailu tɛma, kasi ni ɲin macin ye yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s">Sunkurun tan kuma kɔrɔlama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />«Wo lon, harijeene mansaya ri kɛ ikomin sunkurun tan mɛn ka ii la fitinnailu ta ka wa kɔɲɔcɛ kunbɛn diya. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Ii rɔ mɔɔ loolu tɛrɛ ye hankilitanilu ri. A tɔ loolu tɛrɛ ye mɔɔ famunyaniilu ri. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Sunkurun hankilitanilu ka ii la fitinna ta, kɔni ii ma fitinna olibiye tulu ta ii bolo. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Kɔni sunkurun hankilimailu ka ii la fitinnailu ta, a ni ii la olibiye tulu baraninilu. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Kɔɲɔcɛ mɛnda a ma na. Jinko ka sunkurun tan bɛɛ mira, ii bɛɛ sunɔɔra. <verse eid="MAT 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />Duu talama, wɔyɔ kan do bɔra ko: ‹Kɔɲɔcɛ ra na, ai ye bɔ ka wa a kunbɛn!› <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Sunkurun tan bɛɛ wulira ka ii la fitinnailu rabɛn. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Sunkurun hankilitanilu ka a fɔ sunkurun famunyaniilu yɛ ko: ‹Ai ye an sɔ ai la tulu do rɔ, baa an na fitinnailu satɔ le.› <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Kɔni sunkurun famunyaniilu ka ii jabi: ‹Wo tɛ bɛn, baa an na tulu ti se an bɛɛ bɔla. Ai ye wa julailu wara ka do san ai jɛrɛ yɛ.› <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Awa, ka sunkurun hankilitanilu wani to tulu san diya, kɔɲɔcɛ nara. Sunkurun mɛnilu rabɛnni, woilu ni kɔɲɔcɛ wara don kɔɲɔmalɔ tolon dɔ. Mɔɔilu ka da tuun. <verse eid="MAT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />Kɔ fɛ, sunkurun tɔilu nara ka bɔ tulu san diya. Ii ka ii kan nabɔ ko: ‹Maari, maari, i ye da laka an yɛ!› <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Kɔni a ka ii jabi: ‹N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: n ma ai lɔn.›»<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />«Wo le rɔ, ai ye to ai ɲana, baa Maari ye na lon mɛn na, a ni waati mɛn, ai ma wo si lɔn.<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jɔn sawa kuma kɔrɔlama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />«A ri kɛ ikomin cɛɛ do la ko. Cɛɛ wo watɔla taama rɔ, a ka a la jɔnilu kili ka a la bolofenilu karifa ii la. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />A ka sanin gbanan waa loolu (5,000) di do ma, ka waa fila (2,000) di dogbɛrɛ ma, ka waa kelen (1,000) di a sawana ma. A ka jate wo di ii ma ka a bɛn ii se ko ma. A banni wo la, a wulira kelen di ka wa taama rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Jɔn mɛn ka sanin gbanan waa loolu (5,000) sɔrɔn, ale wulira julaya kɛla wodi wo rɔ i kɔrɔ. A ka sanin gbanan waa loolu (5,000) gbɛrɛ sɔrɔn tɔnɔ ri. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Mɛn ka waa fila (2,000) sɔrɔn, ale fanan ka a ta kɛ ɲa kelen wo ma, ka sanin gbanan waa fila (2,000) gbɛrɛ sɔrɔn tɔnɔ ri. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Kɔni mɛn ka waa kelen (1,000) sɔrɔn, wo wara denka sen ka a la kuntii la wodi don ye ka a latunun.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />«Nba, jɔnilu la kuntii ka waati jan kɛ a ma na. Wo kɔ rɔ, a nara ka bɔ taama rɔ. A ka jɔnilu kili ko ka wodi ko ɲabɔ. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Jɔn mɛn ka sanin gbanan waa loolu (5,000) sɔrɔn, wo nara waa loolu (5,000) gbɛrɛ ri ka a la a ta wodi kan. A ka a fɔ ko: ‹N na kuntii, i ka sanin gbanan waa loolu (5,000) le karifa n na. I ɲa lɔ. N da sanin gbanan waa loolu (5,000) tɔnɔ sɔrɔn wo kan.› <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />A la kuntii ka a fɔ ko: ‹Wo ra bɛn. Jɔn ɲuma le i ri, a ni landaɲa mɔɔ. Fen fitini le dira i ma, kɔni i ka wo mira koɲuma. Sisɛn n di fen siyaman karifa i la. Na, i ni i la kuntii ye sɛwa kelen di.› <verse eid="MAT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />Jɔn mɛn ka sanin gbanan waa fila (2,000) sɔrɔn, wo nara ka a fɔ kuntii yɛ ko: ‹N na kuntii, i ka sanin gbanan waa fila (2,000) le karifa n na. I ɲa lɔ. N da sanin gbanan waa fila (2,000) tɔnɔ sɔrɔn wo kan.› <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />A la kuntii ka a fɔ ko: ‹Wo ra bɛn. Jɔn ɲuma le i ri, a ni landaɲa mɔɔ. Fen fitini le dira i ma, kɔni i ka wo mira koɲuma. Sisɛn n di fen siyaman karifa i la. Na, i ni i la kuntii ye sɛwa kelen di.› <verse eid="MAT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />Jɔn mɛn ka sanin gbanan waa kelen (1,000) sɔrɔn, wo nara ka a fɔ kuntii yɛ ko: ‹N na kuntii, n tun ka a lɔn ko i la ko gbɛlɛnman. I ri suman ka i ma mɛn sɛnɛ. I ma si foyi yɔrɔ mɛn i ri ye suman ka. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Wo le kosɔn, n silanda. N wara denka sen ka i la wodi don ye ka a latunun. I ɲa lɔ. N da i la wodi lasɛ i ma.› <verse eid="MAT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />A la kuntii ka a fɔ ko: ‹Jɔn juu le i ri, a ni sala. I tun ka a lɔn ko n di suman ka, n ma mɛn sɛnɛ. Ko n ma si foyi yɔrɔ mɛn, n di ye suman ta. <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Wo rɔ, i tun ka kan ka n na wodi bila wodi lamarabon na, tɔnɔ ye sɔrɔnna yɔrɔ mɛn. Ni i tun ka a kɛ ten, n tun di na ka n na wodi ni a tɔnɔ sɔrɔn ye. <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Wo le rɔ, sanin gbanan waa kelen (1,000) mɛn ye a bolo, ai ye wo mira ka a di jɔn fɔlɔman ma, sanin gbanan waa tan (10,000) ye mɛn bolo, <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />baa fen ye mɛn bolo, do fanan di la wo tii ta kan ka a siyaya. Kɔni fen tɛ mɛn bolo, hali fitini mɛn ye wo bolo, wo ri ta a bolo. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Ai ye jɔn ɲatɔntan ɲin nafili dibi rɔ kɔkan, kasi ni ɲin macin ye yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ.›<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dunuɲa laban kiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />«Mɔɔ Dencɛ wa na a la gbiliya rɔ lon mɛn, a la mɛlɛkailu bɛɛ ri na a malɔ. A ri a sii a la mansaya siifen gbiliyani rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Dunuɲa siyailu bɛɛ ri ii ladɛn a ɲakɔrɔ. A ri ii fara ka ii bɔ i ɲɔɔn na, ikomin saa gbɛngbɛnna ye saailu ni baailu farala ɲa mɛn ma ka ii bɔ i ɲɔɔn na. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />A ri saailu bila a bolokinin fɛ, ka baailu bila a bolomaran fɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Wo kɔ rɔ, mansa ri a fɔ bolokininnatailu yɛ ko: ‹Na, aile mɛn kunnadiyani n Fa bolo; ai ye na mansaya sɔrɔn mɛn dabɛnni a yɛ kɛbi dunuɲa dan waati, <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />baa ai ka n kɔnkɔtɔ yen tuma mɛn na, ai ka n sɔ dɔɔnnin fen dɔ. Ai ka n jilɔɔtɔ yen tuma mɛn na, ai ka n sɔ ji rɔ. N tɛrɛ ye londanya rɔ tuma mɛn na, ai ka n jiya. <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />Ai ka n farimakolon yen tuma mɛn na, ai ka n sɔ feriyabɔ rɔ. N jankarɔtɔ tɛrɛ tuma mɛn na, ai ka ai janto n dɔ. N tɛrɛ ye kaso la tuma mɛn na, ai wara bɔ n fɛ.› <verse eid="MAT 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />Mɔɔ telenni woilu ri a fɔ a yɛ ko: ‹Maari, an ka i kɔnkɔtɔ yen lon ɲuman dɔ ka i sɔ dɔɔnnin fen dɔ? An ka i jilɔɔtɔ yen lon ɲuman ka i sɔ ji rɔ? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />An ka i yen londanya rɔ lon ɲuman ka i lajiya? Ni wo tɛ, an ka i farimakolon yen lon ɲuman ka i sɔ feriyabɔ rɔ? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />An ka i jankarɔtɔ yen lon ɲuman ka wa bɔ i ma? Ni wo tɛ, an ka a mɛn lon ɲuman ko i ye kaso la ka wa bɔ i ma?› <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Mansa ri ii jabi: ‹N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: ni ai ka koɲuma kɛ n badenma do yɛ mɛn dɔɔman ai bɛɛ tɛma, ai ka wo kɛ n jɛrɛ le yɛ.›<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />«Wo kɔ rɔ, mansa ri a fɔ bolomarannatailu yɛ ko: ‹Ai dankadenilu, ai ye bɔ n ɲakɔrɔ ka wa ta sabali rɔ, mɛn dabɛnni Ibulusa ni a la mɛlɛkailu yɛ, <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />baa ai ka n kɔnkɔtɔ yen tuma mɛn na, ai ma n sɔ dɔɔnnin dɔ. Ai ka n jilɔɔtɔ yen tuma mɛn na, ai ma n sɔ ji rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />N tɛrɛ ye londanya rɔ, kɔni ai ma n jiya. Ai ka n farimakolon yen, kɔni ai ma n sɔ feriyabɔ rɔ. N jankarɔtɔ le tɛrɛ, kɔni ai ma wa bɔ n fɛ. N tɛrɛ ye kaso la, kɔni ai ma wa bɔ n fɛ.› <verse eid="MAT 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />Mɔɔ woilu fanan di a fɔ a yɛ ko: ‹Maari, an ka i kɔnkɔtɔ yen lon ɲuman, wala ka i jilɔɔtɔ yen, wala ka i yen londanya rɔ, wala ka i farimakolon yen, wala ka i jankarɔtɔ yen, wala ka i bilanin yen kaso la, ni an ma i dɛmɛn?› <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Mansa ri ii jabi: ‹N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ. Ai ka ai ban koɲuma kɛla mɔɔ ɲinilu dɔɔmamɔɔ do yɛ mɛn kɛ, ai ka ii ban koɲuma kɛla nde jɛrɛ le yɛ wo ri.› <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Nba, mɔɔ woilu ri wa tɔrɔ banbali yɔrɔ rɔ. Kɔni mɔɔ telenniilu ri wa to ɲenemaya banbali rɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">Janfa donda Isa ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Isa banda kuma wo bɛɛ fɔla tuma mɛn na, a ka a fɔ a la karandenilu yɛ ko: <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />«Ai ka a lɔn ko a ra to tele fila ma, Taminkunna Sali ri kɛ. Ni wo lon sera, Mɔɔ Dencɛ ri mira ka a gbɔngbɔn jiri kan ka a faa.»<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Wo tuma, sarakalasela kuntiiilu ni Judiya la mɔɔbakɔrɔilu wara ladɛn diya sarakalasela kuntiiba la bon na. Wo tɔɔ ko Kayifasi. <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />Ii ka i ɲɔɔn yen ka Isa mira ɲa ɲinin kewuya rɔ a faa ko rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Kɔni ii ka a fɔ ko: «an kana a mira sali waati la. Ko ni wo tɛ, mɔɔilu ri wuli ka murunti.»<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muso do ka tulu sumaduman kɛ Isa kun dɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Awa, Isa wara cɛɛ do wara Betani so kɔndɔ, cɛɛ mɛn tɔɔ ko Simɔn Kunatɔ. <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />Ka Isa siini to dɔɔnnin diya, muso do wulira ka na daa alabasitari ri, mɛn fani latikɔlɔn tulu dagbɛlɛn na. Muso wo ka latikɔlɔn tulu wo burundun Isa kun na. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Karandenilu ka wo yen tuma mɛn na, ii mɔnɛra ka a fɔ ko: «Tiɲanni ɲin kun ye nfen di? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Tulu ɲin tun di se feerela wodi ba la, ka wodi wo kɛ fantanilu dɛmɛnfen di.» <verse eid="MAT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Kɔni Isa ka wo mɛn ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Nfenna ai ye muso tɔrɔla? A ra koɲuma kɛ n yɛ, <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />baa fantanilu ye ai fɛ waati bɛɛ. Kɔni n ti nala tola ai fɛ yan haan waati bɛɛ de. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Muso ɲin ka latikɔlɔn tulu burundun n fari kan ka a rabɛn n su don kanma. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: kibaro ɲuma ɲin wa lase mɔɔilu ma yɔrɔ yɔrɔ dunuɲa rɔ yan, muso ka mɛn kɛ ɲin, wo fanan di fɔ ye, sa mɔɔilu hankili ri to ale rɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judasi ka Isa don a juuilu bolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa la karanden mɛn tɔɔ ko Judasi Sikariyɔti, wo wara sarakalasela kuntiiilu tɛrɛn ye. Judasi tɛrɛ ye Isa la karanden tan ni fila do le ri. <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />Judasi ka a fɔ sarakalasela kuntiiilu yɛ ko: «Ni n ka Isa don ai bolo, ai ri nfen di n ma?» Ii ka wodigbɛ gbanan bisawa (30) di a ma. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Ka bɔ lon wo ma, Judasi ka fɛrɛ ɲinin ka Isa don ii bolo.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ni a la karandenilu ka Taminkunna Sali kɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Nba, Buru Fununbali Sali lon fɔlɔ rɔ, Isa la karandenilu ka ii madon a la ka a maɲininka ko: «I ye a fɛ an ye Taminkunna Sali dɔɔnnin fen dabɛn i yɛ min?» <verse eid="MAT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye wa fakarisa tɛrɛn so kɔndɔ. Ai ye a fɔ a yɛ ko: ‹Karanmɔɔ ka a fɔ ko: «N na waati ra sudunya. Ko n ni n na karandenilu ri Taminkunna Sali kɛ i wara.»›» <verse eid="MAT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Isa ka mɛn fɔ, karandenilu ka a kɛ ten. Ii wara Taminkunna Sali dɔɔnnin dabɛn ye. <verse eid="MAT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Fitiri waati, a ni a la karanden tan ni fila ka ii sii dɔɔnnin diya.<verse eid="MAT 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka Judasi la janfa ko fɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Ka ii siini to dɔɔnnin na, Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «N di tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ: ai rɔ kelen di n don mɔɔ juuilu bolo.» <verse eid="MAT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Karandenilu niilafinda kosɛbɛ kuma wo kosɔn. Ii bɛɛ ka a fɔ a yɛ kelen kelen ko: «Maari, nde le wo ri wa?» <verse eid="MAT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Isa ka a fɔ ko: «N ni mɔɔ mɛn da an bolo bila fɛ kelen kɔndɔ, wo le n janfala. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Mɔɔ Dencɛ ri faa ikomin a sɛbɛni a la ko rɔ ɲa mɛn ma. Kɔni mɔɔ mɛn ye a donna mɔɔ juuilu bolo, gbalo ye wo tii yɛ. Hali ni wo tii sɔrɔnbali tun tora, wo tun ka fisa a ma paaɔn.» <verse eid="MAT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Judasi mɛn kɛtɔ Isa donna mɔɔ juuilu bolo, wo ka a fɔ Isa yɛ ko: «Karanmɔɔ, nde le wo ri wa?» Isa ka a jabi: «I jɛrɛ le kan ten.»<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maari la dɔɔnnin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Nba, ka ii to dɔɔnnin na Isa ka buru ta ka baraka bila Alla yɛ. A ka buru rakadikadi, ka a di ii ma ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye ɲin mira ka a dɔɔn. N fari le ɲin di.» <verse eid="MAT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Wo kɔ rɔ, a ka minninfen ta, rɛsɛnji ye a kɔndɔ. A ka baraka bila Alla yɛ, ka ban ka minninfen di ii ma. A ka a fɔ ko: «Ai bɛɛ ye do min a rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />N jeli le ɲin di, mɛn ye teriya sidila an tɛma. A bɔnnin mɔɔ siyaman de yɛ sa ii la kojuuilu ri makoto. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />N di a fɔ ai yɛ ko n ti nala rɛsɛnji minna butun fewu, fɔɔ n ni ai wa a kura min n Fa la mansaya rɔ lon mɛn na.»<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Piyɛri ri a fɔ ko a ma Isa lɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Awa, ii ka kalaman bɔ Alla yɛ, ka ban ka wa Olibiye Koyinkɛ kan. <verse eid="MAT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Ii seni ye, Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai bɛɛ ri ai ban n dɔ, baa a sɛbɛni ko:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 26:31">‹N di saa gbɛngbɛnna gbasi ka a faa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 26:31">saa kuru ri jɛnsɛn.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sakari suran 13 kuma diya 7</char></note><verse eid="MAT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />«Kɔni ni n wulira ka bɔ saya rɔ, n di wa ai makɔnɔ Kalile mara rɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Piyɛri ka a fɔ Isa yɛ ko: «Hali ni tɔilu bɛɛ ka i bila ka ii bori, n kɔnin tɛna i bilala habadan.» <verse eid="MAT 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Isa ka a jabi: «N di tuɲa fɔ i yɛ: bi su ɲin dɔ jɛrɛ, sani dondon ye kasi, i ri a fɔ mɔɔilu yɛ haan siɲa sawa ko i ma n lɔn.» <verse eid="MAT 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Kɔni Piyɛri ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «N tɛ a fɔ habadan ko n ma i lɔn, hali ni mɔɔilu wulira ile ni nde faala kelen di.» Karanden tɔilu bɛɛ fanan ka a fɔ ten.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka Alla tara Kɛtisemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Nba, Isa ni a la karandenilu sera yɔrɔ do rɔ, mɛn tɔɔ ko Kɛtisemani. Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye ai sii yan ka n makɔnɔ. N watɔ ɲɛfɛ dɔɔni Alla matara diya.» <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />A ka Piyɛri ni Sebede dencɛ fila kili ko ii ye wa a malɔ. Isa niilafinda, a jusu tɔrɔra kosɛbɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />A ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Jusukasi ra wara n ma. A ye ikomin n satɔ le. Ai ye mɛn yan ka ai to ɲana n fɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />A wara ɲɛfɛ dɔɔni, ka a be duu ma ka a ɲa birin. A ka Alla tara ko: «N Fa, ni a ri se bɛnna, i ye nii ɲakankatan minninfen ɲin masɛ n na, kɔni n jɛrɛ sawo kana kɛ fɔɔ i sawo.»<verse eid="MAT 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa ka a kɔsɛ ka wa karanden sawa tɛrɛn. Ii ye sunɔɔ rɔ. A ka a fɔ Piyɛri yɛ ko: «A se tɛ ai yɛ ka to ai ɲana n fɛ hali waati kelen wa? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Ai ye to ai ɲana ka Alla tara, sa ai ti nala manɛɛnna ka bila kojuu rɔ. Sika tɛ a rɔ, sɔnɔmɛ bɛnna a ma kɔni fanka tɛ faribanku la.» <verse eid="MAT 26:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Isa bɔra ii fɛ a siɲa filana rɔ ka wa Alla matara ikɔ tuun. A ka a fɔ ko: «N Fa, ni a ti se bɛnna i ye nii ɲakankatan minninfen ɲin mataa n na ko na n ma a min, wo rɔ i sawo ye kɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />A ka a kɔsɛ mɛn kɛ karandenilu ma, a ka ii tɛrɛn sunɔɔ rɔ ikɔ tuun, baa sunɔɔ ba tɛrɛ ye ii ɲa la. <verse eid="MAT 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Wo rɔ, a bɔra ii fɛ ka wa ɲɛfɛ ikɔ tuun, ka Alla tara a siɲa sawana rɔ. A tun ka mɛn fɔ kɔrɔman, a ka wo fɔ ikɔ tuun. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />A ka a kɔsɛ ka na karandenilu tɛrɛn ikɔ tuun, ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye sunɔɔ rɔ fɔlɔ ka ai ɲɔɲɔ wa? Ai ɲa lɔ, waati ra se. Sisɛn, Mɔɔ Dencɛ kɛtɔ donna kojuukɛlailu bolo. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Ai ye ai wuli, an ye wa. Mɛn di n don mɔɔ juuilu bolo, wo ra na.»<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɔɔilu nara Isa mira diya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Nba, ka Isa to kumala, Judasi sera ye, wo mɛn ye Isa la karanden tan ni fila do ri. A ni jama ba nara. Fanmuruilu ni gbelekeilu ye ii bolo. Ii kelayani sarakalasela kuntiiilu ni Judiya la mɔɔbakɔrɔilu le bolo. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Mɛn kɛtɔ Isa donna ii bolo, a tun ka tɔɔmasere yiraka ii la. A ka a fɔ ko: «N wa n ton mɛn kan ka a sunbu, wo le. Ai ye a mira.» <verse eid="MAT 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Awa, Judasi ka a madon Isa la i kɔrɔ ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Karanmɔɔ, i ni su!» A ka a ton a kan ka a sunbu. <verse eid="MAT 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Isa ka a jabi: «N duɲɔɔ, i nani mɛn kɛ kanma, i ye wo kɛ.» Wo tuma, ii ka ii kɛ Isa kan, ka a mira. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Isa la karanden do ka a la fanmuru bɔ a laa rɔ ka sarakalasela kuntiiba la jɔncɛ gbasi, ka a tolo kelen tɛɛ a la. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Isa ka a fɔ karanden wo yɛ ko: «I la fanmuru don a laa rɔ! Mɔɔ mɛn wa fanmuru mira kɛlɛkɛ kanma, wo tii fanan di faa fanmuru la. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />I ma a lɔn wa ko n di se n Fa tarala ko a ye n dɛmɛn? Ni n ka a tara ten, a ri mɛlɛka kuru tan ni fila lana n dɛmɛn kanma sisɛn. <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Kɔni ni n ka n Fa tara ten, mɛn sɛbɛni Alla la kitabu kɔndɔ, wo ri se kanbalila di? Baa a sɛbɛni ko ko ɲinilu ka kan ka kɛ ten.»<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Wo tuma, Isa ka a fɔ jama yɛ ko: «Ai nanin n mira diya gbelekeilu ni fanmuruilu ri ikomin mɔɔilu ye bɔla bɛnkaninna kanma ɲa mɛn ma. N siinin tɛrɛ mɔɔilu karanna lon lon Alla batobonba jin kɔndɔ. Ai ma n mira ye. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Kɔni kelalaselailu ka mɛnilu sɛbɛ Alla la kitabu kɔndɔ, sa woilu ye kanbali: wo le ka a kɛ, ko ɲinilu bɛɛ kɛnin ten.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:56">Isa la karandenilu bɛɛ ka a to ye ka ii bori ka wa.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ii wara Isa ri kititɛɛ dɛkuru ɲɛrɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Awa, Isa mirabailu wara a ri sarakalasela kuntiiba Kayifasi wara. Sariya karanmɔɔilu ni mɔɔbakɔrɔilu ladɛnnin tɛrɛ ye. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Ii watɔla Isa ri ye, Piyɛri bilanin tɛrɛ ii kɔ. Kɔni a tora yɔrɔ jan. A wara ten fɔɔ ka na se sarakalasela kuntiiba la lu kɔndɔ. A donda ye, ka wa a sii sarakalasela kuntiiba la bon kandanninnailu fɛ, ka a ragbɛ ko ɲin di laban ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="MAT 26:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Sarakalasela kuntiilu ni Judiya la kititɛɛla dɛkuru mɔɔilu bɛɛ tɛrɛ ye wuya kuma do ɲininna Isa kanma, mɛn di se ka kɛ a faa sababu ri. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Mɔɔ siyaman nara ka wuya fɔ ka kɛ wuya fɔla sereilu ri. Wo bɛɛ ni a ta, ladɛn mɔɔilu ma jalaki yɔrɔ sɔrɔn Isa kanma. A laban, mɔɔ fila nara ka a fɔ ko: <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />«Cɛɛ ɲin ka a fɔ ko a ri se ka Alla batobonba te, ka ban ka a lɔ ikɔ tele sawa kɔrɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Wo rɔ, sarakalasela kuntiiba wulira jama tɛma ka Isa maɲininka ko: «Mɔɔ ɲinilu ye kuma mɛnilu fɔla i ma, i tɛ woilu jabila wa?» <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Kɔni Isa ka a makun. Sarakalasela kuntiiba ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «N ye i jamarila Alla ɲenema tɔɔ rɔ ko i ye tuɲa fɔ an yɛ. Ile le ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin di wa, Alla Dencɛ kɔnin?» <verse eid="MAT 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Isa ka a jabi: «I jɛrɛ le kan ten. Kɔni n di a fɔ ai yɛ ko ai ri Mɔɔ Dencɛ siini yen Sebɛɛtii Alla bolokinin fɛ. Wo kɔ rɔ, ai ri a natɔla yen duruilu tɛma ka bɔ sankolo rɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Wo rɔ, sarakalasela kuntiiba ka a jɛrɛ la durukiba mira ka a rafara. A ka a fɔ ko: «A ra Alla tanama ko kɛ. An mako tɛ mɔɔilu la sereya la butun. Ai jɛrɛ ka a la Alla tanama kumailu mɛn. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />An ye nfen kɛ wo rɔ?» Ii bɛɛ ka a fɔ ko Isa ni saya ka kan. <verse eid="MAT 26:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Mɔɔ doilu wulira ii daji tula a ɲa rɔ, ka a gbasi ii bolokudu la, ka a tolo gbasi. <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />Ii ka a fɔ ko: «Ile, Ɲenematɔmɔnin, i ye kelaya kuma fɔ an yɛ. Mɛn ka i gbasi, wo tɔɔ fɔ an yɛ!»<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s">Piyɛri ka a fɔ ko a ma Isa lɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Awa, wo tuma Piyɛri siini tɛrɛ lu ma. Ka a to ye, jɔnmuso do ka a madon a la, ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Ile fanan tɛrɛ ye Kalileka Isa la dɛkuru rɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Kɔni Piyɛri ma sɔn wo ma mɔɔilu ɲana. A ka muso jabi: «N ma i la kuma ɲayen.» <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Piyɛri bɔra ye ka wa lu da la. Jɔnmuso gbɛrɛ ka a yen, ka a fɔ mɔɔilu yɛ ko: «Cɛɛ ɲin tɛrɛ ye Isa Nasarɛtika la dɛkuru rɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Piyɛri ma a lɔ a la. A ka a kali ko: «N ma cɛɛ wo lɔn.»<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />A ma mɛn ba kɛ, mɔɔ mɛnilu lɔni tɛrɛ ye, woilu ka a fɔ Piyɛri yɛ ko: «Sika tɛ a rɔ, i fanan ye mɔɔ woilu do le ri, baa i kumaɲa ye a yirakala ko i bɔni Kalile.» <verse eid="MAT 26:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Piyɛri ka a fɔ ko: «N ye n kalila ko n ma cɛɛ wo lɔn. Ni n ka wuya fɔ, Alla ye ko latɔn n na.» Dondon kasira i kɔrɔ. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Isa tun ka mɛn fɔ, Piyɛri hankili bilara wo rɔ, baa Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Sani dondon ye kasi bi, i ri a fɔ mɔɔilu yɛ siɲa sawa ko i ma n lɔn.» Wo rɔ, Piyɛri bɔra ye ka wa kasi kojuuya.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">Ii wara Isa ri Pilate wara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Kɛnɛ bɔ mɛn kɛni, sarakalasela kuntiilu ni Judiya la mɔɔbakɔrɔilu bɛɛ ka ai ɲɔɔn yen ka Isa faa ɲa ɲinin. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Ii ka a sidi, ka wa a ri jamanatii Pilate wara.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judasi ka a jɛrɛ faa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Nba, Judasi mɛn ka Isa don mɔɔilu bolo, wo ka a yen tuma mɛn na ko ii ka kiti labe Isa kan ko a ye faa, a nimisara. Ii nɔ wodigbɛ gbanan bisawa (30) mɛn dila a ma Isa janfa saraya la, a ka wo lasɛ sarakalasela kuntiilu ni mɔɔbakɔrɔilu ma. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />A ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «N da kojuu kɛ, baa n ka mɔɔ jalakibali don ai bolo, mɛn kɛtɔ faala.» Ii ka a fɔ ko: «Hɛn! An na ko tɛ wo rɔ. I kunko le wo ri fasayi!» <verse eid="MAT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Judasi ka wodigbɛ gbanan woilu lafili Alla batobonba kɔndɔ ye, ka wa a jɛrɛ dun julu la ka a jɛrɛ faa. <verse eid="MAT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Sarakalasela kuntiilu ka wodigbɛ gbananilu matɛɛ. Ii ka a fɔ ko: «An kana wodi ɲin bila kankira rɔ Alla batobonba kɔndɔ. Wo dahani tɛ, baa wodi ɲin ye mɔɔ jeli sɔnkɔ le ri.»<verse eid="MAT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Ii ka ɲɔɔn yen ka bɛn kan kelen ma. Wo rɔ, ii ka wodi wo ta ka bankudaa ladanna do la sɛnɛ san ko ii ri a kɛ londan kaburuso ri. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Wo le kosɔn, haan ka na se bi ma, mɔɔilu ye a fɔla sɛnɛ wo ma ko Mɔɔ Jeli Sɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Keladen fisamante Jeremiya ka mɛn fɔ fɔlɔfɔlɔ, wo dafara wo ɲa le ma. A ka a fɔ ko:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 27:9">«Ii ka wodigbɛ gbanan bisawa (30) ta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 27:9">Isirayɛlika doilu ka a fɔ ko a ni wodi jate mɛn ka kan.<verse eid="MAT 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />Ii ka wo di bankudaa ladanna la sɛnɛ sankɔya la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 27:10">ikomin Maari ka n jamari ɲa mɛn ma.»<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pilate ka Isa fɛsɛfɛsɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Wo tuma, mɔɔilu ka Isa lalɔ mara jamanatii ɲana. Kunnasiila ka a maɲininka ko: «Ile le Judiyailu la mansa ri wa?» Isa ka a fɔ ko: «I jɛrɛ le kan ten.» <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Sarakalasela kuntiilu ni mɔɔbakɔrɔilu ka a jalaki, kɔni a ma foyi fɔ. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Pilate ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Ii ra sɔn siyaman la i la. I ma wo mɛn wa?» <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Kɔni Isa ma sɔn ka jabili si di, hali kuma kelen. Wo ka Pilate kabannakoya kosɛbɛ.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pilate ka a fɔ ko Isa ye faa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Nba, jamanatii dorini kasoden kelen bilala Taminkunna Sali waati san san, jama ye a fɛ a ye mɛn bila. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Nba, wo ka cɛɛ do tɛrɛn kaso la ye, mɛn tɔɔ ko Barabasi. Wo tɔɔjuu tun da bɔ kosɛbɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Wo rɔ, jama ka ii ladɛn Pilate wara tuma mɛn na, a ka ii maɲininka ko: «Nba, ai ye a fɛ n ye mɔɔ ɲuman de bila ai yɛ? Barabasi wa, wala Isa, mɔɔilu ye a fɔla mɛn ma ko Ɲenematɔmɔnin?» <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Baa Pilate ka a lɔn ko keleya le ka a kɛ ii ka Isa don ale bolo.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Ka Pilate siini to kititɛɛ diya rɔ, a muso ka kela lawa a ma ko: «I kana i sen bila mɔɔ telenni wo la ko rɔ, baa n da tɔrɔ sibo rɔ kosɛbɛ ale le kosɔn bi.»<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Kɔni sarakalasela kuntiilu ni mɔɔbakɔrɔilu ka jama kɔndasu ko ii ye Pilate madiya ko a ye Barabasi bila ka Isa faa. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Kunnasiila ka ii maɲininka ikɔ tuun ko: «Mɔɔ fila ɲin dɔ, ai ye a fɛ n ye mɔɔ ɲuman bila ai yɛ?» Ii ka a fɔ ko: «I ye Barabasi bila.» <verse eid="MAT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilate ka ii maɲininka ko: «Ai ye a fɛ n ye nfen kɛ Isa la wo rɔ, mɔɔilu ye a fɔla mɛn ma ko Ɲenematɔmɔnin?» Ii bɛɛ ka a fɔ ko: «A ye gbɔngbɔn jiri kan ka a faa!» <verse eid="MAT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Pilate ka a fɔ ko: «Nfenna? A ka kojuu ɲuman de kɛ?» Kɔni ii ka do la ii la wɔyɔ kan kan ikɔ tuun ko: «A ye gbɔngbɔn jiri kan ka a faa!»<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Pilate ka a yen tuma mɛn na ko a la kuma tɛ foyi ɲala, ko jama muruntitɔ le, a ka ji ta ka a bolo ko jama ɲana, ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «N sen ti cɛɛ ɲin jeli labɔn ko rɔ. A ko ye ai bolo.» <verse eid="MAT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Mɔɔilu bɛɛ ka a fɔ ko: «Ale le wo ri. A jeli kunko ye be ande ni an denilu kan.»<verse eid="MAT 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Wo rɔ, a ka Barabasi bila, ka ban ka mɔɔilu lɔ Isa gbasila gbiɲɛ la. Wo kɔ rɔ, a ka Isa don tɛsidiilu bolo ko ii ye wa a gbɔngbɔn jiri kan.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kɛlɛdenilu ka Isa lafɛya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Kunnasiila la tɛsidiilu wara Isa ri mara kunnasiila la mansabolon kɔndɔ, ka tɛsidi tɔilu bɛɛ kili ko ii ye na. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Ii ka a jɛrɛ la faaninilu bɔ a kan na, ka durukiba wulenman kadikadi bila a kan na. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Ii ka nɔnbɔ bolon wɔninmailu mɔrɔmɔrɔ ii ɲɔɔn ma ka ii kɛ mansa fula munuɲa ri, ka wo birin a kun na, ka gbeleke do don a bolokinin dɔ. Wo kɛni, ii ka ii ɲɔnkin a kɔrɔ ka a lafɛya ko: «Judiyailu la mansa, an ye i fola.» <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Ii ka ii daji tu a kan, ka gbeleke mira a bolo ka a gbasi a la a kun dɔ ko siyaman. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Ii banni a lafɛyala, ii ka durukiba wulenman kadikadi bɔ a kan na, ka a jɛrɛ la faaninilu bila a kan na. Wo kɔ rɔ, ii bɔra a ri ka wa a gbɔngbɔn diya.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ii ka Isa gbɔngbɔn jiri kan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Nba, ii watɔla, ii bɛnda cɛɛ do la, mɛn tɔɔ ko Simɔn Sirɛnika. Kɛlɛdenilu ka a diyagboya ka Isa la gbɔngbɔn jiri la a kan ma. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Ii wara se yɔrɔ do rɔ, mɛn tɔɔ ko Kɔlikota. Wo kɔrɔ le ko kunkolo yɔrɔ. <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />Ii senin ye, ii ka rɛsɛnji di Isa ma, kɔ dunduji basannin mɛn na. A ka rɛsɛnji wo nɛnɛ tuma mɛn na, a ma sɔn ka a min.<verse eid="MAT 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Ii ka Isa gbɔngbɔn jiri kan tuma mɛn na, ii ka matɛɛli kɛ a la faaninilu ratalan kanma ii tɛma. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Ii banni wo bɛɛ la, ii ka ii sii ka ii janto Isa rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Ii tun ka walan do bila gbɔngbɔn jiri ma Isa kun na. A gbɔngbɔn kun sɛbɛni walan wo kan ko: «Isa le ɲin di, ni a ye Judiyailu la mansa ri.» <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Isa ni bɛnkaninnailu fila gbɔngbɔnda jiriilu kan waati kelen na. Bɛnkaninna kelen gbɔngbɔnda jiri do kan a bolokinin fɛ, a tɔ kelen a bolomaran fɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Taminbatɔilu tɛrɛ ye a nanila, ka ii kun dadɔn a kanma. <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />Ii ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Hɛn! I ma a fɔ ko i ri se Alla batobonba tela ka a lɔ ikɔ tele sawa kɔrɔ wa? I ye i jɛrɛ kisi. Ni ile le ye Alla Dencɛ ri, i ye jii ka bɔ jiri kan.» <verse eid="MAT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Wo ɲa kelen ma, sarakalasela kuntiilu ni sariya karanmɔɔilu ni mɔɔbakɔrɔilu fanan tɛrɛ ye a lafɛyala. Ii ka a fɔ ko: <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />«A ka doilu kisi, kɔni a ti se a jɛrɛ kisila. Ni a ye Isirayɛlikailu la mansa le ri, a ye jii ka bɔ jiri kan! Ni a ka wo kɛ, an di lemɛniya a ma. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />A lani Alla la. Nba, ni a la ko duman Alla yɛ, fɔɔ a ye a kisi sisɛn, baa a ka a fɔ ko: ‹N ye Alla Dencɛ le ri.›» <verse eid="MAT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Bɛnkaninna fila mɛnilu gbɔngbɔnni jiri doilu kan a dafɛ, woilu fanan tɛrɛ ye a naninna ten.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa sara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Nba, tele la telen senin, dibi donda jamana fan bɛɛ rɔ. A tora ten haan wuran tele la. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Wo tuma, Isa wɔyɔra kan ba la ko: «Eli, Eli, lama sabakatani?» Wo kɔrɔ le ko: «N Maari, n Maari. Nfenna i ra i ban n dɔ?» <verse eid="MAT 27:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Mɔɔ mɛnilu lɔni tɛrɛ ye, wo doilu ka wo mɛn ka a fɔ ko: «Cɛɛ ɲin ye Eliya le kilila.» <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Ii tɛma kelen ka a bori ka wa fuu do ta i kɔrɔ, ka a sun rɛsɛnji tintiriɲanin dɔ. A ka wo dun kala la ka a la Isa da la ko a ye a min. <verse eid="MAT 27:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Kɔni tɔilu ka a fɔ ko: «A to ten. An ye a ragbɛ, ni Eliya ri na ka a kisi.»<verse eid="MAT 27:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Isa ka kule kan ba bɔ ikɔ tuun, ka a nii di Alla ma ka sa. <verse eid="MAT 27:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Wo waati kelen, Alla batobonba tɛɛtɛɛ faanin farara fila ri ka bɔ san ma ka se duu ma. Duukolo yɛrɛyɛrɛra, farakoloilu tera. <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />Kaburuilu dalakara, mɔɔ sɛniman mɛnilu sani, wo siyaman su kununda. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Ii bɔra ii la kaburuilu kɔndɔ. Isa wulini kɔ ka bɔ saya rɔ, ii donda Jerusalɛmu, ni a ye so sɛniman di. Mɔɔ siyaman ka ii yen. <verse eid="MAT 27:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Romu tɛsidi kuntii ni tɛsidi tɔ mɛnilu ye ii jantola Isa rɔ, woilu ka duukolo yɛrɛyɛrɛ yen, ka ko kɛni woilu fanan yen. Wo rɔ, ii silanda kosɛbɛ. Ii ka a fɔ ko: «Tuɲa le, Alla Dencɛ le tɛrɛ cɛɛ ɲin di.» <verse eid="MAT 27:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Muso siyaman tora yɔrɔ jan ka ko woilu ragbɛ. Woilu ni Isa le nani kelen di ka bɔ Kalile. Ii bilanin tɛrɛ a kɔ a dɛmɛn kanma. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Mariyamu Makidalaka tɛrɛ ye muso woilu rɔ, a ni Yakuba ni Yusufu na Mariyamu, a ni Sebede muso.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa su don ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Nba, su kotɔ le tɛrɛ. Cɛɛ nanfulutii do nara, mɛn tɔɔ ko Yusufu. A bɔni Arimate. Ale fanan tɛrɛ ye Isa la karanden do le ri. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />A wara Pilate madiya ko a ye diɲɛ Yusufu ye wa Isa su ta ka a don. Pilate diɲɛra. A ka a la mɔɔilu jamari ko ii ye Isa su di Yusufu ma. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Yusufu wara Isa su ta, ka a kasanke makisali dahanin do la. <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />A wara a don kaburu kura kɔndɔ, a tun ka mɔɔilu lɔ mɛn senna farakolo rɔ a jɛrɛ yɛ. Wo kɔ rɔ, a ka kabakudun ba makurukuru ka a la kaburu da la ka wo da tuun. A banni wo la, a bɔra ye ka wa. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Mariyamu Makidalaka ni a tɔɔma Mariyamu siini tɛrɛ ka ii ɲa telen kaburu la.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Isa sara lon mɛn, wo lon tɛrɛ ye Ɲɔɲɔ Lon ɲasii lon de ri. Wo duu sa gbɛ, sarakalasela kuntiilu ni Farisiilu wulira ka wa Pilate tɛrɛn ye. <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />Ii ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Maari, an hankili ye a rɔ ko ka wuyafɔla wo to a nii la, a ka a fɔ ko tele fila a sawana a ri wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />I ye mɔɔilu lɔ kaburu kɔrɔsila fɔɔ tele sawa wa dafa, baa ni a la karandenilu wara a su ta ka a dokon, ka a fɔ mɔɔilu yɛ ko a ra wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ, wuya le wo ri juuya ka tamin fɔlɔmanta kan.» <verse eid="MAT 27:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilate ka a fɔ ko: «Kɔnɔgbɛnnailu ye ai bolo. Ai ye ii lawa ka kaburu kandan ii se ko bɛɛ la.» <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Wo rɔ, ii wara tɔɔmasere kɛ kabakudun kan, ka kɔnɔgbɛnnailu lalɔ ko ii ye kaburu kɔrɔsi koɲuma.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">Isa wulira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Ɲɔɲɔ Lon taminni kɔ, lahadi lon sɔɔma da la jonna, Mariyamu Makidalaka ni a tɔɔma Mariyamu wara kaburu ragbɛ diya. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />I kɔrɔ duukolo yɛrɛyɛrɛra fanka la, baa Maari la mɛlɛka do bɔra sankolo rɔ, ka na kabakudun bɔ kaburu da la, ka a sii kabakudun wo kan. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />A ye mɛlɛnmɛlɛnna ikomin sanfɛrɛn. A la duruki gbɛni pepe. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Mɔɔ mɛnilu tɛrɛ ye kaburu lakɔrɔsila, woilu silanda mɛlɛka yɛ kojuuya fɔɔ ka be duu ma ka kɛ ikomin mɔɔ saniilu.<verse eid="MAT 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Mɛlɛka ka a fɔ musoilu yɛ ko: «Ai kana silan. N ka a lɔn ko ai ye Isa le ɲininna, mɛn gbɔngbɔnni tɛrɛ jiri kan. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />A tɛ yan, baa a ra wuli ikomin a ka a fɔ ɲa mɛn ma. A su lani tɛrɛ yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ, ai ye na wo ragbɛ. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Wo kɔ rɔ, ai borimantɔ ye wa a fɔ a la karandenilu yɛ ko a ra wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ. Ko a watɔ ai makɔnɔla Kalile, ai ri a yen ye. A ragbɛ. N nani mɛn fɔ kanma ai yɛ, wo le wo ri.»<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Musoilu ka ii kaliya ka bɔ kaburu da la ka wa. Ii silanni, kɔni sɛwa ba tɛrɛ ye ii rɔ. Ii borimantɔ wara ka kibaro wo bɛɛ fɔ karandenilu yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Ii watɔla, Isa barara bɔla ii ɲɛfɛ ka ii labɛn. A ka a fɔ ko: «N ye ai fola.» Ii ka ii madon a la, ka a sen mira ka a bato. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai kana silan. Ai ye wa a fɔ n badenmailu yɛ ko ii ye wa Kalile. Ko ii ri n yen ye.»<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaburu la kɔrɔsibailu ka dantɛɛli mɛn kɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Ka musoilu to sila kan ka wa, kaburu kɔrɔsiba doilu wulira ka wa so kɔndɔ. Ko mɛnilu kɛni, ii wara wo bɛɛ fɔ sarakalasela kuntiilu yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Sarakalasela kuntiilu ni mɔɔbakɔrɔilu wara i ɲɔɔn yen ka kuma wo ma. Ii ban mɛn kɛni kumala, ii ka wodi siyaman di tɛsidiilu ma, <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye a fɔ mɔɔilu yɛ ko: ‹Ka an to sunɔɔ rɔ su rɔ, Isa la karandenilu nara ka a su ta ka wa a ri.› <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Ni ko ɲin fɔra mara kunnasiila yɛ, an di kuma a yɛ, ka wo kunko bɔ ai ma.» <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Tɛsidiilu ka wodi mira. A fɔra ii yɛ ɲa mɛn ma, ii wara wo kɛ. Wo rɔ, tariku wo ye fɔla Judiyailu tɛma hali bi.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa kumara karandenilu yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Awa, karanden tan ni kelen wara Kalile. Isa ka koyinkɛ mɛn ko fɔ ii yɛ, ii wara ye. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Ii ka Isa yen ye tuma mɛn na, ii ka a bato, kɔni doilu sikara. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Isa ka a madon ii la, ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Se ra di n ma fen bɛɛ kan harijeene rɔ, a ni duukolo kan. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Wo le rɔ, ai ye wa mɔɔilu kɛ n na karandenilu ri siyailu bɛɛ tɛma. Ai ye ii sun ji rɔ Fa Alla tɔɔ ni Dencɛ tɔɔ ni Nii Sɛniman tɔɔ rɔ. <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />N ka jamarili fen fen di ai ma, ai ye ii karan woilu la, sa ii ri woilu labato. Ai ɲa lɔ! N ye ai dafɛ tuma bɛɛ, fɔɔ ka wa se dunuɲa laban ma.»<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>